<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- KRX</book>
  <para style="h">ACT</para>
  <para style="toc1">Páhin pa piti pupoñapoñ pa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Páhin</para>
  <para style="mt1">Páhin pa</para>
  <para style="mt2">piti pupoñapoñ pa</para>
  <para style="imt">Waah wa weeyem wa ti púkoo eyye</para>
  <para style="ip">Ti Páhin pa piti <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa, Luk áyiin a aŋa nkasok a Teyofil naayeniye hikiicu ápiyisanoo heetaakiye ha písik ti pisilo pa piti Yéesu alacana fo ti hikuluyee ha hiti apoñapoñ a Póol <char style="w">Room</char>: eehuu púlooŋ nihitaako ti máamun sitiil 30. Yéesu ásilumo, naapoñ pupoñapoñ pa pakateyoo kaahancalool ekooŋan ya éesuume ya, neetaat ti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa lamma pale focaa ti <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char> niŋ ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> púlooŋ. Náayinananii nii Pútuun pa efipuwufanii Kunuu ka keenape ka, mpuwufan ko lompo an óo an éeyinane ti Yéesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ti oom caanak, pakati Room kayekanaayekan mah meemeeŋe fo Israyel, mah ma miti Pusuwif pa. Páawoo ñíhampaatiin Pusuwif pa kálafiit pupoñapoñ pa káputuunan ti caacaw ca citi Yéesu, payenkuu nkakallanii fo kéeyinane ka nkahancooliye pan óo pan ti púlunta pa. Háati fo, nkatowo ti káatuunan ekooŋan ya éesuume ya, nkayeno lompo íhinu weecukantee niŋ káakuuñan. Kéeyinane ka nkayeno épenanoyii meemak kamma Kunuu ka keenape ka nkiyankananii.</para>
  <para style="is">Kikee kilim</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="k">An ati Room</char>: Ayem an óo an aŋa ammeya nii, hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha hiti amansa ya enfakat a ati Room híkinkanoo-kínkan. Amansa óo amansa enfakat ati Room nasokee <char style="w">Sesaal</char>.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="k">Asuwif</char>: Pusuwif pa pakati miin ma miti <char style="w">Abraham</char>. Pútuun pa pimamalii mpiliil písiyool neyii. Ayíin óo áyiin Asuwif anakanee (Falans kaŋ nkasok “circoncis”, Ankale kaŋ nkasok “circumcised”, Emantiŋ ya nkasok “surna”) ápiyisan nii oopa ti písiyool empuu. Yéesu niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo, Pusuwif.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="k">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char>: Kikina kiyem kunuu ka kiti Pútuun pa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fa púkoo ya neekiicee fa:</para>
  <para style="io1">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="ACT 1:1-26">1:1-26</ref>
    </char> Ememanoolo ya eti pikaayu káatuunan ekooŋan ya éesuume ya.</para>
  <para style="io2">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="ACT 1:1-14">1:1-14</ref>
    </char> Eeha Yéesu naakelane ha ti hisoku.</para>
  <para style="io2">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="ACT 1:15-26">1:15-26</ref>
    </char> Aŋa eetoone ya páhin pa piti Judas.</para>
  <para style="io1">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="ACT 2:1-8:3">2:1–8:3</ref>
    </char> Káatuunan ka kiti ekooŋan ya éesuume ya Jerusalem.</para>
  <para style="io1">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="ACT 8:4-12:25">8:4–12:25</ref>
    </char> Káatuunan ka kiti ekooŋan ya éesuume ya Judaay fo Samali.</para>
  <para style="io1">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="ACT 13:1-28:31">13:1–28:31</ref>
    </char> Káatuunan ka kiti ekooŋan ya éesuume ya pan óo pan ti púlunta pa.</para>
  <para style="io2">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="ACT 13:1-14:28">13:1–14:28</ref>
    </char> Kaakaawool ka kiti Póol kíyaañ ka.</para>
  <para style="io2">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="ACT 15:1-35">15:1-35</ref>
    </char> Pucukool pa peetaakiye pa Jerusalem.</para>
  <para style="io2">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="ACT 15:36-18:22">15:36–18:22</ref>
    </char> Kaakaawool ka kiti Póol kúsupiyenu ka.</para>
  <para style="io2">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="ACT 18:23-21:17">18:23–21:17</ref>
    </char> Kaakaawool ka kiti Póol kíhaaciyenu ka.</para>
  <para style="io2">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="ACT 21:18-28:31">21:18–28:31</ref>
    </char> Hikuluyee ha hiti Póol Jerusalem, Sesaale niŋ Room.</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s">Yéesu niŋ pupoñapoñ pa pamuusal pilito pa piteyoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Teyofil eñaap ya, ti pakiical pa putoom píyaañ pa inci kamanaakaman eeha púlooŋ Yéesu náacooke ha áhin naakalaŋan <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />fo ti hinoom eeha naasilanee ha patiila. Aséepinumee, naawufan pitiyo payenka naamamale ka kapiyeno <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> ti sempe sa siti <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char>. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Pamuusal kúnuul ka fo ti eket ya eteyoo ínnayisanoolo teyii ápiyisanii picaaŋ cataŋ nii oopa kaloŋa. Kunoom áwii ésupak (40) ápinafulii teyii náakupii kiti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Hikee hinoom, ta naayeniye ta hili neyii naasokii: “Timpi níful <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, pale nítuul eeha Paapaa ya náayinanane ha nii afaawufan ho aluu, kawun enka inci íntuunane ka aluu. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Kaatuko <char style="w">Saŋ</char> <char style="w" lemma="pátise">ápatiseyaa-pátise</char> pakan paka niŋ man pale le niŋ kunoom éfinihinee pátise niŋ Kunuu ka keenape ka.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pisilo pa piti Yéesu hátikin pupoñapoñ pa pakateyoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Fiye, keeyeniye ka niŋ Yéesu nkayeniyoo kacakan: “<char style="w">Ateeteyo</char>, fo tokofiye ankaakaay éñahanii cáwii ca citi <char style="w">Israyel</char>?” <verse eid="ACT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Nisoolahut kameye teyme niŋ eeheyme hinoom enkuu fiye púlooŋ nkikaakaay ékey. Paapaa atuunaa asiiŋane ho akina lamayoo ataake kayine kiti kaasiiŋan eteeho. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Pale aluu, ta <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkikaakaay ta éwanoonii ti aluu, efinisa sempe. Fiyuu, aluu keetantake ka eloŋ ya etoom, innikaakaay káakup kutoom ti saatee ya eti <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Judaay</char> púlooŋ niŋ <char style="w">Samali</char>, niŋ pan óo pan ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>.”<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Ta naapaye ta káakup eehe, naasilanee patiila ti ñíkin <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa pakateyoo. Púful toko, káatiŋu nkiyoloo, nekacukutoo. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Pale akina ti pikaayu pa, nkatowo ti kaasincan caw patiila. Tokotoko, pákayiin pákasupak keewasiye wañ weehiina nkasiiŋo pukolii. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />Nkasokii: “Aluu pakati Galilee, weyme innitowiye le ti kaasincan patiila? Yéesu aŋe, eecoopee ya taaluu naasilanee patiila, samat nii fa innicukoo fa naakaaye, fo lompo naakaakaay éñohoonii.” <figure style="fig" alt="la monté de Jésus" file="GW 135.jpg" size="col" loc="1:9-11" copy="Wade NT" ref="1:11">Pisilo pa piti Yéesu</figure><verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kayoŋ ka kiti pupoñapoñ pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Fiye, <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa nkáfulii pati cítintiŋ ca enca nkasok ca Olif, nkañoho <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>. Láaŋoolut niŋ saatee ya eti Jerusalem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta Luk naakiice ta eehuu, asok nii, pututa Jerusalem niŋ cítintiŋ ca yeniye “kasapal kiti hinoom hiti kayeno”. Ti oom caanak, <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa kasok nii, an añaŋut kasapal fo kilomeetal yoonool ti <char style="w">hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</char>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Ta nkacole ta nkasilo ti ékaap ya la nkasale la piyeno. Keeyeniye ka toko kayem <char style="w">Piyeer</char>, <char style="w">Saŋ</char>, <char style="w">Saak</char> niŋ Andre, <char style="w">Filip</char> niŋ Tomas, Paatolomaay niŋ Máciya, Saak ati Alifaay, Simon aŋa nkasok a Selot<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Selot, ti caanak ca citi Yéesu, yenaayeno kayoŋ keeyeniye esuum kiti mah ma miteyii.</char></note> niŋ Yutas ati Saak. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Poko púlooŋ nkacokool piliit tiw nkásiyool ti kaluum tan óo tan, poko niŋ pakaal paka niŋ <char style="w">Mari</char> Yéesu íññaa ateyoo niŋ Yéesu pakatuwoo.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kamamalee ka kiti Maciyas apinanf pupoñapoñ pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Hikee hinoom, kéeyinane ka nkaconcool máamun keme niŋ áwii (120). <char style="w">Piyeer</char> naasiiŋo naasokii: <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“Aluu pakanam ti káyinan, eeha <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkútuunane ha ta infiyye ti <char style="w" lemma="Hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa">pakiical pa piti Pútuun pa</char> fo hitaako: nkúkup ti putum amansa ya <char style="w">Dawid</char> kiti Judas, éenowii ya hátikin kéekeyii ka hicoku Yéesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Judas oonool hínum tuunaa, naayeno lompo páhin nuunaa.” <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />(Mañ emma nkacooyoo ma ápihin heenaput eehuu naacoope apunoom kaakit, toko naanowe hikawoo hipiya, eniinoo néefap, niñowoo ínnilutoonii. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Eehuu, pakati <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> púlooŋ kásiyaasi ho ekina ewune nkasok kaakit enkuu “Hakeletama” ti kaŋ ya eteyii, ekina eyem “Kaakit kiti hísim”.)<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Piyeer nene asok: “Kiiceekiic ti pakiical pa piti kícimu ka nii:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">
    <char style="qt">'Alímaati ekumpaan ya eteyoo ekatanee,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">
    <char style="qt">álimaati an timpi akin teyyo.'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:26">Kícimu 69:26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
  </para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:20">“Inkiicee lompo nii:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">
    <char style="qt">'Alímaati akee atoon páhin pa piteyoo.'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 109:8">Kícimu 109:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="ACT 1:20" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21-22" />“Ooto, fo akee ánanfii toonii kati akaman lompo pilito pa piti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Yéesu. Oom áyiin añaŋaa éfulii ti payenka nkanapool ka niŋ unii tan óo tan ta nuuyeniye ta kaamuusool ti mah ma niŋ Ateeteyo Yéesu, písik ta <char style="w">Saŋ</char> náahinoo ta <char style="w">pátise</char> fo ta náaseepinee ta toonii.” <verse eid="ACT 1:21-22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Ta Piyeer naapaye ta káakup, nkácoopii pákayiin pákasupak: Josef aŋa nkasok a Palasapas, nkayonkaloo lompo Yustus, niŋ Maciyas. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Púful toko, kayoŋ ka nkuluum fiye: “Ateeteyo, awe meya saan pakan paka, yísan unii ayme ti poko t’ésupakii ammamale <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />apiyeno apoñapoñ naacoop páhin empa Judas naakate pa le apite akaay pa naañaŋe pa piyeno.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Nkañak kaakaaw nkucok Maciyas apinanf <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa ŋaasuwan niŋ oonool a.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Ewánoonii ya eti Kunuu ka keenape ka ti kéeyinane ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Ta pahaaño pa piti Pentekos<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pentekos, ekina eyem hinoom ha eeha <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkáhin ha teeho pahaaño pa piti kaamaañ ka. Néhineehin loho pahaaño pa piti <char style="w">Himuusu ha</char> pitaakaa kunoom áwii ésupak niŋ ŋaasuwan (50). Efúlii 23:16; 34.22; Lewitik 23:15-21; Kakaman 16:9-12.</char></note> mpútuuniye ta, kéeyinane ka ti Yéesu púlooŋ nkayeno nantoonool. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Tokotoko pahampanane mpúfulii patiila samat nii pasapal hiyam heehiñe. Pahampanane empuu mpimeeŋan ekumpaan ya púlooŋ eyya nkayeniye ya teyyo. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Ti oom káasiiŋuma, waah núufulii teyii weecuke nii kíleeluuf kiti seemak, nkihancaloolo nkinaŋo ti an óo an teyii. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Poko púlooŋ nkameeŋ niŋ <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkáyaañ káakup niŋ pikee pikaŋ samat nii fa Kunuu ka keenape ka nkuwufanii fa.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Fiye, intaako toko <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> kéefulii ti mah ma púlooŋ miti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> nkayeno <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>. Nkayeno pákayiin keefeye Pútuun. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Ta nkásiye ta pahampanane empuu, kayoŋ kenfakat nkuconcool. Innímii kamma an óo an teyii náasiye pinapana pa pakati Yéesu nkayeniye káakup ti híleeluufuyoo eeha náacuuwe ha. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Nkaŋaŋo ínnimii nkacakan: “Fo keeyem ka fiye púlooŋ ti káakup pakati Galilee tom? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Weyme uwune an óo an tuunaa púlooŋ náayemiyii ti hísiyu ti híleeluufuyoo eeha náacuuwe ha? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Unaa kéefuliyaa ka Paat, Meti niŋ Elam; pakan kéefulii Mesopotami, <char style="w">Judaay</char> niŋ Kapatos; pakan kéefulii Pont niŋ Asii, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />kéefulii Filiki niŋ Panfili, kéefulii <char style="w">Esipt</char> niŋ misaatee ma miti Libiya meekole ma saatee ya eti Silen. Pakakee tuunaa nkáfulii <char style="w">Room</char>, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />Kilet niŋ Arabiya, pakakee paka Pusuwif, pakakee paka lompo keeyesane eloŋ ya eteyii nkananf ti pítin pa piti Pusuwif pa. Pale unaa púlooŋ núusiyii ti káakup ti kíleeluuf unaa enka núucuuwaa ka ti kakaman waah wa wenfakat wa weemeeŋe wa ewwa Pútuun pa mpíhine wa!” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Nkaliim meemak ínnimii, nkatowo ti ecakanoolo: “Eehe weyme níhiyisane?” <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Pale pakakee paka nkápalahool kéeyinane ka ti Yéesu nkalenkenii nkasok: “Payenkuu kákumanaakuman!”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káyisan ka kiti Piyeer ayme ayem Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Púful toko, <char style="w">Piyeer</char> naasiiŋo niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa ŋaasuwan niŋ oonool a. Ti hiceeku, náayaañ káakup niŋ kayoŋ ka apusok: “Aluu pakanam <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa niŋ aluu púlooŋ keekine ka <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> nísiitanam pinap, inci pikaman aluu heeyem ha ti pitaako. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Pakan paka payenke kákumanut samat nii fa ínninunkoole fa, cicomaacomo. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Haani! Pale eehe <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya Sowel náatuunane:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />
    <char style="qt">'Pútuun pa pusok: "Ti kunoom ka kikelan ka,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">
    <char style="qt">inci fawwufan <char style="w" lemma="Kunuu ka keenape ka">kunuuwam</char> an óo an.</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">
    <char style="qt">Epuuk aluu pikampaani niŋ púmaacul efinkayaamakool ti caacawam,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">
    <char style="qt">uhiineen wa niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakataaluu éfinkayawut, nkacuk lompo waah pucuk fiye nii éyawut nkayaake.</char>
    <verse eid="ACT 2:17" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />
    <char style="qt">Ee, háati pimiikan pa pakatoom, pákayiin paka niŋ pakaal paka,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">
    <char style="qt">inci fawwufanii kunuuwam ti kunoom enkuu,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">
    <char style="qt">efinkayaamakool ti caacawam.</char>
    <verse eid="ACT 2:18" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />
    <char style="qt">Fáhin waah weecukantee nuucukee patiila,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">
    <char style="qt">ínhin hícump píyisan penfakat t’etaam.</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">
    <char style="qt">Fataako hísim, seemak niŋ útiŋu uti háaputa.</char>
    <verse eid="ACT 2:19" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />
    <char style="qt">Caanak ca éficinim,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">
    <char style="qt">hiim ha níhicunk nii hísim</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">
    <char style="qt">le niŋ hinoom ha heemaka ha henfakat ha hiti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa éfihicolii.</char>
    <verse eid="ACT 2:20" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />
    <char style="qt">Tempo an óo an eeluume</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:21">
    <char style="qt">ti caacaw <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa afaafakanee."'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 3:1-5">Sowel 3:1-5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <figure style="fig" alt="Le discours de Pierre devant la foule, le jour de la Pentecote" file="GW 140.jpg" size="col" loc="2:14-36" copy="Wade NT" ref="2:21">Káakup ka kiti Piyeer hátikin kayoŋ ka ti hinoom ha hiti Pentekos</figure>
    <verse eid="ACT 2:21" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />“Aluu pakati <char style="w">Israyel</char>, nísiitan pinap eeha inci inkaakaay ha aluu hisoku: Yéesu ati Naasalet akina an aŋa innimeya nii Pútuun pa umpa neyoo kaatuko puwufanoowufan íhinu hátikin aluu waah wenfakat, hícump píyisan niŋ weecukantee samat nii fa innimeya wo fa aluu himuum aluu. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Yéesu aŋe acokeecok naawufanee aluu samat nii fa Pútuun pa mpílafiye fa, pikina peemeya pa eehuu púlooŋ hítaakumo. Aluu nimukoo, ta inniwufanoo ta píhina heenaput ha kapipempeŋoo ti <char style="w">kuluwaa</char> ya. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Pale Pútuun pa mpúfulanoo ti kúnuul ka kiti eket ya, mpíñahaniyoo ti eloŋ ya, kaatuko eket ya etaakut sempe teyoo. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" /><char style="w">Dawid</char> naasok kiteyoo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">
    <char style="qt">'Inci incukcuk Ateeteyo Pútuun pa hátikinam tan óo tan.</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">
    <char style="qt">Kaatuko oopa niŋ inci,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">
    <char style="qt">ancuk etikikilan.</char>
    <verse eid="ACT 2:25" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />
    <char style="qt">Ekina ewune yaanam neemon, inci oopa ti caacook niŋ pásuuma.</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">
    <char style="qt">Háati eniinam lompo éfeewaayeen kamma inci ínhine cíki.</char>
    <verse eid="ACT 2:26" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />
    <char style="qt">Kaatuko awe Pútuun aatikatam piyeno pati keekete ka,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">
    <char style="qt">aatikat enii amiikan a atii eenape ya epufut ti hiyaak.</char>
    <verse eid="ACT 2:27" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />
    <char style="qt">Aáyisanaam-yísan ñítin ña ñeekaaye ña pati eloŋ ya,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">
    <char style="qt">aafameeŋanam niŋ pásuuma hátikini.'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:8-11">Kícimu 16:8-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="ACT 2:28" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />“Aluu pakanam, inci púkup naaluu niŋ híyiinate kiti maamaa atuunaa amansa ya Dawid. Aketaaket naahokee, fo fíyooy hiyaak ha hiteyoo hoopuha le tuunaa. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Pale Dawid ayenaayeno ayaamakoola, náameyi eeha Pútuun pa mpisintooliye ha teyoo nii éfipufulanii ti miin ma miteyoo amansa samat nii akina. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Dawid naacuk eeha Pútuun pa mpikaakaay ha íhinu hátikin, náakup kiti pilito pa piti <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa, ta naasoke ta nii akatutee pati keekete ka, eniinoo lompo efutut ti hiyaak ha. <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Yéesu aŋe Pútuun pa mpilitane ti eket ya, unii púlooŋ utantake ho. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Naasilanee ti epees yáali eti Pútuun pa Paapaa ateyoo, mpuwufanoo <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> samat nii fa mpusokoo fa. Aŋe inniyem ya fiye ti hicuku ínnisi ekina eyem kawun etempo enka mpíniisii ka toonii. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Dawid himuumoo asiliit alacana pale naasok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">
    <char style="qt">'Ateeteyo Pútuun pa púkupaakup niŋ Ateeteyo atoom ti hisoku:</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">
    <char style="qt">"Kéy yeniyam epees yáali,</char>
    <verse eid="ACT 2:34" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />
    <char style="qt">fo ta inci fatah ta pikamooli ti wooti ayyeno amansa ya ateyii."'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Kícimu 110:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="ACT 2:35" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />“Fiye aluu pakati <char style="w">Israyel</char> púlooŋ niñaŋaa kameye eehe pánipani, Yéesu aŋe, aŋa innipempeŋe ya ti kuluwaa ya, Pútuun pa píhinoo apiyeno Ateeteyo niŋ lompo Eenucee ya.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Ta pakan paka nkásiye ta eehe, ínciitiyii meemak nkacakan Piyeer niŋ pakakee pupoñapoñ pa, “Aluu pakan unii, puume nuuñaŋe íhinu?” <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Piyeer naañahanii: “Níwunko umuuyen wa utaaluu, an óo an ti aluu náahinee <char style="w">pátise</char> ti caacaw ca citi Yéesu Krista, ancuk umuuyen wa utaaluu nuuponketee, Pútuun pa mpuwun aluu Kunuu ka keenape ka. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Kaatuko Pútuun pa píyinananaa-yínanan nii efipuwufan ko aluu niŋ epuuk aluu niŋ lompo keekine ka pílaaŋ, focaa payenka púlooŋ Ateeteyo Pútuun pa putuunaa mpikaakaay ka éyonkalii.”<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Piyeer naapenanii kunuu niŋ kikee kilim keemeeŋe, naaŋiiniyii ti hisoku: “Nifakan faŋ aluu ti <char style="w">ekaay</char> eenaput eyye!” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Keecoone ka hilim ha hiti Piyeer nkáhinee pátise, máamun pakan síwuli síhaaciil (3,000) nkananf ti oom hinoom kéeyinane ka.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eloŋ ya éeyeeni ya eti kéeyinane ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Kéeyinane ka nkákipen ti káasiitan eeha <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa nkakalaŋanii ha; nkákipen lompo ti pucokool piliit, ti káapaacinool kúmpuul<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kasalaasal hili nantoonool. Ti keemeya ka hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa, hícump níhimiilool nii, nkapayaa hili, nkafiitool kúmpuul nkápaacinool ko samat nii fa Yéesu náahine fa ti káciim ka kiteyoo kikelan ka enka naataake ka niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo le niŋ paketaloo (22:7 – 23).</char></note> niŋ ti kaluum. <verse eid="ACT 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />An óo an naameeŋ niŋ ewatate, kamma Pútuun pa mpíhine hícump píyisan niŋ weecukantee wéenapii ti pupoñapoñ pa. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Kéeyinane ka púlooŋ nkacokool, nkápaacinool waah óo waah ewwa nkataake. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Pikee pa, nkanooman pitaam pa piteyii niŋ hitaaku ha hiteyii, nkápaacinool mañ ma, nkawufan an óo an fa naasoolahe. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Hinak óo hinak nkaconcool ti hank ha hiti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>, nkápaacinool kúmpuul ti pukumpaan pa piteyii, nkali nantoonool niŋ pásuuma, an péemakiyanooliit. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Nkanimpan Pútuun pa, pakan paka púlooŋ nkálafiyii. Hinak óo hinak <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> napenan ti kayoŋ ka kiteyii pakan keefakanee.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Káakuuñan ka kiti éehute ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Hikee hinoom, máamun sitalaŋ síhaaciil, ta kaluum ka nkúlohanii ta, <char style="w">Piyeer</char> niŋ <char style="w">Saŋ</char> nkayeno pikaayu lati hank ha hiti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char> kaluum. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Pacolalii, pakan nkayeno hicoopu áyiin éehute kápiliŋ ta naapukee. Hinak óo hinak nkacoopoo nkayenanoo lati putum pa empa nkasok pa Putum pa Peewalla pa kati naluumatool ti keeyem ka ti pinako ti hank ha hiti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Ta naacuke ta Piyeer niŋ Saŋ ti pinako, naaluumii mañ. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Piyeer niŋ Saŋ nkasincanoo caw, Piyeer naasokoo: “Sincan unii!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Eéhute ya naasincanii púsooni pucukoo nii efikawufanoo waah. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Pale Piyeer naasokoo: “Inci taakut mañ niŋ sanoo, pale aŋa inci intaake ya inci fawufani; ti caacaw ca citi Yéesu Krista ati Naasalet lito inkaay!” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Púful toko, Piyeer naacokoo ti epees yáali, náasisikanoo apilito. Tokotoko woot éehute ya núuyankii kaŋ. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Naalito niŋ hinuutu náayaañ pikaayu. Naanako niŋ Piyeer niŋ Saŋ ti hank ha hiti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya, naakaay naanuut, naanimpan Pútuun pa.<verse eid="ACT 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Keeyeniye ka toko púlooŋ nkacukoo ti pikaayu nkásiyoo ti kaanimpan Pútuun pa. <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />Ta nkakiiwe ta nii akina ayem aluumatoola ya éehute ya, aŋa nkaloom ya hicuku naayeniye lati Putum pa Peewalla pa piti hank ha hiti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya, nkaŋaŋo ínnimii ti heetaakiyoo ha. <figure style="fig" alt="Pierre aide l’handicapé qu’il a guéri à se tenir debout" file="GW 142.jpg" size="col" loc="3:7-10" copy="Wade NT" ref="3:10">Piyeer náasisikan éehute ya aŋa náakuuñane ya apilito</figure><verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káatuunan ka kiti Piyeer heeñaŋe ha pitaako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Páawoo áyiin a aŋuu akatanut <char style="w">Piyeer</char> niŋ <char style="w">Saŋ</char>, pakan paka púlooŋ nkaŋaŋo nkatey ti coonool kaputookii lati címpaŋ ya eyya nkasok ya Címpaŋ eti <char style="w">Solomon</char>. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Piyeer apucuk eehuu naasok kayoŋ ka: “Aluu pakati <char style="w">Israyel</char>, weyme uwune eehuu níhinim aluu? Weyme innikent unii? Fo cukaacuk aluu nii úhinaahin áyiin a aŋe ápiyini pikaayu kamma sempe unii niŋ fotom kamma nuuwufane meemak eloŋ ya etoonii Pútuun pa? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Pútuun pa piti <char style="w">Abraham</char>, <char style="w">Pútuun pa piti Isaak</char> niŋ Pútuun pa piti <char style="w">Jakob</char> niŋ piti símaama unaa, pínapiyanaa-nápiyan amiikan a atempo Yéesu. Aluu inniwufanoo ñíhampaatiin ña apumukee ínnilaacinoo hátikin <char style="w">Pilaat</char> apan Pilaat hínum álafiyoolafi kakatan. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Innipook Eesampanee ya <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">Naacoonool</char> inniluum Pilaat apikatan aluu amukala pakan. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Fiyuu innimuke ati eloŋ ya, pale Pútuun pa mpilitanoo ti eket ya. Unii payenke keetantake ho. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Caacaw ca citi Yéesu niŋ káyinan ti caacawoo, kikina kuwune áyiin aŋe innicuke ya innikiiwoo náahinee ápiyini pikaayu. Káyinan ka ti Yéesu kúkuuñanoo samat nii eeha innicuke ha aluu púlooŋ.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />“Fiye, aluu pakanam, inci meya nii aluu niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakataaluu, ti káameyaati ínnihine eehuu Yéesu. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Pale Pútuun pa pusokaasok ta infiyye nii <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ateyoo afaakallo. Eehuu mpusoke ti ñutum <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa púlooŋ, hikina hitaakiye. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Ooto níwunko umuuyen wa utaaluu ínniñohoonii peti Pútuun pa, ancuk puponketaa aluu. <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />Niŋ níhinaa fo, <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa efipuwufan aluu kunoom kiti éyekunoolo, éfipupoñii lompo Yéesu, Eenucee ya aŋa mpimamale ya aluu ta infiyye. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Fo Yéesu ayeno alacana fo ta Pútuun pa éfipihin waah óo waah nene úpuyenoonii wéeyeeni samat nii fa mpusoke ho fa ta infiyye ti ñutum piyaamakoola pa keesampanee ka. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Pánipani, <char style="w">Móyiis</char> asok: 'Ateeteyo Pútuun pa éfipupoñii aluu ayaamakoola samat nii inci, afaayeno an éefulii ti pakan aluu. Nísiitan púsooni ti waah óo waah ewwa naakaakaay aluu hisoku. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />An óo an éesiitanut ayaamakoola ya aŋuu, áfaafulanee ti miin ma miti Pútuun pa naamukee.'<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:29">Lewitik 23:29</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:15">Kakaman 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:19">19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Piyaamakoola pa púlooŋ písik ti Samiyel focaa ti kéenowii ka teyoo kákupaakup kiti hinoom eehuu. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Kilim enka Pútuun pa mpusoke ka piyaamakoola pa, kilim kitaaluu pakanii, focaa <char style="w">písiyool</char> empa Pútuun pa mpiliile pa ti pututa etempo niŋ símaama unaa, ta mpusoke ta Abraham: 'Inci fasampan miin óo miin t’etaam, kaasampan enkuu éfikinapii ti papukali.'<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:18">Púcook 22:18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:4">26:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Ta Pútuun pa mpúcoopii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ fotom: “Ta Pútuun pa mpilitane ta Yéesu amiikan etempo ti eket ya,”</char></note> ta Yéesu amiikan etempo, ti aluu pakati Israyel mpíyaañe pupoñoo, kati níwunko páhinal pa pitaaluu peenaput pa. Ti páhinal empuu efinisampanee.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Kacakanee ka kiti kayine ka kiti Piyeer niŋ Saŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />
    <char style="w">Piyeer</char> niŋ <char style="w">Saŋ</char> ti káakup niŋ pakan paka, <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ áhampaatiin a ati pufaasa pa pakati <char style="w" lemma="Ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya</char> niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Asatusaay">Pusatusaay</char> pa nkácolii. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Inseeñii meemak kamma Piyeer niŋ Saŋ nkayeniye kakalaŋan pakan paka niŋ káatuunan nii, páawoo Yéesu alitaalito ti eket ya, úmeyiyaameyi nii keekete ka lompo éfikayini élitoonii. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Fiye, nkacokii nkakulii fo eti kacom eteyyo kamma ínciniimiye. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Pale hícump ti kéesiye ka hilim ha hiti Piyeer niŋ Saŋ nkáyinan. Pákayiin paka púlooŋ kéeyinane ka ti Yéesu kayema máamun síwuli isak (5,000).<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Eti kacom eteyyo, pakati kikaw ka pakati <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa, ñíhampaatiin ña niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Móyiis nkaconcool <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Intaako toko Annas, awaaseena ya enfakat a ati Pútuun pa, intaako toko lompo Kayif, <char style="w">Saŋ</char>, Aliksant niŋ pakakee pakati miin ma miti awaaseena ya enfakat a. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Nkapoñ kápucoopii <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa pákasupak paka hátikinii. Nkacakanii: “Ti enseyme sempe niŋ ekina tom ti enceyme caacaw ínnihine káakuuñan enke?” <verse eid="ACT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Piyeer naameeŋ niŋ <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> naasokii: “Aluu pakati kikaw ka pakati Pusuwif pa niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña: <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Kaacakanool unii fíyooy inniyaake ti heenape ha eeha núuhine ha éehute ya, innicakan unii lompo puume náakuuñanee. <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />Ee, niñaŋaa kameye eehe, aluu fiye púlooŋ niŋ kayoŋ ka púlooŋ kiti <char style="w">Israyel</char>: Ti caacaw Yéesu Krista ati Naasalet, aŋa aluu innipempeŋe ya ti <char style="w">kuluwaa</char> ya pale Pútuun pa mpílitaniyoo ti keekete ka, ti caacawoo áyiin a aŋe naasiiŋiye hátikin aluu kásuumaayoo. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Yéesu akina ayem aŋa <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> nihisoke ha kiteyoo nii énankiin ya eyya aluu puluta pa ínnitine ya éyenoonii énankiin ya eehaŋe ya hitaaku nafaa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Kícimu 118:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />“Akina lamayoo ayina unaa kafakan. Kaatuko ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> fiye púlooŋ Pútuun pa puwufanut pakan paka cikee caacaw kati cifakan unaa.” <verse eid="ACT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Innímii ta nkásiye ta Piyeer niŋ Saŋ ti káakup niŋ híyiinate apan pakan kenseŋ keekalaŋut. Nkápannum nii Piyeer niŋ Saŋ kayenaayeno niŋ Yéesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Pale kamma nkacuke éekuuñanee ya naasiiŋiye pukol pupoñapoñ pa pákasupak paka, kataakut eeha efikañahan. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Fiye, nkawufan hilim Piyeer niŋ Saŋ kápuful ti éhinuma kíiti ya, nkayeno piteŋenool. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Nkasok: “Puume éfuuhinaa pakan paka payenke? Kaatuko káhinaahin heecukantee henfakat, pakati Jerusalem fiye púlooŋ kámeyimeyi ho, uyinaataa ho káalaacin. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Pale uñaŋaa kaafitanool eehe, timpi ihaŋ toko nihihancalooliye. Efuufeyanoolii núukupananii timpi kákup niŋ pakan paka ti caacaw Yéesu.”<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Nene káyonkalii Piyeer niŋ Saŋ nkakitii káakup niŋ kakalaŋan cántum ti caacaw Yéesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Pale Piyeer niŋ Saŋ nkañahanii: “Eeheyme hicoonoole hátikin Pútuun pa, káasiitan aluu fo káasiitan etempo? Anti nisok unii! <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Kaatuko uyinaat kaafatanool niŋ eeha nuucuke ha núusi.” <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Nkafeyanoolii púsooni nkakatanii kaatuko kámiit fa efikasiiŋanii ti pisiya peelitanut pítaakool kamma pakan paka púlooŋ nkayeniye hímulu Pútuun pa ti heetaakiye ha. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Kaatuko áyiin a eetaake ya káakuuñan ka keetaapala kucukee enkuu ahaŋaahaŋ sitiil áwii ésupak (40).<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaluum ka kiti kéeyinane ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />
    <char style="w">Piyeer</char> niŋ <char style="w">Saŋ</char>, ta nkakatanee ta, nkañoho pati pakanii ti káyinan nkakamanii púlooŋ eeha <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">puwaaseena pa kenfakat ka pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña nkasoke ha. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Mpásiyalii eehe, poko púlooŋ nkananfool ti kaluum Pútuun pa nkasok: “<char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun, awe liile patiila niŋ t’etaam niŋ waah óo waah weeyem toko, illiil lompo kaatii ka niŋ waah óo waah weeyem lupo. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Niŋ <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> ántunke ta infiyye maamaa atuunaa <char style="w">Dawid</char>, amiikan a atii, kati asok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">
    <char style="qt">'Weyme uwune <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char> kiiñii nkili meemak?</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">
    <char style="qt">Weyme uwune nkaconcoolo kati kateŋenool kenseŋ?</char>
    <verse eid="ACT 4:25" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />
    <char style="qt">Pumansa pa pakati <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> niŋ pakati kikaw ka</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">
    <char style="qt">kaconcoolaa-concoolo nkasiiŋo kati kakam</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">
    <char style="qt">niŋ Ateeteyo Pútuun pa,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">
    <char style="qt">niŋ lompo <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> atempo.'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:1">Kícimu 2:1</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 2:2">2</ref></char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="ACT 4:26" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />“Kaatuko pánipani, fiyuu intaakiye ti saatee eyye, <char style="w">Helot</char> niŋ Pons <char style="w">Pilaat</char> nkaconcoolo niŋ keeneetaat ka Pusuwif niŋ pakati <char style="w">Israyel</char> kapupook Yéesu, amiikan a atii eesampanee ya aŋa annuce ya. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Ancuk káhinaa eeha ansoke ha ta infiyye nii efihitaako ti sempe sa sitii niŋ fa állafiye fa. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Fiye, Ateeteyo, sincan fa nkayem fa unii ti kaafeyanool, iyyankanan unii pimiikan pa pakatii úpukup hilim ha hitii niŋ híyiinate henfakat. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Yísan unii sempe sa sitii, ancuk ti caacaw Yéesu amiikan a atii eesampanee ya, álimaati hícump píyisan niŋ weecukantee utaako, púkuuña pa lompo nkákuuñanee.”<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Ta nkapaye ta kaluum, la nkaconcoole la íyyiyiŋan. Poko púlooŋ nkameeŋ niŋ Kunuu ka keenape ka nkayeno káatuunan <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> niŋ híyiinate.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pucokool pa piti kéeyinane ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Kayoŋ ka púlooŋ kiti kéeyinane ka nkiyeno pakoonool ti kunuu niŋ ti pámiiloolal. An óo an naacok faŋoo nii aŋa naataake ya eteyoo tom, nkápaacinool waah óo waah ewwa nkataake. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Niŋ sempe senfakat <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa nkayeniye káatuunan eeha nkacuke ha ti hisoku nii, <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Yéesu alitaalito ti eket ya. Poko púlooŋ, Pútuun pa mpisampanii meemak. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Taakut teyii an eesoolahe waah. Kaatuko keetaake ka pitaam, niŋ ekina tom pukumpaan nkanooman-nooman po nkácoopii mañ ma <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />nkañaakan mo pupoñapoñ pa. Poko, nkápaacinool mo ti an óo an fa naasoolahe fa.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Intaako toko áyiin aŋa nkasok Josef. Pupoñapoñ pa nkayonkaloo Barnabas, caacaw encuu ciyem: “An aŋa náhaañiyan pakan paka.” Barnabas ati miin ma miti Lewi, náafulii ti econ eyya nkasok Siip. <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />Naataak etaam eyya naanoomane, náacoopii mañ ma naañaakan mo pupoñapoñ pa.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Eket ya eti Anañas niŋ aaloo Safila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Fiye, intaako toko áyiin aŋa nkasok Anañas, akina niŋ aaloo Safila nkanooman ti etaam ya eteyii. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Anañas náasiyool niŋ aaloo kapimank mikee mañ ma. Náacoopii mikee mañ ma apuwufan mo <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Fiye, <char style="w">Piyeer</char> naasokoo: “Anañas, puume <char style="w">Seetaani</char> neenakiye yaani incaam hátikin <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char>, immank ti faŋi mikee mañ ma? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Fo etaam ya etii tom le niŋ aafanooman yo? Ta annoomane yo ta lompo fo mañ ma miyeniit ti sipeesi? Weyme uwune ímmiilool íhinu eehuu? Aacaamut pakan paka pale Pútuun pa ancaame.”<verse eid="ACT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Ta náasiye ta kilim enkuu, Anañas naanow naaket. Kéesiye ho ka fiye púlooŋ nkameeŋ niŋ ewatate enfakat. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Pikampaani pa nkákey nkakuup ehunuŋ ya, íncakahokii yo.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Máamun sitalaŋ síhaaciil sipimuus, aaloo náanakoonii péemiit heetaakiye ha áyiinoo. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Piyeer naacakanoo: “Sokam, ti soŋ eyye inninoomane etaam ya etaaluu?” Naañahanoo: “Ee, soŋ eyyuu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Fiye, Piyeer naasokoo: “Weyme uwune awe niŋ áyiini innicoon puwinko Kunuu ka kiti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char>? Sincan! Kéehokii ka áyiini ahaayii ti putum pa efi lompo kacoopi.” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Tokotoko aal a naanow naaket ti woot Piyeer. Pikampaani pa kápinakoonii nkacukoo naakete nkacoopoo íncakahokiyoo pukol áyiinoo. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Kéeyinane ka púlooŋ niŋ kéesiye ho ka púlooŋ nkameeŋ niŋ ewatate enfakat. <figure style="fig" alt="le soulevement du corps de Ananias" file="GW 148.jpg" size="col" loc="5:5-11" copy="Wade NT" ref="5:11">Káaseepin ehunuŋ ya eti Anañas</figure><verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hícump heecukantee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">Pupoñapoñ</char> pa nkáhin hícump píyisan niŋ weecukantee hátikin pakan paka. Kéeyinane ka púlooŋ ti Yéesu nkaloom pipaakool ti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa lati Címpaŋ ya eti <char style="w">Solomon</char>. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />An áhaañiyantoo hinanfuyii, pale pakan paka nkánapiyanii. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Háati fo, pakan paka kéeyinane ka ti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> nkahaŋ toko nkameeŋe, kayoŋ kenfakat kiti pákayiin niŋ pakaal. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Pakan paka nkácoopii fala púkuuña pa pakateyii ti ñítin ña nkahintanii ti pucunkun niŋ ti uhun ancuk niŋ <char style="w">Piyeer</char> amuusaa hísaalumantoo níhilik pakakee teyii. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Pakan keemeeŋe nkáfulii ti pisaatee pa peekole pa <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> nkácoopoolii púkuuña pa pakateyii niŋ payenka <char style="w" lemma="Hísaalumant">kísaalumant</char> nkinakiye, poko púlooŋ nkákuuñanee.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaakallanee ka kiti pupoñapoñ pa kamma Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Fiye, <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">awaaseena ya enfakat a ati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ pinapooloo, keeyem ka ti kayoŋ ka kiti <char style="w" lemma="Asatusaay">Pusatusaay</char> pa, nkataak paheeka ti <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Nkacokii nkawantii ti ékuluma. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Pale niŋ hánant ha, <char style="w">maleekoo</char> ya eti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> néepankinii ñutum ña ñiti ékuluma ya, néefulaniyii neesokii: <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Nikaay nisiiŋo ti hank ha hiti <char style="w" lemma="Ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya</char> eti Pútuun pa, innikaman pakan paka hilim ha hiti eloŋ eyye.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Pupoñapoñ pa nkáhin eeha neesokii ha. Cipilap, nkanako ti hank ha hiti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya nkayeno kakalaŋan pakan paka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Ta awaaseena ya enfakat a náacolii ta niŋ keeyem ka neyoo, nkaconcoolan ñíhampaatiin píhina kíiti ya púlooŋ pakati <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa. Fiye, nkapoñ pati ékuluma ya kapica kácoopii pupoñapoñ pa. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Pale pufaasa pa pakati ekumpaan ya enfakat ya kapucol pati ékuluma ya kacukutii, nkañoho nkasokii: <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />“Ukaayaakaay pati ékuluma ya nuutook yo neekulee pitempo tak, pufaasa pa pakati ékuluma ya nkasiiŋo ti ñutum ña pale úpupankin ucukut páhantuwa an!” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Ahámpaatiin a ati pufaasa pa pakati ekumpaan ya enfakat ya niŋ ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa kápisi eehuu nkaliim meemak ti pupoñapoñ pa. Nkayeno ecakanoolo puume efihikelan.<verse eid="ACT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Fiye, an náakey naasokii: “Nisincan! Pákayiin paka payenka innikule ka ahaayii ti hank ha hiti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya ti kakalaŋan pakan paka.” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Tokotoko, áhampaatiin a ati pufaasa pa pakati ekumpaan ya enfakat ya naakaay niŋ pufaasa pa íncakacoopii pupoñapoñ pa, pale kácokiyootii niŋ sempe kamma nkafeye pakan paka timpi <char style="w" lemma="Kaanunkal">kanunkalii</char> pukumpa.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Nkacoop pupoñapoñ pa hátikin ñíhampaatiin píhina kíiti ya. Awaaseena ya enfakat a naacakanii, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />naasokii: “Fo ukitut aluu kakalaŋan ti caacaw áyiin a aŋuu? Pale nisincan eeha ínnihine ha! Nimeeŋanaa <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> púlooŋ niŋ kakalaŋan ka kitaaluu, ínnilafi katiyan unii eket ya eti áyiin a aŋuu!” <verse eid="ACT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" /><char style="w">Piyeer</char> niŋ pakakee pupoñapoñ pa nkañahanii: “Pútuun pa nuuñaŋe káasiitan pale an tom. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Aluu nimuke Yéesu ta innipempeŋoo ta ti <char style="w">kuluwaa</char> ya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta Piyeer naasoke ta hilim eehuu, asok: “Aluu nimuke Yéesu ta ínninintoo ta ti enuun ya kaloŋa.” Asokaasok eehe kamma hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha hiti Móyiis nihisoke nii, Pútuun pa piñanaañan an óo an éenintee ti enuun (Kakaman 21:23).</char></note> pale Pútuun pa piti símaama unaa mpilitanoo ti eket ya. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Pútuun pa mpíseepinoo ti epees etempo yáali, mpíhinoo apiyeno ati hikaw ha niŋ <char style="w">Afakana</char> ya kati puwufan pakati <char style="w">Israyel</char> la éfikasik kápuwunko umuuyen wa uteyii nkaponketee. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Unii utantake eehuu fiye púlooŋ, unii niŋ <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> enka Pútuun pa mpuwufane ka kéetuule po ka.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Ta nkásiye ta eehuu kiiñii nkili meemak ti pupoñapoñ pa nkálafiyii himuku. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Pale oonool teyii, <char style="w">Afalisaay</char> caacawoo Kamaliyel, <char style="w">akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Móyiis, aŋa pakan paka púlooŋ nkánapiyane, naasiiŋo hátikin ñíhampaatiin píhina kíiti ya, naasok pupoñapoñ pa káfulanee fala tíkitaaŋ. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Fiye, naasokii: “Aluu pakati Israyel, nitah kunuu meemak ti eeha ínnilafiye ha íhinu payenkuu. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Sitiil seemuuse nuucukaa áyiin a aŋa nkasok a Teyutas naacokooliye fa nii an eemaka, máamun pakan sikeme sipaakiil (400) kanapanoo. Pale ta naamukee ta poko fiye púlooŋ nkahancoolo, kiteyoo nékisiitee. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Púful toko, ti caanak enca an óo an naañaŋee ta hikiicuyee caacawoo, intaako áyiin aŋa nkasok Yutas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yutas aŋe akufut nii Judas éefule ya ti Yéesu.</char></note> ati Galilee, pakakee pakan nkanapanoo naanoŋanii ti pakati kikaw ka. Akina lompo naamukee, pinapana pa pakateyoo púlooŋ nkahancoolo. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Ooto inci pusok aluu hoonool: Payenkuu nitahiipo! Timpi nipaaliyii nikatanii kapikaay! Kaatuko eeha nkámiilool ha niŋ eeha nkáhin ha, iyyema ti pakan níhifulii féefiye hiketaa. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Pale iyyema eeha nkayem ha ti íhinu ti Pútuun pa níhifulii, étiniyiniyii iheeku. Nitah kunuu, ti kafeyatan timpi niyeno pikamool niŋ Pútuun pa!” Píhina kíiti ya nkacoon eeha Kamaliyel naasoke ha.<verse eid="ACT 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Nkapoñ kápucoopii pupoñapoñ pa nkáhin kapisapee niŋ hisawut. Fiye, nkakitii káakup ti caacaw Yéesu, nkakatanii kapikaay. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Pupoñapoñ pa nkáful ti éhinuma kíiti ya niŋ pásuuma penfakat. Kaatuko Pútuun pa pucokiicok nii pakan kéetuuniye pikallo ti caacaw ca citi Yéesu. Ekina ewune nkameeŋ niŋ pásuuma. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Hinak óo hinak ti hank ha hiti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa niŋ ti pukumpaan pa káyekuniit kakalaŋan niŋ káatuunan ekooŋan ya éesuume ya nii Yéesu ayem <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Kamamalee ka kiti isak niŋ pákasupak paka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Ti oom caanak, pinapana pa nkayeno épenanoyii, <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa payenka nkákup ka Kilek nkayeno káakumutool kiti Pusuwif pa pakati mah ma miti <char style="w">Israyel</char> kamma kayoŋ ka kiteyii kiti piyaaŋat pa payenka pákayiinii keekete ka nkafiilee ti pípaacinool paliyal pa empa mpíhinee pa hinak óo hinak. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" /><char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">Pupoñapoñ</char> pa ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka nkaconcoolan kayoŋ ka kiti pinapana pa nkasokii: “Unii uñaŋut kakatan káatuunan <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> upuyeno káapaacinool ñaliyal. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Ekina ewune, aluu pakanam ti káyinan, nimamal ti pututa aluu pákayiin isak niŋ pákasupak payenka pakan paka púlooŋ nkahintiye, nkameeŋ niŋ Kunuu ka keenape ka niŋ ecohato, efuuñomanii páhin pa piti káapaacinool ñaliyal ña. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Fiye, unii nuucoonool ti kaluum ka niŋ káatuunan hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa.” <verse eid="ACT 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Kayoŋ ka púlooŋ ínsuum ko ti eeha nkasokii ha. Nkamamal Stíifan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Stíifan akina ayem Ecen, ti falans kaŋ.</char></note>, áyiin eemeeŋe niŋ káyinan niŋ <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char>. Nkamamal lompo <char style="w">Filip</char>, Pulokol, Nikanol, Timon, Palemenas niŋ Nikolas, áyiin ati Antiyok, eenanfe ti pítin pa piti Pusuwif pa. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Nkácoopii pákayiin paka payenkuu ti pupoñapoñ pa. Pupoñapoñ pa nkaluum kiteyii nkalemp sipeesii teyii. <verse eid="ACT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa níhimeyiyee pihaŋhaŋ toko. Po <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, pinapana pa nkayeno épenanoyii meemak. Hícump <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">puwaaseena pakati Pútuun</char> nkáyinan ti Yéesu.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hinookuyee ha hiti Stíifan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Stíifan, áyiin aŋa Pútuun pa mpisampane mpimeeŋanoo sempe, náahin weecukantee niŋ hícump píyisan penfakat hátikin pakan paka. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Pale pakakee pakan keeyeniye ka ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">éluumuma</char> ya eyya nkasok ya “Elúumuma eti kéefule ti himiikanate”, nkáyaañ pílaacinool niŋ Stíifan. Poko kayem <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pakati Silen, Alesantili niŋ pakakee Pusuwif kéefulii ka Silisi niŋ Asii. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Pale kayinaatoo iheeku ti pákupal kamma Kunuu ka keenape ka nkuwunoo ecohato eti kayine káakup.<verse eid="ACT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Fiye, payenkuu nkacooy pakan kati kasok: “Usíyoosi ti kateñal <char style="w">Móyiis</char> niŋ Pútuun pa!” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Fiyuu nkáluuŋe pakan paka niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Móyiis. Nkalaako Stíifan, nkacoopoo hátikin ñíhampaatiin píhina kíiti ya pakati Pusuwif pa. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Nkákey niŋ pakakee pakan kati kacaam. Payenkuu nkasok: “Aŋuu áyekuniit hisoku heenaput ti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa eesampanee ya niŋ ti <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char>. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Kaatuko unii úsiyoosi ti hisoku nii Yéesu ati Naasalet aŋuu afaahancalool ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa, naayesan cosaan ya eyya Móyiis naawufane ya unaa.” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Ñíkin ñíhampaatiin píhina kíiti ya íññiyayii ti Stíifan, nkacuk puhooŋuyoo mpucuke nii piti <char style="w">maleekoo</char>.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Hilim ha hiti Stíifan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Fiye, <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">awaaseena ya enfakat a ati Pútuun pa</char> naacakan Stíifan: “Fo eeha nkanookuu eehe hiti páni?” <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Stíifan naañahanii ti hisoku: “Aluu pakanam niŋ ñífaafam, nísiitanam. Ta maamaa atuunaa <char style="w">Abraham</char> naakine ta faw ti mah ma miti Mesopotami, le niŋ afaacaakin ti saatee ya eti Halan, Pútuun pa peemaka pa mpúfulii teyoo. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Mpusokoo: 'Katan mah ma mitii niŋ miin ma mitii inkaay ti mah ma emma fáyisani ma.'<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Púcook 12:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Fiye, naakatan mah ma miti Kaletaay naakaay apikin Halan. Pamuusal eket ya eti faafoo, Pútuun pa mpúcoopiyoo ti mah emme innikine ma temmo fiye. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Pútuun pa, puwufanutoo le etaam háati citaam. Pale mpíyinananoo nii efipuwufanoo mah emme, akina niŋ miin ma miteyoo, apan ti oom caanak Abraham peelokot ataak añii. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Eehe Pútuun pa mpusokoo: 'Miin ma mitii efimikin ti mah meeneetaat miteyii, la efikayeno pimiikan nkakallanee meemak fo sitiil sikeme sipaakiil (400).' <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Pale Pútuun pa nene pusok: 'Fasiiŋan ti pisiya penfakat mah ma meecokii ma pimiikan niŋ fúlaa toko éfikafulii ti oom mah nkákey kapinkaluumam le.'<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:13-14">Púcook 15:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 3:12">Efúlii 3:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Fiye, Pútuun pa mpiliil niŋ Abraham <char style="w">písiyool</char>. Píyisan pa piti písiyool empuu piyem, áyiin óo áyiin <char style="w" lemma="Kanakan">anakanee</char>. Ekina ewune Abraham ta naapuke ta añiinoo <char style="w">Isaak</char>, naanakanoo ti hinoom ha heewase ha isak niŋ kíhaaciil. Isaak naapuk <char style="w">Jakob</char> naalompo anakanoo, Jakob naapuk epuuk pákayiin ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak naanakanii, oom epuuk kayem símaama unaa siti miin ma ŋaasuwan niŋ músupak ma.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />“Símaama unaa epuuk Jakob, nkataak paheeka ti atuwii <char style="w">Josef</char>, nkanoomanoo kati ayeno amiikan ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Esipt</char>. Pale Pútuun pa mpiyeno neyoo, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />mpifakanoo ti kúnuuloo púlooŋ. Mpuwufanoo ecohato, mpíhinoo ápusuum amansa ya ati Esipt. Amansa ya náahinoo apiyeno ati hikaw ha hiti mah ma púlooŋ niŋ ekumpaan ya eteyoo púlooŋ. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Fiye, épankul néenakoonii ti mah ma púlooŋ miti Esipt niŋ Kanaan. Iyyeno caanak citi kúnuul kenfakat. Símaama unaa kataakut paliyal. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Ta Jakob náasiye ta nii Esipt taakaataak paliyal, naapoñ ti púcook epuukoo símaama unaa. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Kapuñoho púsupiyenu, Josef náayisanoolo ti ñúnuwoo akina ayem ayme, náayisanii lompo Felo. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Púful toko, Josef naapoñ kápucoopii paapaa ateyoo Jakob niŋ miin ma miteyoo púlooŋ, kayema pakan áwii éhaaciil niŋ kaat (75). <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Fiyuu Jakob naakaaye Esipt, po naakete akina niŋ epuukoo símaama unaa. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Puhunuŋii mpiñahanee ti saatee ya eti Sikem mpuhokee ti hiyaak eeha Abraham naanoome ha niŋ mañoo ti epuuk Hamol. Hamol ayem paapaa ati Sikem.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />“Púful toko, pakan unaa nkahaŋ toko nkameeŋe meemak ti mah ma miti Esipt fo ta íllohanii ta Pútuun pa kati píhin eeha mpíyinanane ha Abraham. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Fiye, intaako Esipt amansa éeyeeni éemiit kiti Josef. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Naacaakool pakan unaa naakallanii náahinii kapitah tíkitaaŋ miñiinii meepukee ma féefiye eeha efihiwun ha immiket. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Ti oom caanak <char style="w">Móyiis</char> naapukee, añii eewalla hátikin Pútuun pa. Náakuumanee fo kiim kíhaaciil lati enuuf ya eti faafoo. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Ta naatahee ta tíkitaaŋ, Felo añiinoo ámaacul naacoopoo náakuloo nii añiinoo. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Móyiis naakalaŋanee púlooŋ ecohato ya eti pakati Esipt naayeno áyiin aŋa nákup nawen niŋ sempe. <verse eid="ACT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Ta Móyiis naataake ta sitiil áwii ésupak (40) náamiilool pikaayu hiyoop pakanoo pakati <char style="w">Israyel</char>. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Apucol po, naacuk ati Esipt ti kaakancool niŋ ati Israyel, fiye Móyiis naasiiŋo eekallanee ya naasap ati Esipt a naamukoo. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Móyiis incukoo nii pakanoo pakati Israyel éfikapannum nii Pútuun pa púpoñiyoo kati pifakanii, pale kámiit ho. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Eti kacom eteyyo, naacuk pákayiin pákasupak pakati Israyel ti pítaakool. Naaŋes káasiyoolanii, naasokii: 'Aluu pákawiyam, fo aluu pakoonool paka tom? Weyme inniyem ti pítaakool?' <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Eeyem ya ti kaakancool niŋ áwiyoo naahalap Móyiis naasokoo: 'Ayme asiiŋanuu ati hikaw niŋ afiita kilim ti pututa unii? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Fo áalafiyaamlafi himuku samat nii fa ammuke fa hukan ati Esipt a?'<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:14">Efúlii 2:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Móyiis ápisi eehe, naatey ápuful Esipt, naakaay apikin ti mah ma miti Mitiyan. Po naataake epuuk mikampaani músupak.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />“Sitiil áwii ésupak (40) sipimuus, <char style="w">maleekoo</char> néefulii ti Móyiis ti kaaleew kiti cífita ti <char style="w">káahaaŋ ka tes</char> pukol tíntiŋ eyya nkasok ya Sinayi. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Móyiis apucuk eehuu ínnimoo ti eeha naacuke ha, pale apiteeŋo kati acuk púsooni náasi hilim ha hiti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa, nihisok: <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />'Inci yem Pútuun pa piti símaamayi, inci yem Pútuun pa piti Abraham, Isaak niŋ Jakob.'<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Efúlii 3:6</ref></char></note> Móyiis naakikilan kamma ewatate áhaañiit fala kaasincan. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Fiye, Ateeteyo Pútuun pa mpusokoo: 'Waat pisamata pa pitii, kaatuko la ansiiŋiye la, etaam eti meeñeya. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Inci cukaacuk fanfaŋ fa nkayem fa ti kaakallan pakanam ti mah ma miti Esipt. Inci síyaasi palikalii úwwanoonii kati fakanii. Fiye kéy inci pupoñi Esipt.'<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:5">Efúlii 3:5</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 3:7">7</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 3:8">8</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 3:10">10</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />“Móyiis oonool a aŋuu akina pakati Israyel nkapooke fa ta nkasokoo ta: 'Ayme asiiŋanuu ati hikaw niŋ afiita kilim?' Móyiis, ti kayankanan ka kiti maleekoo ya éefulii ya teyoo ti cífita ca, akina Pútuun pa mpupoñe kati ayeno ati hikaw ha niŋ aŋa áfaafulanii ya ti himiikanate. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Móyiis áfulanii pakati Israyel Esipt, ti íhinu hícump píyisan niŋ weecukantee, náahin wo lompo ti Kaatii ka Kéecunke ka niŋ ti káahaaŋ ka tes fo sitiil áwii ésupak (40). <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Móyiis aŋe asoke pakati Israyel nii: 'Pútuun pa éfipupoñii aluu <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> samat nii inci, afaayeno an éefulii ti pakan aluu.'<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Kakaman 18:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Móyiis lompo ayeniye niŋ pakati Israyel ta nkaconcooliye ta ti káahaaŋ ka tes. Naayeno po niŋ símaama unaa niŋ maleekoo ya éekupe ya neyoo pati tíntiŋ ya eti Sinayi. Náasayii ti Pútuun pa kilim kiti eloŋ kiti kawufanee unaa.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />“Pale símaama unaa kálafiitoo káasiitan, nkapookoo, kunuuwii púlooŋ nkuñoho Esipt. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Nkasok <char style="w">Aaron</char>: 'Memanool unaa pínaati, peekaakaay unaa hinowu hátikin. Kaatuko, úmiit heetaakiye Móyiis aŋe, éefulanii ya unaa Esipt.'<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1">Efúlii 32:1</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 32:23">23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Ti oom caanak nkamemanoole énaati eecuke nii cimpeeh, nkawaaseen teyyo nkataak pahaaño ti kámakiyan eeha nkamemanoole ha niŋ sipeesii. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Pale Pútuun pa mpúwunkiyii, mpikatanii kápinkakilipo hátikin caanak ca, hiim ha niŋ picaaŋaŋ pa samat nii fa inkiicee fa ti pakiical pa piti piyaamakoola pa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">
    <char style="qt">'Kayoŋ ka kiti Israyel </char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">
    <char style="qt">fo inci wune inniwaaseen púlukuleen </char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">
    <char style="qt">niŋ ñikee ñiwaaseen fo sitiil áwii ésupak ti káahaaŋ ka tes?</char>
    <verse eid="ACT 7:42" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />
    <char style="qt">Haani, pale nicoopoolaa-coopool ékuut ya eti Molok, énaati ya etaaluu,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">
    <char style="qt">niŋ ecaaŋaŋ ya eti Lefan, ekee énaati ya etaaluu,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">
    <char style="qt">pínaati empa aluu innimemanoole pa kati ínnikilipo hátikin etempo.</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">
    <char style="qt">Ekina ewune inci fáfulan aluu nípilaaŋ puson Babilon.'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:43 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 5:25-27">Amos 5:25-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="ACT 7:43" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />“Símaama unaa kayekanaayekan ti káahaaŋ tes <char style="w" lemma="Ekúut ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa">ékuut ya enfakat ya</char> éeyisane ya nii Pútuun pa umpa neyii. Ekúut eyyuu ememanoolee-memanool samat nii fa Pútuun pa mpusoke fa Móyiis mpíyisanoo. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Po hátikin, epuuk símaama unaa nkasa ékuut ya enfakat ya ti sífaafii. Nkacoopool yo ta Josuwa naayeniye ta ati hikaw ha, nkalam mah ma miti keekine ka toko, payenka Pútuun pa mpiyaane ka hátikinii. Neeyeno toko fo ti caanak ca citi amansa ya <char style="w">Dawid</char>. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Dawid náasuum Pútuun pa naaluum po pipikatanoo apulut ekumpaan eti Pútuun pa piti Jakob. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Pale amansa ya <char style="w">Solomon</char> alute ekumpaan ya. <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Apan Pútuun pa piti patiila pikinantoo ti pukumpaan pa empa pakan paka nkalute pa samat nii fa ayaamakoola ya naasoke fa:<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />
    <char style="qt">'Ateeteyo Pútuun pa pusok:</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">
    <char style="qt">"Alacana eyem <char style="w">elemeyu</char> ya etoom,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">
    <char style="qt">etaam ya neeyeno élempuma wootam.</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">
    <char style="qt">Ekumpaan eecuke puume efinilutam?</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">
    <char style="qt">Leyme inci inkaakaay éyekunoolo?</char>
    <verse eid="ACT 7:49" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />
    <char style="qt">Fo inci tom liile eehuu púlooŋ?"'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:50 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 66:1-2">Esayi 66:1-2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>”<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Stíifan nene asokii: “Aluu kéeciita ka káakup payenkuu, weyme ñúsus aluu iññiyanke fiyaaw, unuu aluu nuucoto ti hísiyu <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> samat nii keenakiit ka ti písiyool empa Pútuun pa mpiliile pa niŋ Abraham? Tan óo tan innipookpook <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> samat nii símaama aluu! <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Ayme ti piyaamakoola pa símaama aluu nkakallanut? Nkamuk kéekupe ka ta infiyye kiti ékey ya eti <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">Eecoonoole</char> ya. Fiye, aluu, ínniful teyoo innimukoo. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Símaama aluu niŋ aluu pumaleekoo pa mpuwufane <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Pútuun pa, pale níhinantoo fa nihisoke fa!”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eket ya eti Stíifan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Ta keeyem ka ti éhinuma kíiti ya nkásiye ta eehuu, kiiñii nkili meemak fo nkafincal úŋiiŋii teyoo. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Pale, Stíifan eemeeŋe ya niŋ <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> naasincan patiila naacuk hamake ha hiti Pútuun pa niŋ Yéesu naasiiŋiye ti epees yáali eti Pútuun pa. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Naasokii: “Nisincan, inci cukaa alacana néepankiniye, niŋ <char style="w">Añii An</char> naasiiŋiye ti epees yáali eti Pútuun pa.” <verse eid="ACT 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Kápisi eehe nkaceek meemak nkacotal unuuwii nkalaakiyoo poko púlooŋ, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />nkáhuunoo fo káful ti saatee ya nkáyaañoo <char style="w">kaanunkal</char> niŋ pukumpa. Keetantake ka nkawufan kúsool ka kiteyii kenfakat ka akampaani aŋa nkasok Sóol. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Ta nkayeniyoo ta kaanunkal, Stíifan naaluum naasok: “<char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Yéesu, sa yaanam!” <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Fiye, náakilipo naaceek niŋ kaawiiluyoo naasok: “Ateeteyo ponketii kaamuuyen enke!” Apipa hisoku eehe naaket.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Sóol naasayan himukuyee ha hiti Stíifan. <figure style="fig" alt="le jet de pierres à Stíifan" file="GW 153.jpg" size="col" loc="7:59-8:1" copy="Wade NT" ref="8:1">Kaanunkalee ka kiti Stíifan</figure></para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Ehancoolo ya eti kéeyinane ka</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Ti oom hinoom kéeyinane ka pakati <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> nkácookee kaakallanee meemak. Hícump teyii nkahancoolo ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Judaay</char> niŋ <char style="w">Samali</char>. Fiye ti kéeyinane ka, <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa lamayii katowiye Jerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Pakan keefeye Pútuun nkahok Stíifan nkakooŋ eket ya eteyoo meemak. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Pale Sóol naaŋes kaahancalool kéeyinane ka; naanako ti pukumpaan pa náacokii kéeyinane ka, pákayiin niŋ pakaal naawantii ti ékuluma.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káatuunanee ka kiti ekooŋan ya éesuume ya Samali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Kéeyinane ka payenka nkahancaloole ka, nkakaay pan óo pan nkayeno káatuunan ekooŋan ya éesuume ya. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Fiyuu <char style="w">Filip</char> náawanoonii ti saatee eti <char style="w">Samali</char>, naayeno káatuunan pakan paka kiti <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char>. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Kayoŋ ka púlooŋ nkitah kunuu ti Filip meemak ti eeha naasoke ha, kaatuko kásiyoosi nkacukoo ti íhinu weecukantee. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Hícump keetaake <char style="w" lemma="Hísaalumant">kísaalumant</char> nkákuuñanee, kísaalumant ka nkúfulii teyii niŋ hiceeku. Hícump kéehute niŋ payenka nkanow niŋ efank nkákuuñanee. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Fiye pásuuma penfakat mpiyeniye ti saatee eyyuu.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pátuuta pa Simon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Intaako áyiin eefiyye ti oom saatee, aŋa nkasok Simon, náhin páhinal piti pátuuta, pakan paka púlooŋ pakati <char style="w">Samali</char> ínnimii teyoo. Naacokoolo nii an eemaka. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />An óo an náasiitanoo meemak písik ti keemaka ka fo ti kéetinee ka, nkasok: “Ayíin aŋe ayem sempe sa siti Pútuun pa ensa nkasok sa 'Sempe sa Senfakat sa'.” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Kásiitanoo-síitan meemak kaatuko afiyaafiyo ti íhinu páhinal piti pátuuta péenimii. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Pale, ta <char style="w">Filip</char> náakeyii ta káatuunan ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> niŋ caacaw ca citi Yéesu Krista, nkáyinan nkáhinee <char style="w">pátise</char>, pákayiin niŋ pakaal. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Simon himuumoo náayinan náahinee pátise. Naayeno kanapan Filip pan óo pan, ínnimoo ti píyisan pa peemeeŋe pa niŋ weecukantee wa wenfakat wa ewwa naayeniye wa íhinu hátikin pakan paka.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Po <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa nkási nii pakati Samali kasayanaasayan <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>, fiye nkapoñii <char style="w">Piyeer</char> niŋ <char style="w">Saŋ</char>. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Ta nkacole ta Samali, nkaluum kiti kéeyinane ka, <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> kati kúwanoonii teyii. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Tempo Kunuu ka Keenape ka peelokot kúwanoonii ti an teyii, káhineehin pátise lamma ti caacaw ca citi <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Yéesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Fiye, Piyeer niŋ Saŋ nkalemp sipeesii teyii, Kunuu ka keenape ka nkúwanoonii teyii.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Simon naacuk nii, emma pupoñapoñ pa nkalemp ma sipeesii ti pakan paka, tokotoko Kunuu ka keenape ka nkúwanoonii teyii. Ta Simon naacuke ta eehuu, naawufan pupoñapoñ pa mañ, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />naasokii: “Niwufanam lompo sempe ense ancuk an óo an aŋa inci illempe teyoo sipeesam naasa Kunuu ka keenape ka.” <figure style="fig" alt="Simon le magicien a vu les envoyés poser leur mains sur les gens, l’esprit Saint est déscendu sur eux" file="GW 154.jpg" size="col" loc="8:17-25" copy="Wade NT" ref="8:19">Simon pátuuta pa naacuk pupoñapoñ pa nkalempe sipeesii ti pakan paka</figure><verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Pale, Piyeer naañahanoo: “Alímaati mañ ma mitii múpucaloolo niŋ awe himuumi, kamma incukuu nii áayiniyini hinoom kawun ka kiti Pútuun pa niŋ mañ! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Putumi pineetaat cántum ti páhin pa putoonii, kaatuko ti Pútuun pa, yaani ekuulut. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Katan pámiiloolali peenaput pa illuum Ateeteyo, pikee pa naaponketi pámiiloolali peenaput pa. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Ee, inci cukaacuk nii aapa meeŋe niŋ paseeña, íyyemi ti sempe sa siti kaamuuyen ka.” <verse eid="ACT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Simon naañahanii: “Aluu himuum aluu niluum Ateeteyo kutoom ancuk eeha innisoke ha púlooŋ timpi hitaakiyam.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Pupoñapoñ pa, ta nkapaye ta kakaman eeha nkatantake ha ti eloŋ ya eti Ateeteyo, nkátuunan hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa, púful toko nkañoho pateyii Jerusalem. Ti puñoho pa, nkayeno káatuunan ekooŋan ya éesuume ya ti hícump misaatee miti Samali.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filip niŋ áyiin ati Ecoopiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Fiye, <char style="w">maleekoo</char> eti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> neesok <char style="w">Filip</char>: “Lito hiiŋ <char style="w">Esipt</char>, fo ti pítin pa piti <char style="w">káahaaŋ ka tes</char> péewanoonii pa <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> pupuwant saatee ya eti Gasa.” <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Filip naalito naakaay. Akina ti pítin pa naapaakool niŋ áyiin. Ayíin a aŋuu an eemaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta Luk naakiice ta eehe, asokaasok áyiin a “áyiin eekeekee”. Ti oom caanak, pumansa pa nkakeek-keek píhina pa pakateyii pákayiin paka keetaake ka nafaa. Nkakeekiikeek timpi káyini pihinto niŋ pakaalii niŋ ekina tom epuukii.</char></note> ti mah ma miti Ecoopiya. Kantas, amansa ya aal a ati Ecoopiya, naañomanoo hisaanumate ha hiteyoo púlooŋ. Ayíin a kaanimpan Pútuun pa naakaaye Jerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Akina ti puñoho pateyoo, naayeno ti saleet ya eteyoo kalaŋ pakiical pa piti <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya <char style="w">Esayi</char>. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Fiye, <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkusok Filip: “Kaay, loh saleet eyyuu.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Filip naatey pati saleet ya náasi áyiin a ti kalaŋ pakiical pa piti ayaamakoola ya Esayi. Naakicanoo naacakanoo: “Fo áameyimeyi eeha ayyem ha ti kalaŋ fa nihisoke?” <figure style="fig" alt="Filip cour pour poursuivre la charet" file="GW 156.jpg" size="col" loc="8:30-33" copy="Wade NT" ref="8:30">Filip naatey aputoopan saleet ya</figure><verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Ayíin a naasokoo: “Puume inci iyyina ho kameye, niŋ an ácenkinutam?” Naasok Filip: “Síloonii yeno pukolam.” <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Naayeno kalaŋ <char style="w" lemma="Hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa">pakiical</char> empe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">
    <char style="qt">“Samat nii sáacii, nkacoopoo hitaaŋuyee;</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">
    <char style="qt">samat nii císaacii ceefatane niŋ kayeniyaa kaayiinu pahan etenco,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">
    <char style="qt">ápankinut putumoo.</char>
    <verse eid="ACT 8:32" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />
    <char style="qt">Nkasuuwanoo, nkapookoo kawufan tooñaa ya eteyoo.</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">
    <char style="qt">An ayinaat káakup kiti miin ma miteyoo,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">
    <char style="qt">kaatuko eloŋ ya eteyoo éfulaneefulan ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>.”</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:7-8">Esayi 53:7-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="ACT 8:33" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Ayíin a naacakan Filip: “Ponket sokam, ayaamakoola ya ati Pútuun pa, kiti ayme naayem ti káakup? Kiteyoo fo kiti akee?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Fiye, Filip náacook ti eeha áyiin a naayeniye ha kalaŋ, náatuunanoo ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eti Yéesu.<verse eid="ACT 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Ti pítinii nkacol la taake man. Ayíin a naasok Filip: “Sincan ehe man me, weyme efuukitam íhinuyee <char style="w">pátise</char>?” <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Naasok saleet ya esiiŋo, poko t’ésupakii nkawano ti man ma, Filip náahinoo pátise. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Ta nkáfulii ta ti man ma, Kunuu ka kiti Ateeteyo nkíseepin Filip. Ayíin a nene acukutoo pale naahankan pítinoo niŋ pásuuma penfakat. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Filip naacuk faŋoo ti saatee ya eti Asot, náaful toko naakaay ti saatee ya eti Sesaale naayeno káatuunan ekooŋan ya éesuume ya ti pisaatee pa púlooŋ empa namuus pa.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Káyinan ka kiti Sóol ti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Ti oom caanak, Sóol, eesayane ya himukuyee ha hiti Stíifan, naatowo ti kaafeyanool ti hisoku nii afaamuk pinapana pa pakati <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char>. Naakaay pati <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">awaaseena ya enfakat a ati Pútuun pa</char> <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />apusokoo nii akiicoo pileetal piti ñíhampaatiin ña pakati <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">púluumuma</char> pa piti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa ti saatee ya eti Damas. Pileetal empuu efipuwufanoo sempe siti pinako ti púluumuma pa, ancuk iyyema atookaa po keeyem ka ti Pítin pa piti Yéesu, man me pákayiin niŋ pakaal, naacokii naacoopii <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Akina ti pítin pa apulohan Damas, tokotoko ecaaŋ néefulii patiila néeyayii teyoo néekinkooloo. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Sóol naanow t’etaam, náasi hilim heesokoo: “Sóol, Sóol, weyme uwune áyyemiyam ti kaakallan?” <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Sóol naacakan: “Awe yem ayme, Ateeteyo?” Hilim ha nihiñahanoo: “Inci yem Yéesu aŋa ayyem ya ti kaakallan. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Fiye lito inkaay pati saatee ya, aafakamanee eeha aññaŋe ha íhinu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Pákayiin paka keeyeniye ka pinapool niŋ Sóol nkaŋaŋo. Nkási hilim ha pale kacukut an. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Sóol naalito la naanowe la pale ta náapankine ta ñíkinoo acukut waah. Nkátintiŋanoo kapinako Damas. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Náafuum fo kunoom káhaaciil aliit waah alaanut. <figure style="fig" alt="La lumière qui tap sur Paul l’enveloppa" file="GW 160.jpg" size="col" loc="9:1-9" copy="Wade NT" ref="9:9">Ecaaŋ ya éeyayii ya ti Póol néekinkooloo</figure><verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Toko Damas, intaako anapana aŋa nkasok Anañas. Ateeteyo náafulii teyoo pucuk fiye nii éyawut, naasokoo: “Anañas!” Anañas naañahanoo: “Eheeyam Ateeteyo.” <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Ateeteyo naasokoo: “Lito inkaay ti pítin pa empa nkasok pa 'Pítin Peecoonoole', innako ti ekumpaan ya eti Yutas, incakan áyiin a aŋa éefulii ya ti saatee ya eti Taas aŋa nkasok a Sóol. Kaatuko oopa ti kaluum féefiye. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Pucuk fiye nii ti éyawut, naacuk áyiin aŋa nkasok Anañas, náanakoonii naalemp sipeesoo teyoo kati añoho ti hicuku.”<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Anañas naañahanoo: “Ateeteyo, hícump pakan kakamanaam-kaman heenaput ha púlooŋ eeha áyiin aŋuu naayeniye ha íhinu Jerusalem, pakani <char style="w" lemma="Keesampanee ka pakati Pútuun pa">keesampanee ka</char>. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Akéyyookey le, <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa</char> kawufanoowufan sempe siti hicoku payenka púlooŋ nkaluum ka ti caacawi.” <verse eid="ACT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Pale Ateeteyo naasokoo: “Kaay, kaatuko inci mamaloo kati acoop caacawam ti <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char> niŋ pumansa pa niŋ lompo ti pakati <char style="w">Israyel</char>. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Inci himuumam fáyisanoo kúnuul ka púlooŋ enka naañaŋe ka hicuku kamma caacawam.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Púful toko, Anañas naalito naakaay naanako lati ekumpaan ya la Sóol naayem la, naalemp sipeesoo teyoo naasokoo: “Sóol atoomuu, Ateeteyo Yéesu ápoñiyaam, éefulii ya ti awe ti pítin pa, awe ti ékey ya le. Apóñiyaampoñ ancuk aañohiyaa ti hicuku immeeŋanee niŋ <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char>.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Tokotoko, waah weecuke nii puwes núufulii ti Sóol ñíkinoo núunowii, naañoho ti hicuku. Naalito náahinee <char style="w">pátise</char>. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Apipa hili, sempeyoo ínsiñohoonii. <figure style="fig" alt="La bénédiction de Paul par Ananias" file="GW 161.jpg" size="col" loc="9:17-19" copy="Wade NT" ref="9:19">Anañas naaluum kiti Póol</figure></para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Kakalaŋan ka kiti Sóol Damas</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Eehuu hipimuus, Sóol naayeno po Damas kikee kunoom niŋ pinapana pa. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Tokotoko náayaañ káatuunan ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">púluumuma</char> pa piti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa apusok nii, Yéesu ayem Añii Pútuun. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Kéesiyoo ka púlooŋ ínnimii nkacakan: “Fo aŋe tom ayeniye <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> kaakallan payenka nkaluum ka ti caacaw Yéesu? Fo ákeyyoot hicokuyii kati awufanii <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char>?” <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Pale Sóol naahaŋ toko naataake sempe, náayisan picaaŋ cataŋ Pusuwif pa keekine ka Damas nii, Yéesu ayem <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa. Kámiit eeha efikañahanoo.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Po hátikin, Pusuwif pa nkateŋenool kati kamukoo. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Hánant hanakan, nkayeniyoo cíllopa ti ñutum saatee ya kati kamukoo, pale Sóol náasi ho. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Ti oom caanak, pinapana pa pakati Sóol nkacoopoo níhanant, nkaŋes kasekeyu nkanakanoo tenko nkáyuuŋanoo, nkawananoo ti hiniŋ ha hiti saatee ya.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sóol ti saatee ya eti Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Ta Sóol naacole ta <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> naayoop hinanfu pinapana pa, pale poko púlooŋ káhaañiitoo kaatuko an áyinanut nii pánipani Sóol anapana. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Fiye, Barnabas naacoopoo nkakaay pati <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa. Barnabas naakamanii eehe: “Ti pítin pa Sóol acukaacuk <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char>, Ateeteyo náakup neyoo. Po Damas Sóol náatuunan niŋ híyiinate ti caacaw ca citi Yéesu.” <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Písik ti oom caanak Sóol naayeno neyii, naamuusool Jerusalem, náatuunan niŋ híyiinate ti caacaw ca citi Ateeteyo. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Napaakool-paakool niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa payenka nkákup ka Kilek náalaacinool neyii pale poko, nkayeno hiŋes puume éfikahin kapumukoo. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Kéeyinane ka kápisi eehuu, nkacoop Sóol ti saatee ya eti Sesaale, púful toko nkáhin apikaay ti saatee ya eti Taas.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Fiye, kéeyinane ka nkayeno ti kásuumaay ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Judaay</char> púlooŋ, <char style="w">Galilee</char> niŋ <char style="w">Samali</char>, káyinan ka kiteyii nkihaŋ toko nkitaake sempe. Ti eloŋ ya eteyii nkafe Ateeteyo, <char style="w">Kunuu ka Keenape ka</char> nkíhaañiyanii. Fiyuu nkayeniye épenanoyii.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakuuñanee ka kiti Enee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />
    <char style="w">Piyeer</char> naakaawool pan óo pan, hikee hinoom naakaay ti saatee ya eyya nkasok ya Lita hiyoop <char style="w">keesampanee ka pakati Pútuun pa</char>. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Toko, naacuk páhut áyiin aŋa nkasok Enee, eeyinaat pilito ti ecunkun ya eteyoo fo sitiil isak niŋ síhaaciil. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Piyeer naasokoo: “Enee, Yéesu Krista ákuuñanuu, lito intan ecunkun ya etii!” Tokotoko Enee naalito. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Pakan paka púlooŋ keekine ka ti pisaatee pa piti Lita niŋ Salon nkacuk eehuu nkánanfii ti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char>.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kalitanee ka kiti Tapita ti eket ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Intaako aal ti pinapana pa pakati Yope, caacawoo Tapita (ti kaŋ ya eti Kilek, Tookas, ekina eyem “himisawoot”). Eloŋoo púlooŋ likee tom fo íhinu heenape niŋ kayankanan keeleke ka. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Ti oom kunoom, náakuuñ halapat naaket. Nkañow ehunuŋ ya nkahintan yo ti ékaap eeyem patiila. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Páawoo pisaatee pa piti Lita niŋ Yope pílaaŋoolut, pinapana pa pakati Yope kápisi nii <char style="w">Piyeer</char> oopa Lita nkapoñ pákayiin pákasupak kapica kaluum Piyeer: “Ponket kéy tokofiye!” <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Piyeer naalito naanapool neyii. Apucol nkacoopoo ti ékaap ya eti patiila. Piyaaŋat pa púlooŋ payenka pákayiinii keekete ka nkalohoo niŋ pukooŋ nkáyisanoo kúsool ka niŋ wañ ewwa Tookas naacife wa akina kaloŋayoo. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Piyeer náafulanii poko púlooŋ tíkitaaŋ, náakilipo naaluum. Apipa náayesoonii lipa ti ehunuŋ ya naasok: “Tapita lito.” Aal a náapankin ñíkinoo, apucuk Piyeer naalito naayeno. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Piyeer náasisikanoo apisiiŋo. Púful toko, naayonkal <char style="w">keesampanee ka pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ piyaaŋat pa náayisaniiyoo kaloŋa. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Eehuu níhisiyo ti saatee ya púlooŋ eti Yope, hícump pakan nkáyinan ti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char>. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Piyeer naakampan Yope lati áyiin apaalaha aŋa nkasok Simon.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Eyísanoolo ya eti maleekoo ya ti Kooneli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Intaako ti saatee ya eti Sesaale áyiin aŋa nkasok Kooneli, áhampaatiin asoocaali ati kayoŋ ka kiti pusoocaali pa pakati <char style="w">Room</char>, kayoŋ ka enka nkasok ka “Kayoŋ ka kiti Itali”. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Ayíin eewufane meemak eloŋ ya eteyoo Pútuun pa naafe po, akina niŋ miin ma miteyoo, nayankanan <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa keeleke ka, naluum po tan óo tan. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Hikee hinoom, kaapii kiti sitalaŋ síhaaciil nkániim, <char style="w">maleekoo</char> ya eti Pútuun pa néefulii teyoo pucuk fiye nii éyawut, naacuk yo picaaŋ cataŋ néenakoonii ti ekumpaan ya eteyoo, neesokoo: “Kooneli!” <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Naasincan yo niŋ ewatate naañahan yo: “Weyme utaakiye, Ahámpaatiin?” Maleekoo ya neesokoo: “Pútuun pa pisayanaasayan kaluum ka kitii, pifiilut lompo kayankanan ka enka ánhin ka ti keeleke ka. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Fiye, poñ pakan ti saatee ya eti Yope kapica káyonkalii Simon aŋa nkasok a <char style="w">Piyeer</char>. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Oopa awanane lati Simon apaalaha ya, ekumpaan ya eteyoo néeyemi pukol kaatii ka.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Ta maleekoo ya neekaaye ta, Kooneli náayonkalii pákasupak ti pimiikan pa pakateyoo niŋ akee ti pusoocaali pa píhina pa pakateyoo. Asoocaali aŋuu, áyiin eewufane meemak eloŋ ya eteyoo Pútuun pa. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Naakamanii heetaakiye ha púlooŋ; púful toko naapoñii Yope, nkañak.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eeha Piyeer naacuke ha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Eti kacom eteyyo, máamun caanak ca ti kikaw, pimiikan pa pákasupak paka niŋ asoocaali ya nkalohan saatee ya eti Yope. Tempo, <char style="w">Piyeer</char> naasilo patiila ekumpaan ya kaluum.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ti oom caanak, pukumpaan pa piti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa pucukaacuk nii púpuncaŋo, pitaakut kankalaŋ. Toko pakan paka nkasilo kati nkáyekunoolo.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Peep mpucokoo náalafi hili. Ta nkayeniye ta kaamemanool paliyal pa, waah núufulii teyoo pucuk fiye nii éyawut naayaake. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Naacuk patiila mpánkiniye, waah núufulii po weecuke nii kahuuy kenfakat keecenkee ti sitonkoŋ sa sipaakiil sa, nkúwananiyee pukoloo. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Toko páhantuwa etenko intaako élukuleen óo élukuleen eti woot upaakiil, eyya néhuunoolo niŋ pusuwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Hilim nihisokoo: “Piyeer, lito! Muk illi!” <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Pale Piyeer naañahan ti hisoku: “Hitaakiit, Ateeteyo! Kaatuko inci taapala li efoofa eyya <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> nihikite hili ti hisoku nii ekuulut.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Naakalaŋaa Lewitik 11 aafacuk eeha Pútuun pa mpusoke ha Pusuwif pa niŋ kéyyoo ti púlukuleen empa mpikitii pa hili.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Hilim ha nene hisokoo púsupiyenu: “Waah ewwa Pútuun pa mpukuulane, timpi sok nii ukuulut.” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Eehuu nihitaako fo ñáhaaciil, tokotoko kahuuy ka nkíseepinee patiila. <figure style="fig" alt="L’apparition/la descente de pres d’un voile contenant toutes sortes d’animal" file="GW 163.jpg" size="col" loc="10:9-16" copy="Wade NT" ref="10:16">Kahuuy ka keeyekane ka élukuleen óo élukuleen</figure><verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Piyeer naayeno káamiilool hiti eeha naacuke ha. Ti oom káasiiŋuma, pákayiin paka payenka Kooneli naapoñe ka nkacol ti putum pa, loho kacakanoolaa ekumpaan ya eti Simon. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Nkayonkal nkacakan: “Fo le Simon aŋa nkasok a Piyeer naawanane?” <verse eid="ACT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Piyeer naaloŋ ti káamiilool hiti eeha naacuke ha, <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkusokoo: “Sincan, pákayiin pákahaaciil unka nkacakani. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Fiye, lito uwwano inkaay neyii timpi taak kunuu kúsupak kaatuko inci póñiyii.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Piyeer náawanoonii, naasokii: “Eheeyam, inci inniyem ti hiŋes, weyme ínnikeyii?” <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Nkasokoo: “Kooneli ápoñii unii, áhampaatiin asoocaali, áyiin <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">eecoonoole</char> naafe Pútuun, <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa púlooŋ nkákup teyoo heenape. <char style="w">Maleekoo</char> ya eti Pútuun pa éfulii teyoo neesokoo ayonkali pati ekumpaan ya eteyoo kati ásiitan eeha ankaakaay hisoku.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Fiye, Piyeer naasokii kánakoonii naawananii.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 10:23">Piyeer pati Kooneli</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Eti kacom eteyyo, Piyeer naanapool neyii, pakakee ti kéeyinane ka pakati Yope nkanapanii. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Eti tanta eteyyo, naacol ti saatee ya eti Sesaale, Kooneli naayeno hítuulu écolii ya eteyii. Naaconcoolan miin ma miteyoo niŋ pákawiyoo keekoloo ka meemak. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" /><char style="w">Piyeer</char> niŋ panakiyaloo ti ekumpaan ya, Kooneli naapaakoolanoo, náakilipo ti wootoo naanimpanoo. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Pale Piyeer naalitanoo, naasokoo: “Lito inci lompo an kenseŋ.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Akina ti káakup niŋ Kooneli, naanako páhantuwa, naacuk kayoŋ ka nkuconcooliye, <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />naasokii: “Aluu faŋ aluu nímeyimeyi nii <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hitoonii hicoonut unii <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> upunakanoolo niŋ <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char>; uyinaatii ékey hiyoop. Pale Pútuun pa píyisanaam-yísan nii, inci ñaŋut fiye hicoku an nii akuulut. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Ekina ewune emma ínniyonkaliyaam ma inci ínkey peetaakut kunuu kúsupak. Weyme ínniyonkaliyaam?” <figure style="fig" alt="Kooneli respecte Pierre" file="GW 164.jpg" size="col" loc="10:24-29" copy="Wade NT" ref="10:29">Kooneli naanimpan Piyeer</figure><verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Kooneli naasokoo: “Kunoom kíhaaciil keemuuse ti sitalaŋ síhaaciil ense inci iyyeniye kaluum ti ekumpaan ya etoom. Tokotoko, an eewasiye wañ weehiina paŋ naasiiŋo hátikinam, <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />naasokam: 'Kooneli, Pútuun pa písiyaasi kaluum ka kitii, pifiilut lompo kayankanan ka enka ánhin ka ti keeleke ka. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Fiye, poñ pakan ti saatee ya eti Yope kápiyonkalii Simon aŋa nkasok a Piyeer. Oopa awanane lati Simon apaalaha ya, ekumpaan ya eteyoo néeyemi pukol kaatii ka.' <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Ekina ewune inci inhaŋ hipoñu ti awe, ánhin heenape áapikey. Fiye, ehe unii púlooŋ hátikin Pútuun pa, kati úsi eeha púlooŋ mpuwufanuu ha aakati sok unii.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Piyeer naacoop hilim ha naasok: “Inci meya fiye nii pánipani Pútuun pa pifisakanoolut pakan paka, <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />pale ti písii pa púlooŋ, Pútuun pa pisayanaasayan an óo an eefeye po náahin <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">heecoonoole</char>.<verse eid="ACT 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />“Nímeyimeyi nii Pútuun pa púpoñiyoopoñ ti pakati <char style="w">Israyel</char> ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eti kásuumaay ka kéenapii ka ti Yéesu Krista, eeyem ya <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> ati pakan paka púlooŋ. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Nímeyimeyi heetaakiye ha, púcook ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Galilee</char> niŋ heetaakiye ha lompo ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Judaay</char> púlooŋ. Eehuu púlooŋ nihitaako pamuusal <char style="w">pátise</char> ya eyya <char style="w">Saŋ</char> naayeniye ya káatuunan. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Nímeyimeyi lompo fa Pútuun pa mpimamale fa Yéesu ati Naasalet mpíhin <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> kúpuwanoonii teyoo, mpuwufanoo lompo sempe. Yéesu naayeno kaamuusool ti pisaatee pa náahin heenape, náakuuñan payenka <char style="w">Seetaani</char> néewuuliye ka kaatuko Pútuun pa piyenaayeno neyoo.<verse eid="ACT 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />“Unii uyem keetantake ka eeha náahine ha púlooŋ <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> niŋ ti pikee pisaatee pa piti Pusuwif pa. Nkamukoo ta nkapempeŋoo ta ti <char style="w">kuluwaa</char> ya,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta Piyeer naasoke ta hilim eehuu, asok: “Nkamukoo ta nkánintoo ta ti enuun ya kaloŋa.” Kalaŋ heekiicee ha ti noot ya eti 5:30. </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />pale ti hinoom ha híhaaciyenu ha Pútuun pa mpilitanoo ti eket ya. Mpíhin ápiyisanoolo. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />Ayísanooliit ti pakan paka púlooŋ pale ti keetantake ka payenka Pútuun pa mpimamale ka ta infiyye, poko kayem unii. Unii uliye nuulaan neyoo ta náalitoonii ta ti eket ya. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Naasok unii ukaman pakan paka eeha nuucuke ha, núutuunanii nii, akina Pútuun pa mpisiiŋane apiyeno áhina kíiti ya ati keeyem ka kaloŋa niŋ keekete ka. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" /><char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">Piyaamakoola</char> pa púlooŋ kákupaakup kiteyoo ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>, nkasok nii an óo an éeyinane ti Yéesu, ti caacawoo Pútuun pa efipuponket umuuyen wa uteyoo.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ewánoonii ya eti Kunuu ka keenape ka ti keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />
    <char style="w">Piyeer</char> ti káakup kilim enke, <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkúwanoonii ti keeyeniye ka púlooŋ káasiitan hilim ha, <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45-46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45-46" />nkáyaañ káakup niŋ pikee pikaŋ nkayeno hímulu Pútuun pa. <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa kéeyinane ka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:45-46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta Luk naakiice ta eehuu, asokut “Pusuwif pa” pale asok “keenakiye ka ti písiyool empa Pútuun pa mpiliile pa niŋ <char style="w">Abraham</char>.” Kalaŋ heekiicee ha ti “Kanakan” ti Káawincinool Kilim. </char></note> kéenapoolii ka niŋ Piyeer, ta nkásiye ta eehuu ínnimii kamma Pútuun pa mpuwufane <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char> lompo Kunuu ka keenape ka. Fiye, Piyeer naasok: <verse eid="ACT 10:45-46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Páawoo Kunuu ka keenape ka kúwanooniyoo-wano teyii samat nii fa nkúwanoonii fa ti unaa Pusuwif pa, ayme ayina hikituyii íhinuyee <char style="w">pátise</char> niŋ man?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Naawufan hilim kati káhinee pátise ti caacaw ca citi Yéesu Krista. Púful toko, nkaluum Piyeer apiyeno neyii fo kikee kunoom.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Kañahan ka kiti Piyeer kéeyinane ka pakati Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">Pupoñapoñ</char> pa niŋ kéeyinane ka keekine ka ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Judaay</char> nkási nii pakakee ti <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char> kasayanaasayan lompo <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Ta <char style="w">Piyeer</char> naacole ta <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa kéeyinane ka nkawatanoo <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />ti hisoku: “Aakaayaakaay pati keeneetaat ka Pusuwif, illi lompo neyii apan kanakiit ti písiyool empa Pútuun mpiliile pa niŋ maamaa atuunaa <char style="w">Abraham</char>!”<verse eid="ACT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Fiye, Piyeer naakamanii heetaakiye ha púlooŋ kápiliŋ ti púcook. Naasokii: <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Ta inci iyyeniye ta ti saatee ya eti Yope piyeno kaluum, waah núufulii ti inci pucuk fiye nii éyawut iyyaake. Incuk waah wéefulii patiila úpuhiiŋii peti inci, weecuke nii kahuuy kenfakat, sitonkoŋ sa sipaakiil sa insiŋuntee. Kahuuy enkuu nkíkey pukolam. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Insincan lupo pinap, incuk púlukuleen piti woot upaakiil niŋ púlukuleen piti elampa niŋ empa mpúhuunoolo, niŋ pusuwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Fiye, ínsi hilim heeyeniyaam hisoku: 'Piyeer, lito! Muk illi!' <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Pale iññahan ti hisoku: 'Hitaakiit, Ateeteyo! Kaatuko efoofa eyya <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> nihikite hili ti hisoku nii ekuulut etaapala enako ti putumam.' <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Hilim ha níhifulii patiila nene hisokam púsupiyenu: 'Waah ewwa Pútuun pa mpukuulane, timpi sok nii ukuulut.' <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Eehuu nihitaako fo ñáhaaciil, púful toko, eehuu púlooŋ nihicoopee patiila. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Ti oom káasiiŋuma, pákayiin pákahaaciil kéefulii ti saatee ya eti Sesaale kéepoñiyee ti inci, nkácolii ti ekumpaan ya la nuuyeniye la. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" /><char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkusokam napool neyii timpi taak kunuu kúsupak. Kéeyinane ka isak niŋ oonool a payenke nkanapanam, nuunako lati ekumpaan ya eti áyiin a eeyonkalaam ya. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Naasok unii puume naacuke <char style="w">maleekoo</char> néenakoonii lati ekumpaan ya eteyoo neesokoo: 'Poñ pakan ti saatee ya eti Yope kapica káyonkalii Simon aŋa nkasok a Piyeer. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Afaasoki kilim keekaakaayi kafakan, awe niŋ miin ma mitii púlooŋ.' <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Emma inci íncooke ma káakup <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkúwanoonii teyii samat nii fa nkúwanoonii fa ti unaa ti púcook pa. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Fiye, inci ínnawuno eeha <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> mpaasok ha: '<char style="w">Saŋ</char> <char style="w" lemma="Pátise">ápatiseyaa-pátise</char> pakan paka niŋ man pale aluu éfinihinee pátise niŋ Kunuu ka keenape ka.' <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Híinihiini nii, kawun enka Pútuun pa mpuwufane ka unaa ta núuyinanaa ta ti Ateeteyo Yéesu Krista, kikina lompo mpuwufane keeneetaat ka Pusuwif. Fiye, inci yem ayme kati yíni hikitu Pútuun pa eeha mpílafiye ha?” <verse eid="ACT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Ta nkásiye ta eehuu, nkatempan. Nkámul Pútuun pa ti hisoku: “Fiye, keeneetaat ka Pusuwif lompo, Pútuun pa puwufaniiwufan la éfikasik kati káwunko umuuyen wa uteyii, nkataak eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kéeyinane ka pakati Antiyok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Pamuusal eket ya eti Stíifan, kéeyinane ka nkakallanee fo nkahancooliye. Pakakee teyii nkatey fo ti mah ma miti Fenisi, pakakee paka fo ti econ ya eti Siip, pakakee paka lompo fo ti saatee ya eti Antiyok, nkayeno káatuunan ekooŋan ya éesuume ya, pale ti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa lamma. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Háati ekina, intaako teyii kéeyinane pakati Siip niŋ Silen keekaaye Antiyok nkayeno káatuunan ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Yéesu <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char>.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta Luk naakiice ta eehuu, asokut “keeneetaat ka Pusuwif” pale asok “Pikilek pa”. </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Sempe sa siti Ateeteyo insiyeno neyii, hícump pakan nkáyinan nkánanfii ti Ateeteyo.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Kéeyinane ka pakati <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> nkási eehuu. Fiye, nkapoñ Barnabas Antiyok. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Ta naacole ta naacuk kaasampan ka kiti Pútuun pa, ínsuumoo. Naapenanii kunuu ti hisokuyii kásik piliit tiw ti Ateeteyo niŋ saanii púlooŋ, <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />kaatuko Barnabas an eenape, naameeŋ niŋ <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> naataak káyinan kenfakat. Hícump pakan nkananf ti Ateeteyo.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Púful toko, Barnabas naakaay ti saatee ya eti Taas hiŋes Sóol. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Ta naacukoo ta naacoopoo Antiyok. Nkayeno po etiil púmpuluŋ niŋ kéeyinane ka, nkakalaŋan hícump pakan. Po Antiyok pinapana pa nkáyaañee kayonkalee Pikelecen.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Ti kunoom enkuu, <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> nkáfulii Jerusalem nkakaay Antiyok. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Oonool teyii caacawoo Akapus naalito, Kunuu ka keenape ka nkútunkoo apusok nii efitaak épankul enfakat ti mah ma púlooŋ. (Pánipani eehuu nihitaako ta Kulot naayeniye ta amansa ya enfakat a ati <char style="w">Room</char>.) <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Fiye, pinapana pa nkasok nii efikawufan waah, an óo an la naayina, ewwa efikapoñ kati kayankanan kéeyinane ka keekine ka ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Judaay</char>. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Hikina nkáhine: nkawufan wo Barnabas niŋ Sóol, nkasokii cakawufan ñíhampaatiin ña pakati kéeyinane ka keeyem ka ti saatee ya eti Judaay.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Himukuyee ha hiti Saak niŋ hikuluyee ha hiti Piyeer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Ti oom caanak <char style="w">Helot</char> Akilipa faaf a ayeniye amansa ya. Naacok pakakee ti kéeyinane ka kati akallanii. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Naamuk <char style="w">Saak</char>, <char style="w">Saŋ</char> púnuwoo, niŋ káakuntu. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Ta naacuke ta nii eehuu hísuumaasuum <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa, naacok lompo <char style="w">Piyeer</char>. Eehuu nihitaako ti kunoom ka kiti pahaaño pa piti <char style="w">Himuusu ha</char>.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta Luk naakiice ta eehuu, asok: “Ti kunoom ka kiti pahaaño pa piti kúmpuul ka keetaakut ka leweñoo.”</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Ta Piyeer naacokee ta, Helot naakuloo, naapoñ uyoŋ upaakiil uti pusoocaali pakapaakiil kati kasayool efaas ya eteyoo. Náalafiyoo íhinu kíiti hátikin pakan paka niŋ pahaaño pa piti <char style="w">Himuusu ha</char> pumuusaa. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Fiye Piyeer naayeniyee efaas ti ékuluma, pale kéeyinane ka nkaŋiino kaluum Pútuun pa kiteyoo.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Efúlaniyee ya eti Piyeer ti ékuluma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Hánant ha le niŋ <char style="w">Helot</char> áfaahinoo kíiti, <char style="w">Piyeer</char> naayeno hiŋotu ti pututa pusoocaali pákasupak, naacenkee niŋ ñiseel ñúsupak. Pusoocaali nkayeno efaas ti putum pa piti ékuluma ya. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Tokotoko <char style="w">maleekoo</char> eti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> néefulii teyoo neesiiŋo pukoloo, ecaaŋ neecaaŋan cataŋ ékaap ya. Maleekoo ya neesap Piyeer ti kaheh néeyiyaloo, neesokoo: “Lito mpacas!” Tokotoko ñiseel ña ñeecenke ña sipeesoo iññiyoŋo. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Púful toko, maleekoo ya neesokoo: “Cenk peletoo ya etii, iwwaso pisamata pa pitii.” Piyeer náahin ho. Maleekoo ya neneesokoo: “Waso hísool ha hitii henfakat ha, ínnowii ti inci.”<verse eid="ACT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Piyeer náaful naanapan yo. Pale ámiit nii eeha maleekoo ya néehine ha hiti pánipani, incukoo nii éyawut. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Fiye, nkamuus la pusoocaali pa pákayaañ paka nkayeniye la efaas, nkamuus lompo lati pákasupiyenu paka. Púful toko, nkacol ti hunkut ha hiti mañ ma hiti ékuluma ya eeha annap ha teeho aapiteenako ti saatee ya. Hunkut ha níhipankinoolo hátikinii. Nkáful nkacok pítin pa fo kálaaŋan caahinkiŋ. Tokotoko maleekoo ya neeyemaŋ hátikin Piyeer. <verse eid="ACT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Tempo conko Piyeer naameya heetaakiye ha. Naasok: “Fiye, inci meya nii pánipani Ateeteyo ápoñiyoopoñ maleekoo ya eteyoo kati efakanam néefulaniyam ti sempe sa siti Helot niŋ ti eeha <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkálafiye ha kati áhinam.” <figure style="fig" alt="La libération de la prison de Pierre par l’ange" file="GW 166.jpg" size="col" loc="12:9-11" copy="Wade NT" ref="12:11">Maleekoo neefakan Piyeer ti ékuluma</figure><verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Ta naameya ta heetaakiye ha, naakaay ti ekumpaan ya eti <char style="w">Mari</char>, íññaa ya ati <char style="w">Saŋ</char> aŋa nkasok a lompo Mark. Hícump pakan nkaconcool po kapiyeno kaluum. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Piyeer naawenken hunkut ha hiti tíkitaaŋ, amiikan aal aŋa nkasok Lota naayiiŋo. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Naakiiw hilim Piyeer. Naameeŋ niŋ pásuuma fo naafiile káapankin, naañoho niŋ katey naasok: “Aha Piyeer pati hunkut ha!” <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Nkasokoo: “Ee, aawuyaawuyo!” Pale naaŋiino ti eeha naasoke ha. Fiye nkasokoo: “Ooto maleekooyoo.” <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Ta nkayeniye ta káakup, Piyeer naatowo ti kaawenken. Ta nkápankine ta nkacukoo ínnimii meemak. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Piyeer naanako náayisanii niŋ epeesoo timpi kaceek. Púful toko naakamanii puume Ateeteyo náafulaniyoo ti ékuluma ya. Fiye naasok: “Nisok ho <char style="w">Saak</char> niŋ pakakee paka kéeyinane ka.” Púful toko, náaful apikaay lakeenaay.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Eti kacom eteyyo, pusoocaali pa keeyeniye ka efaas Piyeer nkaliim paliimal. Nkacakanoolo: “Peyme Piyeer naayem?” <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Helot naapoñ kapiŋesoo, pale kacukutoo. Fiye, naacakanool pusoocaali pa; apipa, naawufan hilim kapumukee. Púful toko, náaful mah ma <char style="w">Judaay</char> ápuwanoonii ti saatee ya eti Sesaale naayeno po.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eket ya eti Helot Akilipa faaf a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Ti oom caanak, amansa ya <char style="w">Helot</char> naataak paseeña penfakat ti pakati Til niŋ Siton. Páawoo paliyal pa piteyii, pati mah ma miti amansa ya ímpufulii tan óo tan, ekina ewune nkapoñ teyoo pakan kapica kaluumoo. Nkakaay nkákup niŋ Palastus, áhina ya ati hikawoo, apiyankananii. Fiye, naanapool neyii kapikaay hicuku Helot nkasokoo nii kálafilafi púsuumool neyoo. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Helot naacoon kati kacukool. Hinoom eeha naawufanii ha kati ákup neyii níhicolii, naawaso hísool ha hiti himansate ha, naayeno ti <char style="w">elemeyu</char> ya eteyoo. Náakup niŋ kayoŋ ka. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Pakan paka, ta nkásiyoo ta ti káakup, nkayeno kaaceeceekool: “Eeyem ya ti káakup, akee ti ñútuun ña pale an tom!” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Tokotoko <char style="w">maleekoo</char> eti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> néetahii Helot káakuuñu, kaatuko hamake ha hiti Pútuun pa nkacoope kapuwufanoo, pale añahanut ho Pútuun pa. Fiye, puhoc mpinako munowoo naaket.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />
    <char style="w">Hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> níhimeyiyee pihaŋhaŋ toko, pinapana pa nkayeno épenanoyii.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hipoñuyee ha hiti Sóol niŋ Barnabas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Ti oom caanak, Barnabas niŋ Sóol nkapa páhin pa empa nkawufanii pa kati káhin <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>. Fiye, nkañoho Antiyok, nkacoopool <char style="w">Saŋ</char> aŋa nkasok a Mark.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Intaako ti kéeyinane ka pakati Antiyok <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> niŋ pikalaŋana, poko kayem: Barnabas, Sóol, Simeyon aŋa nkasok a Apáani, Lusiyus ati Silen niŋ Manayen (akina ayem éekulee ya nantoonool niŋ amansa ya <char style="w">Helot</char> Antipas). <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Hikee hinoom, poko ti suŋ niŋ kaanimpan <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char>, <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkusok: “Niyenan ti kaapii Barnabas niŋ Sóol, hak páhin empa inci iyyonkalii pa.” <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Fiye, ta nkapaye ta suŋ niŋ kaluum nkalemp sipeesii ti Barnabas niŋ Sóol, púful toko, nkakatanii kapikaay.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pikaayu pa piti Barnabas niŋ Sóol Siip</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Fiye, ta <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkupoñe ta Barnabas niŋ Sóol, nkakaay ti saatee ya eti Selusi. Kápuful toko, nkáyuuko ti piteen penfakat nkakaay ti econ ya eti Siip. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Ta nkacole ta Siip ti saatee ya eti Salamin, nkátuunan ekooŋan ya éesuume ya ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">púluumuma</char> pa piti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa. <char style="w">Saŋ</char> Mark naayeniyii kayankanan.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Nkafiitan econ ya púlooŋ fo ti saatee ya eti Pafos. Ta nkacole ta Pafos nkatook toko áyiin pátuuta aŋa nkasok Pal-Yéesu, Asuwif eecokooliye nii ayaamakoola. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Améyooli-méyooli niŋ ati hikaw ha hiti econ ya aŋa nkasok a Seesiyus Póolus, áyiin eecohatiye. Hikee hinoom, ati hikaw ha naapoñ kápiyonkalii Barnabas niŋ Sóol, kaatuko álafilafi káasiitan ekooŋan ya éesuume ya. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Pale pátuuta pa Elimas (caacawoo ti kaŋ ya eti Kilek) naapook Barnabas niŋ Sóol, kaatuko álafiit ati hikaw ha kati áyinan ti Yéesu Krista. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Fiye, Sóol aŋa nkasok a lompo Póol naameeŋ niŋ Kunuu ka keenape ka. Naasincanoo caw <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />naasokoo: “Awe nincaama, áhina heenaput, añii <char style="w">Seetaani</char>, akamool heenape! Teyme áafayekuno kaanakanool tooñaa ya eti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char>? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Fiye síitan, Ateeteyo afaasapi, aatinenecuk caanak ca, áafafuum fo cikee caanak.” Tokotoko Elimas náafuum, naayeno ti énimaan. Naayeno toko káamaaputool aŋa áfaatintiŋanoo. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Ta ati hikaw ha naacuke ta heetaakiye ha, náayinan ti Ateeteyo Yéesu. Eeha nkakalaŋanoo ha hinakiyoonako meemak. <figure style="fig" alt="le magicien Elimas refuse Saul et Barnabas" file="GW 169.jpg" size="col" loc="13:6-12" copy="Wade NT" ref="13:12">Pátuuta pa Elimas naapook Barnabas niŋ Sóol</figure><verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Póol niŋ Barnabas lati éluumuma ya eti Antiyok ti mah ma miti Pisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Púful toko, Póol niŋ pinapooloo nkáyuuko ti piteen penfakat ti saatee ya eti Pafos kapikaay Peek, saatee eti mah ma miti Panfili. <char style="w">Saŋ</char> Mark náatahiyii toko náañohoonii <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Pale Póol niŋ pakakee paka, kápuful Peek nkakaay Antiyok, saatee eti mah ma miti Pisiti. Ti <char style="w">hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</char> hiti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkanako ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">éluumuma</char> ya nkayeno. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Ta nkapaye ta kalaŋ <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char> niŋ pakiical pa piti <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa, ñíhampaatiin ña pakati éluumuma ya nkapoñ an apicaasokii: “Aluu pakan unii, niŋ nitaakaa eeha efinisok keeyem ka le kati nipenanii káyinan, níyiniyini káakup.”<verse eid="ACT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Póol naalito. Náaseepin epeesoo, naasok: “Aluu pakati <char style="w">Israyel</char> niŋ aluu lompo <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char> keefeye ka Pútuun pa, nísiitanam! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Pútuun pa piti pakati Israyel, pimamalaamamal símaama unii. Mpíhinii kapimeeŋ ta nkayeniye ta ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Esipt</char>. Púful toko, mpúfulaniyii po niŋ sempe etempo. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Fo sitiil áwii ésupak (40) mpumukutoolo neyii ti <char style="w">káahaaŋ ka tes</char>. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Mpumukal sísii isak niŋ súsupak ti mah ma miti Kanaan, mpuwufan pakan etempo etaam ya épiyenoonii eteyii. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Eehuu púlooŋ, pifiyo eteeho pitaakaa fiye máamun sitiil sikeme sipaakiil niŋ áwii ésupak niŋ ŋaasuwan (450).</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">“Pamuusal eehuu, mpuwufanii píhina kíiti kapiyeno pakati kikaw fo ti caanak ca citi Samiyel ayaamakoola ya. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Púful toko, pakan paka nkasok nii kálafilafi hitaaku amansa. Pútuun pa mpuwufanii Sóol añii ya ati Kis ati miin ma miti Benjamin, akina ayeniye amansa ya ateyii fo sitiil áwii ésupak (40). <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Pale Pútuun pa mpúfulanoo ti himansate ha mpíhin <char style="w">Dawid</char> apiyeno amansa ya ateyii. Mpúkup kiteyoo ti hisoku nii: 'Cukaacuk Dawid añii ya ati Yesaay, áyiin eenowaam ti yaan, áfaahin eeha púlooŋ inci íllafiye ha ápihin.'<verse eid="ACT 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />“Ti miin ma miti Dawid aŋuu, Pútuun pa mpúfulanii <char style="w">Afakana</char> ya ati Israyel, samat nii fa mpíyinanane fa ta infiyye. Akina ayem Yéesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Le niŋ Yéesu áfaakey, Saŋ naayeno káatuunan pakati Israyel púlooŋ: 'Níhinee <char style="w">pátise</char> nípiyisan nii níwunkaawunko umuuyen wa utaaluu.' <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Ta páhin pa piti Saŋ mpulohane ta hipayu, naasok: 'Ti aluu, inci yem ayme? Inci neetaat aŋa inniyem ya ti hítuulu. Pale nísiitan: aŋuu áfaakey pusonam, inci yinaat fala káfulan pisamata pa piteyoo.'<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />“Aluu pakanam, keeyem ka epuuk <char style="w">Abraham</char>, niŋ aluu lompo keeneetaat ka Pusuwif keefeye ka Pútuun pa, unaa Pútuun pa mpúpoñii hilim ha hiti kafakan enke. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Pánipani, pakati Jerusalem niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakateyii kakiiwut Yéesu nkamukoo. Pale ta nkamukoo ta, ti káameyaatiyii nkáhine heesokee ha ti pakiical pa piti piyaamakoola pa empa nkakalaŋ pa lóokuŋ óo lóokuŋ ti hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Kacukut heewune kati áhinee kíiti naamukee, pale háati fo, nkaluum <char style="w">Pilaat</char> apumukoo. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Ta nkapaye ta íhinu heekiicee ha púlooŋ teyoo ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>, nkáwananiyoo ti <char style="w">kuluwaa</char> ya,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta Póol naasoke ta hilim eehuu, asok: “Nkáwananiyoo ti enuun ya.” Kalaŋ heekiicee ha ti noot ya eti 5:30.</char></note> nkahokoo ti hiyaak. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Pale Pútuun pa mpílitaniyoo ti eket ya! <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Fo kunoom keemeeŋe Yéesu náfulii ti pakan paka, keeyeniyoo ka kanapan kápiliŋ ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Galilee</char> fo ti saatee ya eti Jerusalem. Poko kayem fiye ti káatuunan pakati Israyel eeha nkacuke ha. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Unii payenke, úcoopiyoocoop aluu ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eyye: Eeha Pútuun pa mpíyinanane ha símaama unii nii efihitaako, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />fiye, mpíhin ho unii epuukii, ta mpilitane ta Yéesu ti eket ya, samat nii fa inkiicee fa ti hícimu ha hísupiyenu ha hiti pakiical pa piti kícimu ka. Mpusok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">
    <char style="qt">'Awe yem añiinam,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">
    <char style="qt">písik fíyooy inci yem faafi.'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Kícimu 2:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="ACT 13:33" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />“Pútuun pa mpusok nii éfipilitaniyoo ti eket ya, eniinoo etefut. Fiye mpusoke ho:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">
    <char style="qt">'Inci fawufan aluu weesampanee wa,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:34">
    <char style="qt">ewwa inci íyyinanane wa Dawid ta infiyye nii fawufanoo wo.'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:3">Esayi 55:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="ACT 13:34" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />“Ekina ewune Dawid nene akiic ti hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa apusok po:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">
    <char style="qt">'Aatikat enii amiikan a atii eenape ya,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:35">
    <char style="qt">epufut ti hiyaak.'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:10">Kícimu 16:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="ACT 13:35" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />“Dawid ti caanak ca citeyoo, ta naapaye ta íhinu waah wa púlooŋ ewwa Pútuun pa mpílafiye wa, naaket. Naahokee niŋ símaamayoo, eniinoo neefut. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Pale aŋa Pútuun pa mpilitane ya ti eket ya, afutut. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38-39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38-39" />Yéesu awune núuyemi aluu ti káatuunan kaaponket ka kiti umuuyen wa. Kéeyinane ka púlooŋ teyoo Pútuun pa pucokiicok nii <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">keecoonoole</char> ciit, pale hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha hiti Móyiis hiyinaat íhinu aluu kati nicokee nii keecoonoole ciit. <verse eid="ACT 13:38-39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Fiye, nitah kunuu ancuk eeha piyaamakoola pa nkasoke ha timpi hitaako aluu. Kasok:<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />
    <char style="qt">'Nisincan, aluu kéewiiniyanaam ka,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">
    <char style="qt">niyeno ti paliima inniket!</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">
    <char style="qt">Kaatuko ti caanak ca citaaluu inci fáhin waah,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">
    <char style="qt">étiniyinan wo, háati an naasok wo aluu.'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 1:5">Hapakuk 1:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Ta Póol niŋ Barnabas nkayeniye ta hífulu ti éluumuma ya, pakan paka nkaluumii kati káñohoonii lóokuŋ eyya lupo, ti hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka, kati kátuunanii nene eehuu. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Ta nkahancooliye ta, hícump Pusuwif niŋ keenanfe ka ti pítin pa piti Pusuwif pa nkanapool niŋ Póol niŋ Barnabas. <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">Pupoñapoñ</char> pa pákasupak paka nkákup neyii, nkasokii kákipen kati katowo ti kaasampan ka kiti Pútuun pa.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pikaayu pa piti Póol niŋ Barnabas pati keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />
    <char style="w">Hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</char> hiti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa níhicolii, máamun pakan paka púlooŋ pakati saatee ya kaconcooliye kati kásiitan <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Ta Pusuwif pa nkacuke ta kayoŋ ka, nkataak paheeka ti Póol niŋ Barnabas. Ta Póol naayeniye ta káatuunan nkálaacinoo nkateñaloo. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Fiye, Póol niŋ Barnabas nkañahanii niŋ híyiinate henfakat, nkasokii: “Ti aluu Pusuwif pa hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa nihiñaŋee hícooku káatuunanee. Pale páawoo nipookaapook ho, innicokoolo nii nítuuniit hitaaku eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya, fiye, unii efuuyeso ti <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char>. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Kaatuko eehe <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> naasoke unii. Asok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">
    <char style="qt">'Inci hínuu aapiyeno ecaaŋ ya</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">
    <char style="qt">ti keeneetaat ka Pusuwif,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">
    <char style="qt">Aakati cóopii kafakan ka</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">
    <char style="qt">pan óo pan ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>.'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:47 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:6">Esayi 49:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Ta keeneetaat ka Pusuwif nkásiye ta eehuu, ínsuumii meemak, nkáyaañ hímulu hilim ha hiti Ateeteyo. Nkáyinan, poko púlooŋ payenka Pútuun pa mpimamale ka kati kataak eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Hilim ha hiti Ateeteyo nihihancaloolo ti mah ma púlooŋ. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Pale Pusuwif pa nkanoŋan pakaal paka keemaka ka kéetuule ka Pútuun pa niŋ ñíhampaatiin saatee ya, nkalito ti Póol niŋ Barnabas, nkakallanii fo káfulanii ti mah ma miteyii. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Fiye, Póol niŋ Barnabas nkahank haafol ha ti wootii kápiyisanii nii Pútuun pa efipisapii, nkakaay ti saatee ya eti Ikoñum. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Pinapana pa nkameeŋ niŋ pásuuma niŋ <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char>.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Pikaayu pa piti Póol niŋ Barnabas Ikoñum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Po, ti saatee ya eti Ikoñum, moonool muu nii heetaakiye ha Antiyok, Póol niŋ Barnabas nkanako ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">éluumuma</char> ya eti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkayeno káakup fo hícump Pusuwif niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Keeneetaat ka Pusuwif">keeneetaat Pusuwif</char> káyinan. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Pale Pusuwif pa keepooke ka káyinan nkanoŋan keeneetaat ka Pusuwif kapitaak pámiiloolal peenaput ti kéeyinane ka. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Póol niŋ Barnabas nkakampan Ikoñum ti káakup niŋ híyiinate niŋ káyinan kiti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char>. Ateeteyo lompo naawufanii kayine kiti íhinu hícump píyisan niŋ weecukantee ápiyisan nii hilim ha hiti panap pa piteyoo eeha nkátuunan ha, hiti pánipani. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Pakan paka pakati saatee ya nkápaacinoolo: pakakee ti kaapii ka kiti Pusuwif pa, pakakee paka ti kaapii ka kiti <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa pákasupak paka. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Pusuwif pa niŋ keeneetaat ka Pusuwif niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakateyii, nkasiiŋo kati kakallan Póol niŋ Barnabas kati kamukii niŋ <char style="w">kaanunkal</char> pukumpa. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Ta pupoñapoñ pa nkásiye ta eehuu nkatey Listal niŋ Teep, pisaatee piti Likawoni, niŋ ti pisaatee pa péekinkoole po pa. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Po lompo nkayeno káatuunan ekooŋan ya éesuume ya.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pikaayu pa piti Póol niŋ Barnabas Listal niŋ Teep</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Intaako ti saatee ya eti Listal áyiin aŋa nayeno tan óo tan kayen kamma wootoo núuhute, éehute kápiliŋ ta naapukee, ataapala akaay. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Hikee hinoom naayeno káasiitan Póol, Póol naasiiŋan ñíkinoo teyoo naacuk nii aŋe, ataakaataak káyinan kiti káakuuñanee. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Naaceek naasokoo: “Lito insiiŋo aapucoonool ciit!” Ayíin a naanuut náayaañ pikaayu.<verse eid="ACT 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Ta kayoŋ ka nkucuke ta eeha Póol náahine ha nkaceek ti kaŋ ya eteyii Likawoni nkasok: “Ñútuun ña<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ti oom caanak, pakati Kilek kámiit Pútuun poonool; kameeŋaameeŋ ñútuun. Oom ñútuun ñineetaat ñútuun pánipani, pale ñinakoolaa-nakool nii pínaati.</char></note> ñíwanooniyoo tuunaa samat nii pakan.” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Nkawas Barnabas caacaw ca citi pútuun pa piteyii “Sás”;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ti ñútuun ña ñiti Kilek, Sás ayeniye amansa ya, Heemes naayeno pútuun pa empa mpúcoopii pa pukooŋan pa péefulii pa pati Sás niŋ ñikee ñútuun ña. </char></note> páawoo Póol ayem ákupa yuu, nkayonkaloo “Heemes”. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Awaaseena ya ati ekumpaan ya eti Sás eeyem ya puson saatee ya náakey ti ñutum ña náacoopoolii kíciin niŋ páluufeen. Akina niŋ kayoŋ ka nkálafi kaawaaseen kíciin ka pupoñapoñ pa pákasupak paka. <verse eid="ACT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Pale ta Barnabas niŋ Póol nkásiye ta eehuu, nkahaacalool kúsool ka kiteyii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkaloomloom ihaacu kúsool ka kiteyii niŋ an ateñalaa Pútuun pa kápiyisan nii seeñiiseeñ meemak.</char></note> kápiyisan nii cíitiyiiciiti meemak, nkatey kapinako ti kayoŋ ka nkasokii niŋ hiceeku: <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Aluu pákawiyam, weyme ínnihine fiyuu? Unii lompo pakan kenseŋ samat nii aluu! Ukéyyookey écoopii aluu ekooŋan ya éesuume ya kati nikatan pínaati pa pitaaluu peetaakut pa nafaa ínniyesoonii peti Pútuun pa peeyem pa kaloŋa. Pikina piliile patiila niŋ t’etaam niŋ waah óo waah weeyem toko, mpiliil lompo kaatii ka niŋ waah óo waah weeyem lupo. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Ti caanak ca citi símaama unaa, pikatanaakatan písii pa púlooŋ pipimamal pítin pa péesuume po pa. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Pale píyekuniit éyisanoolo pínapii ti heenape ha eeha mpíhin ha ti pakan paka, samat nii fa mpúwananii fa etiil, mpuwufan aluu pamaañal peenape ta incole ta toko, mpuwufan aluu paliyal fo nisiit, mpimeeŋan saan aluu lompo niŋ pásuuma.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Pale háati eeha pupoñapoñ pa nkasoke ha, ínciiti meemak kati kakit kayoŋ ka kaawaaseenii kíciin ka.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Púful toko, pakakee <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> nkácolii kápufulii ti pisaatee pa piti Antiyok niŋ Ikoñum. Nkañak kayoŋ ka ti kaapii ka kiteyii <char style="w" lemma="Kaanunkal">nkanunkal</char> Póol pukumpa kati kamukoo. Nkáhuunoo fo káful ti saatee ya, kaatuko cukiicuk nii aketaaket. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Pale pinapana pa, ta nkákinkoole ta Póol, náalitoonii, naanako ti saatee ya. <figure style="fig" alt="La foule qui tire Paul a meme le sol en dehors du village croyant qu’il est mort" file="GW 174.jpg" size="col" loc="14:19-20" copy="Wade NT" ref="14:20">Kayoŋ ka nkúhuun Póol tíkitaaŋ saatee ya pucukii nii aketaaket</figure></para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 14:20">Póol niŋ Barnabas, puñoho pa piteyii Antiyok ti mah ma miti Siriya</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 14:20">Eti kacom eteyyo, Póol niŋ Barnabas nkakaay ti saatee ya eti Teep. <verse eid="ACT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Nkayeno ti saatee eyyuu káatuunan ekooŋan ya éesuume ya fo nkataake hícump pakan kéeyinane ti Yéesu. Púful toko, nkañoho ti pisaatee pa piti Listal, Ikoñum niŋ Antiyok ti mah ma miti Pisiti. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Po, nkapenan pinapana pa káyinan, nkapenanii lompo kunuu kati katowo ti hicoku piliit tiw ti káyinan ka. Nkasokii: “Fo ucukaa hícump kúnuul kati unakiyaa ti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Lan óo lan la taake kéeyinane, Póol niŋ Barnabas nkamamal pakan kati kayeno ñíhampaatiin. Kapipa kaluum niŋ suŋ, nkañomanii <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> aŋa poko púlooŋ nkáyinane ya teyoo.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Fiye nkanap ti mah ma miti Pisiti nkacol ti mah ma miti Panfili. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Ta nkátuunane ta pakati saatee ya eti Peek ekooŋan ya éesuume ya, nkawano ti saatee ya eti Atali.<verse eid="ACT 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Púful toko, nkáyuuko ti piteen penfakat kapuñoho Antiyok ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Siriya</char>. Ti oom saatee impi kañomanee ti sipees Pútuun pa, le niŋ éfikacook páhin etempo empa nkapaye pa. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Ta nkacole ta, nkaconcoolan kéeyinane ka nkakamanii eeha púlooŋ Pútuun pa mpíhine ha neyii niŋ fa mpípankine fa putum pa piti káyinan ka ti <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char>. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Nkakampan po niŋ pinapana pa.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Pucukool pa piti Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Pakakee Pákayiin nkáfulii ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Judaay</char> kápuwanoonii ti saatee ya eti Antiyok nkayeno kakalaŋan kéeyinane ka nii: “Niñaŋee <char style="w">kanakan</char> ti písiyool empa Pútuun pa mpiliile pa niŋ maamaa atoonii <char style="w">Abraham</char>, samat nii fa nuunakan fa epuuk unii niŋ kataakaa kunoom isak niŋ kíhaaciil. Niŋ ninakanutee, samat nii fa <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char> nihisoke fa unii, étiniyiniyee kafakan.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Póol niŋ Barnabas kacoonut eeha pákayiin paka nkasoke ha, nkálaacinool neyii meemak. Ti oom pílaacinool, nkasiiŋo ti eehe: Póol, Barnabas niŋ pakakee efikakaay <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> kápukup hilim eehe niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña.<verse eid="ACT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Fiye, kéeyinane ka nkawufanii aŋa nkasoolahe ya ti kaakaawool ka. Nkanap ti mah ma miti Fenisi niŋ <char style="w">Samali</char> nkakamanii puume <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char> nkáyesoonii ti Pítin pa piti Yéesu. Eehuu níhisuum meemak kéeyinane ka púlooŋ. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Kapucol Jerusalem, kéeyinane ka, pupoñapoñ pa niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña nkawananii. Póol, Barnabas niŋ pinapoolii nkakamanii eeha púlooŋ Pútuun pa mpíhine ha neyii. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Pale pakakee ti kéeyinane ka keeyem ka ti kayoŋ ka kiti <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa nkasiiŋo nkasok: “Keeneetaat ka Pusuwif, fo kanakanee ti písiyool empa Pútuun pa mpiliile pa niŋ maamaa atuunaa Abraham, samat nii fa nuunakanaa fa epuuk unaa niŋ kataakaa kunoom isak niŋ kíhaaciil, fo kasokee lompo nii kañaŋaa hítuulu hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha hiti Móyiis.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Pupoñapoñ pa niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña nkaconcool kati kákup ti hilim ha. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Nkákupat meemak. Fiye, <char style="w">Piyeer</char> naasiiŋo naasok: “Aluu pakanam ti káyinan, nímeyimeyi nii Pútuun pa pimamalaam-mamal ti aluu ta infiyye, pútuunan ekooŋan ya éesuume ya keeneetaat ka Pusuwif kati kási ho nkáyinan. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Pútuun pa pímeyimeyi saan pakan paka mpíyisan nii pisayanaasayan keeneetaat ka Pusuwif ta mpuwufanii ta <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char>, samat nii fa mpuwufane ko fa unaa. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Pifisakanoolutii niŋ unaa, káyinan ka kiteyii kuwune Pútuun pa mpukuulan saanii. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Fiye, weyme uwune ínniyemi ti puwinko Pútuun pa? Innílafi katiyan pinapana pa pitiyo empa símaama unaa niŋ unaa nuuyinaataa pitiyo. <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Pale úyinanaayinan nii kamma panap pa piti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Yéesu nuufakanee samat nii poko.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Fiye, keepaakoole ka toko púlooŋ nkafatan kati kásiitan Póol niŋ Barnabas kapikamanii píyisan pa peemeeŋe pa niŋ weecukantee wa ewwa Pútuun pa mpíhine wa ti keeneetaat ka Pusuwif pínapii teyii. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Ta nkapaye ta káakup, <char style="w">Saak</char> naasokii: “Aluu pakanam ti káyinan, nísiitanam! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simon akamanaakaman unaa fa Pútuun pa mpíyaañe fa pipikaay hiyoop keeneetaat ka Pusuwif mpimamal pakakee teyii kápiyenoonii pakan etempo. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Eehuu nihinapool niŋ kilim ka kiti <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa samat nii fa inkiicee fa ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />
    <char style="qt">'Ateeteyo asok: Hikee hinoom, inci fáñohoonii</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">
    <char style="qt">pineneñahan cáwii ca citi <char style="w">Dawid</char> céepucaloolee ca incihancaloolee.</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">
    <char style="qt">Fanenesiiŋan co</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">
    <char style="qt">íññahanii sempe etenco.</char>
    <verse eid="ACT 15:16" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />
    <char style="qt">Ancuk pikee písii pa efipiŋesam, inci Ateeteyo Pútuun pa,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">
    <char style="qt">poko kayem keeneetaat ka púlooŋ Pusuwif</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">
    <char style="qt">payenka inci iyyonkale ka kati káyenoonii pakanam.</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">
    <char style="qt">Inci pusok ho aluu, inci Ateeteyo Pútuun pa,</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 9:11-12">Amos 9:11-12</ref> </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="ACT 15:17" />
  </para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />
    <char style="qt">yísanaayisan ho ta infiyye.'”</char>
    <verse eid="ACT 15:18" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Saak nene asok: “Ehe eeha inci ímmiiloole ha: uñaŋutaa kayokan keeneetaat ka Pusuwif keeyem ka ti éyesoonii ti Pútuun pa. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Pale ukiicii upusokii timpi kali efoofa eewaaseenee ti énaati kaatuko ekuulut. Nuusokii lompo timpi kayeno ñusupoolata, timpi kali efoofa eti élukuleen eetaaŋutee, timpi kali efoofa eetaake hísim. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Kaatuko kápiliŋ ti caanak ca citi símaama unaa, intaako ti saatee óo saatee pakan payenka nkátuunan hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha hiti Móyiis. Lóokuŋ óo lóokuŋ nkakalaŋ ho, ti <char style="w">hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</char>, ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">púluumuma</char> pa.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Leetal ya eepoñee ya ti kéeyinane ka keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Fiye, <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña poko niŋ kéeyinane ka púlooŋ keeyem ka <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> nkásiyool kati kamamal pakakee teyii payenka nkakaakaay hipoñu ti saatee ya eti Antiyok kapinapool niŋ Póol niŋ Barnabas. Nkamamal Silas niŋ Yutas aŋa nkasok a Paasapas, poko t’ésupakii keemaka ti kéeyinane ka. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Nkawufanii leetal eyye:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 15:23" />
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 15:23">“Unii pakan aluu ti káyinan, pupoñapoñ pa niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña, unka nuukican aluu, aluu kéeyinane ka <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char> keekine ka ti saatee ya eti Antiyok niŋ ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Siriya</char> niŋ Silisi.<verse eid="ACT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Usíyaasi nii pakakee káfulii petoonii nkákey puutaaluu kapiliimanool aluu nkawas aluu káamiilool niŋ eeha nkasoke ha, unii úpoñiyootii. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Ekina ewune unii púlooŋ cew núusiyool upumamal pakakee núupoñiyii kápinapoolii niŋ pákawi unaa Barnabas niŋ Póol, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />pákayiin keenoomane síinuyii kamma caacaw ca citi <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Yéesu Krista. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Fiye, núupoñii Yutas niŋ Silas kati kakaman aluu niŋ ñutumii kilim ka kutoonii enke. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Héesuume ha <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> níhisuum lompo unii hiyem, timpi utiyan aluu pitiyo peenapa niŋ neetaat peeyinaatee pa kakatan empe: <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Timpi nili efoofa eewaaseenee ti énaati, timpi nili efoofa eetaake hísim, timpi nili efoofa eti élukuleen eetaaŋutee, timpi niyeno ñusupoolata. Niŋ níhinut fo efitempo naaluu.</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 15:29">Fo ti pikee.”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Fiye, keeñaŋe ka hicoopu leetal ya nkawano Antiyok. Ta nkacole ta, nkaconcenool kéeyinane ka púlooŋ nkawufanii leetal ya. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Nkakalaŋ yo ínsuumii meemak kamma eeha nkásiye ha nihiyankananii kapucok piliit. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Páawoo Yutas niŋ Silas <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char>, nkafiyo ti káakup niŋ kéeyinane ka kati kapenanii káyinan, nkasokii kacok piliit. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Nkakampan po, púful toko kéeyinane ka nkakatanii kapikaay ti kásuumaay kati kañoho pati kéepoñiyii ka. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Pale Póol niŋ Barnabas nkayeno Antiyok. Poko niŋ hícump pakakee, nkayeno kakalaŋan niŋ káatuunan hilim ha hiti Ateeteyo.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Píkatinool pa piti Póol niŋ Barnabas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Piyeno cikee caanak, Póol naasok Barnabas: “Maañohiyaa hiyoop kéeyinane ka ti pisaatee pa púlooŋ empa máatuunanaa pa hilim ha hiti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> kati máameyiyaa ti eeha nkayem.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Barnabas náalafi kapucoopool <char style="w">Saŋ</char> aŋa nkasok a Mark, <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />pale Póol naasokoo nii kañaŋutoo kaacoopool kaatuko ti mah ma miti Panfili náatahiyii, nene anapoolut neyii ti páhin pa piteyii. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Nkáñakalool teeho meemak fo nkákatinoole. Barnabas naacoopool Mark, nkáyuuko ti piteen penfakat kapikaay ti econ ya eti Siip. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Pale Póol naamamal Silas naañak, kéeyinane ka nkañomanoo ti sipees Ateeteyo. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Naakaay ti pisaatee pa piti mah ma miti <char style="w">Siriya</char> niŋ Silisi naayeno kapenan káyinan kéeyinane ka.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Hinanfu ha hiti Timote, ti Póol niŋ Silas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Púful toko, Póol nene akaay ti pisaatee pa piti Teep niŋ Listal. Po, intaako anapana aŋa nkasok Timote. Iññáa ateyoo <char style="w">Asuwif</char> éeyinane, pale paapaa ateyoo <char style="w" lemma="Keeneetaat ka Pusuwif">aneetaat Asuwif</char>. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Kéeyinane ka keekine ka ti pisaatee pa piti Listal niŋ Ikoñum nkákup heenape ti Timote. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Póol náalafiyoo kaacoopool ti kaakaawool ka kiteyoo. Fiye, <char style="w" lemma="Kanakan">naanakanoo</char> samat nii fa Pusuwif pa nkanakan fa epuukii niŋ kataakaa kunoom isak niŋ kíhaaciil ti písiyool empa Pútuun pa mpiliile pa niŋ maamaa ateyii <char style="w">Abraham</char>. Ahínaahin eehuu kaatuko Pusuwif pa keekine ka toko púlooŋ kámeyimeyi nii Timote faafoo aneetaat Asuwif. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Púful toko Póol niŋ pinapooloo nkañak. Saatee óo saatee eyya nkacole teyyo, nkátuunan hilim ha eeha <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakati <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> nkacenke ha. Nkasok kéeyinane ka káhin heesokee ha ti hilim eehuu. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Kéeyinane ka nkahaŋ toko nkataake sempe ti káyinan ka, hinak óo hinak nkayeno épenanoyii.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eyónkaliyee ya eti Póol ti mah ma miti Masetoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Pamuusal eehuu, <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkikit Póol niŋ pinapooloo káatuunan <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> ti mah ma miti Asii. Fiye, nkanap ti mah ma miti Filiki niŋ Kalati. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Ta nkacole ta ti mah ma miti Misi, nkayoop pinako ti mah ma miti Pituni, pale Kunuu ka kiti Yéesu kucoonutii. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Fiye, nkamuus Misi, nkawano ti saatee ya eti Tolowas. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Oom hánant, áyiin ati Masetoni náafulii ti Póol pucuk fiye nii éyawut. Ayíin a naasiiŋo naayeniyoo kaluum: “Fíitanii pe Masetoni iyyankanan unii!” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Póol ta naapaye ta hicuku eehuu, nuuhaaŋ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Le ucukaacuk nii Luk himuumoo, eekiice ya pakiical empe, ananfaananf ti Póolii kapikaay kaakaawool ka.</char></note> ti pilito nuuŋes pikaayu Masetoni kaatuko híinihiini unii nii Pútuun pa piyonkale unii po káatuunan ekooŋan ya éesuume ya.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káyinan ka kiti Lidi ti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Núuyuuko ti piteen penfakat ti saatee ya eti Tolowas, nuucoonool ciit upukaay ti econ ya eti Samotalas. Eti kacom eteyyo, nuukaay ti saatee ya eti Neyapolis. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Upúful toko nuukaay Filipoy, saatee eemaka ti mah ma miti Masetoni, néeyenoonii eti <char style="w">Room</char>, nuukampan toko. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Ti <char style="w">hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</char> hiti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa, núuful ti saatee ya upukaay ti kanaac musuu ma, kaatuko úyinanaayinan nii, toko efitaak la pakan paka nkaluum. Ta nuucole ta, nuuyeno, núukup niŋ pakaal paka keeconcoole ka toko. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Akee teyii caacawoo Lidi, eepukee ti saatee ya eti Tiyatil. Anoomana pupaŋ péeñifee péeciita hinoom éetuule Pútuun pa. Aal a aŋuu náasiitan unii, <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> náapankin kunuuwoo kati atah ko ti kilim ka kiti Póol. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Náahinee <char style="w">pátise</char> niŋ miin ma miteyoo. Púful toko naaluum unii ti hisoku: “Niŋ nímiiloolaa-míilool nii, inci pánipani yínanaayinan ti Ateeteyo, níkey nipiwanan la ti inci.” Naaŋiino unii fo ucoon.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hikuluyee ha hiti Póol niŋ Silas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Hikee hinoom nuuyeno pikaayu la pakan paka nkaluum la. Ti pikaayu empuu, akee amiikan ámaacul ati <char style="w">hísaalumant</char> náakey kapaakoolan unii. Hísaalumant eehuu nihiwun nasok heekaakaay ha ékey. Nakaman pakan paka heekaakaayii ha pitaako. Ti eehuu payenka naayem ka teyii ti himiikanate ha nkataak hícump mañ. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Naayeno kanapan Póol niŋ unii, niŋ hiceeku: “Pákayiin paka payenke pimiikan pakati Pútuun pa piti patiila! Kákeyyookey káatuunan aluu pítin pa piti kafakan ka!” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Amiikan a náahin eehuu kunoom keemeeŋe. Ti pikelan, Póol inseeñoo, naayeso lipa teyoo naasok hísaalumant ha: “Inci sokuu, ti caacaw ca citi Yéesu Krista: fúl ti ámaacul a!” Tokotoko hísaalumant ha níhiful.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Payenka ámaacul a naayem ka teyii ti himiikanate ha kapucuk eehuu nkámeyi nii étinekayini hitaaku mañ teyoo. Fiye, nkacok Póol niŋ Silas nkáhuunii fo ti híliŋ ha hiti saatee ya nkawufanii pakati kikaw ka. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Púful toko nkacoopii ti píhina kíiti ya pakati <char style="w">Room</char> keeyem ka toko Filipoy, nkasokii: “Pákayiin paka payenke <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char>, nuutookii ti kaanakanool saatee ya. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Nkáyemi ti kakalaŋan pucosaan empa unaa pakati Room nuuñaŋutaa kasayan niŋ kanapan.”<verse eid="ACT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Kayoŋ ka nkilito ti Póol niŋ Silas. Píhina kíiti ya pakati Room nkawufan hilim kapilam kúsool ka kiteyii nkasapii niŋ kisawut. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Kapipayii hisapu meemak nkawantii ti ékuluma, nkawufan hilim afaasa ya ati ékuluma ya apitah kunuu teyii. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Afaasa ya, ta náasiye ta eehuu, naanakanii páhantuwa ékuluma ya naakincool wootii ti upapaloo úsupak weenapa.<figure style="fig" alt="Paul et Silas se mettaient à chanter dans la prison, leurs pieds attachés sur des planches" file="GW 176.jpg" size="col" loc="16:24-28" copy="Wade NT" ref="16:24">Póol niŋ Silas nkayeno caacook ti ékuluma, wootii nuucenke ti pupapaloo</figure><verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Mpisit, Póol niŋ Silas nkayeno kaluum niŋ caacook ti kaanimpan Pútuun pa. Pakakee paka keekulee ka nkayeniyii káasiitan. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Tokotoko etaam ya néeyiyiŋan meemak focaa ékuluma ya. Kunkut ka kiti ékuluma ya nkihaaŋ ti épankino, ñiseel ña ñiti keekulee ka púlooŋ iññiyoŋalo. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Afaasa ya ápiyiyoonii naacuk kunkut ka nkípankiniye, náañakii káakuntu ka kiteyoo ápilafi emukoolo kamma incukoo nii keekulee ka kateyalaateyal. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Pale Póol náaceekii niŋ kaawiiluyoo: “Timpi kuumoolo! Ehe unii púlooŋ le!”<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Afaasa ya naacakan lampi naawaaf páhantuwa ékuluma ya niŋ kakikilan kamma ewatate naanow ti woot Póol niŋ Silas. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Púful toko, náafulaniyii naacakanii: “Aluu ñíhampaatiin ña, puume inci iññaŋe íhinu kati fakanee?” <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Póol niŋ Silas nkañahanoo: “Yínan ti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Yéesu, aafafakanee, awe niŋ miin ma mitii.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Nkátuunanoo hilim ha hiti Ateeteyo, akina niŋ keekine ka púlooŋ ti ekumpaan ya eteyoo. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Ti oom hánant afaasa ya naahaaŋii ti hicoopu naatoot musontuwaay ma miteyii. Tokotoko náahinee <char style="w">pátise</char> niŋ miin ma miteyoo púlooŋ. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Naacoop Póol niŋ Silas lati ekumpaan ya eteyoo naawufanii kapili. Naameeŋ niŋ pásuuma, akina niŋ miin ma miteyoo púlooŋ, kaatuko áyinanaayinan ti Pútuun pa.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Cipilap, píhina kíiti ya pakati Room nkapoñ pusoocaali kapusokii cakasok afaasa ya ati ékuluma ya akatan Póol niŋ Silas. <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Afaasa ya naasok Póol: “Píhina kíiti ya kasok inci katan aluu, fiye níyiniyini éfulii nipikaay ti kásuumaay.” <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Pale Póol naasok pusoocaali pa: “Kasapaasap unii hátikin pakan paka púlooŋ péehinutee kíiti apan unii pakati Room, púful toko nkawant unii ti ékuluma. Fiye nkálafi unii hiyaanu ti piyolo? Etihitaako! Poko faŋii kákey kápufulan unii!” <verse eid="ACT 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Pusoocaali pa nkasok eehuu píhina kíiti ya; emma nkásiye ma nii Póol niŋ Silas pakati Room nkafe. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Nkákey kapuluumii kaaponket, nkáfulanii ti ékuluma ya nkaluumii kapikatan saatee ya. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Púful toko, Póol niŋ Silas nkáful ti ékuluma ya nkakaay pati ekumpaan ya eti Lidi. Pacolalii po, nkatook toko kéeyinane ka nkasokii kacok piliit. Kapipa káakup nkañak.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Póol niŋ Silas ti saatee ya eti Tesalonik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Póol niŋ Silas nkanap ti pisaatee pa piti Anfipoli niŋ Apoloni, nkacol Tesalonik. Intaako toko <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">éluumuma</char> eti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char>. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Póol naakaay po samat nii fa naasale fa íhinu pan óo pan pa naakaaye. Fo sílookuŋ síhaaciil ti <char style="w">hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</char> hiti Pusuwif pa, nákupat neyii hiti <char style="w" lemma="Hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa">pakiical pa piti Pútuun pa</char>. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Naakamanii, náayisanii nii, <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> añaŋaa hicuku kúnuul kenfakat, náalitoonii ti eket ya. Naasokii: “Yéesu aŋa inci iyyem ya aluu ti káatuunan ayem Eenucee ya.”<verse eid="ACT 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Pakakee Pusuwif nkáyinan nkananf ti Póol niŋ Silas. Hícump <char style="w" lemma="Keeneetaat ka Pusuwif">keeneetaat Pusuwif</char> kéetuule Pútuun niŋ hícump pakaal keemaka lompo nkananfii.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Pale pakakee Pusuwif nkataak paheeka teyii nkaconcoolan pakan keetaakut haaci payenka nkayeno ti ñítin ña nkanoŋan kayoŋ ka nkawen saatee ya. Nkawaaf lati ekumpaan ya eti áyiin aŋa nkasok Sason hiŋes Póol niŋ Silas kati kacoopii pati híliŋ ha <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />pale kacukutii. Nkacok Sason niŋ pakakee kéeyinane nkacoopii ti pakati kikaw ka pakati saatee ya nkayeno hiceeku: “Póol niŋ Silas, kéeyiyiŋane ka <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> púlooŋ, kácoliyoo le. <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Sason awananii lateyoo. Unka ti íhinu eeha, amansa ya enfakat a ati <char style="w">Room</char> naakite ha: hisoku nkayaake nii taakaataako akee amansa aŋa nkasok Yéesu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Kayoŋ ka niŋ pakati kikaw ka kápisi kilim enkuu nkaliim. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Fiye, Sason niŋ kéeyinane ka nkahintan mañ nkakatanee.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Póol niŋ Silas ti saatee ya eti Peloy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Niŋ pacokal etenco, kéeyinane ka nkapoñ Póol niŋ Silas ti saatee ya eti Peloy. Kapucol, nkanako lati <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">éluumuma</char> ya eti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Pusuwif pa pakati toko nkahaŋ píyiyo pakati Tesalonik, nkásiitan pitempo tak ekooŋan ya éesuume ya. Hinak óo hinak nkasincan <char style="w" lemma="Hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa">pakiical pa piti Pútuun pa</char> kapucuk man eeha Póol nasokii ha hiti pánipani. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Hícump teyii nkáyinan. Ti <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char>, hícump pakaal keemaka niŋ lompo pakakee pákayiin nkáyinan.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Pale ta Pusuwif pa pakati Tesalonik nkásiye ta nii Póol oopa ti káatuunan <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> Peloy, nkakaay po, nkanoŋan kayoŋ ka fo kiliiñool. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Ti oom káasiiŋuma, kéeyinane ka nkahaaŋ ti hipoñu Póol ti kaatii. Pale Silas niŋ Timote nkatowo Peloy. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Keecoope ka Póol nkakaay neyoo fo ti saatee ya eti Aten. Púful toko, nkañoho niŋ ekooŋan eti Póol ti Silas niŋ Timote eesokii nii katookoo Aten mpacas.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Póol ti saatee ya eti Aten</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Ta Póol naayeniye ta hítuulu Silas niŋ Timote Aten, naacuk nii saatee ya emeeŋaameeŋ pínaati, ínciitiyoo meemak. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Naakaay ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">éluumuma</char> ya naayeno kákupat niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa niŋ <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char> kéetuule ka Pútuun pa. Hinak óo hinak nakaay lompo ti híliŋ ha hiti saatee ya kákupat niŋ keeyeniye ka toko. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Intaako toko pikalaŋana keeyeniye pílaacinool neyoo, pakakee pinapana pakati Epikulus, pakakee paka pinapana pakati Seno. Teyii, pakakee nkasok: “Weyme eemeeŋe ya aŋe káakup náalafiye hisoku?” Pakakee paka nkasok: “Cukaacuk nii ñútuun ñiti pikee písii naayem ti káatuunan.” (Kasokaasok eehe kamma Póol náatuunane ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eti Yéesu niŋ pilito pa ti eket ya.) <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Fiye, nkacoop Póol nkakaay neyoo ti híliŋ ha eeha nkasok ha Aleyopak, la píhina kíiti ya pakati saatee ya nkapaakool la. Keecoopoo ka nkacakanoo: “Uyíniyini kameye héeyeeni eeha ayyem ha ti káatuunan? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Aapa ti káakup waah wéenime unii, núulafi kameye weyme ayyem ti hisoku.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />(Ti oom caanak, pakati Aten niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Akaawoola">ekaawoola</char> ya keekine ka toko kayekut hikee niŋ neetaat káakup niŋ káasiitan kéeyeeni ka keeyem ka ti pikaayu.) <figure style="fig" alt="Paul en parlant à Athens, un village rempli de fétishes" file="GW 180.jpg" size="col" loc="17:16-21" copy="Wade NT" ref="17:21">Póol ti káakup Aten, saatee eemeeŋe pínaati</figure><verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Púful toko, Póol naasiiŋo hátikin píhina kíiti ya pakati Aleyopak naasok: “Aluu pakati Aten, inci cukaacuk nii nísikaasik piliit tiw ti pínaati pa pitaaluu. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Kaatuko ta inci iyyeniye ta kaafiitanool saatee ya, piyeno kaasincan uciin wa utaaluu, cukaacuk koonool tewwo, ehe heekiicee ha toko: 'Kaaciin enke kiti pútuun péemiitee.' Aŋa ínnimiit ya inninimpan, akina inci ínkeyii káatuunan aluu. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Pútuun pa peeliile pa <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> niŋ waah wa púlooŋ weeyem wa lupo, pikina piyem <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> ati patiila niŋ t’etaam. Pikinut ti <char style="w" lemma="Ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa">pukumpaan</char> empa pakan nkalute kati nkaluum po toko. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Pusoolahut kapimankool po pucuk fiye nii taakaataak waah ewwa mpitaakut. Kaatuko pikina himuum etempo puwufane pakan paka púlooŋ eloŋ, esuuŋut niŋ waah óo waah. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Ti púcook puu mpiliile an oonool. Ti oom an mpinape mpiliil písii pa púlooŋ kati kakin lan óo lan ti púlunta pa. Le niŋ efipiliilii, pisiiŋanaa-siiŋan ta síi óo síi efeetaako niŋ ta efeekelan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: “píkatinoolaa-kátinool etiil niŋ hasa.”</char></note> mpiniik pilehu la neeñaŋe la hikinu. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Pútuun pa píhinaahin eehuu ancuk pakan paka kati kaŋes po; pikee pa ti hiŋes eehuu, efikalaŋan po ti káamaaputool, apan pílaaŋut an óo an tuunaa. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Kaatuko pikina puwune nuutaakaa eloŋ ya nuumuusoolaa, nuutaakiyaa. Fiye pakakee ti pikiica pa pakataaluu nkasoke: 'Unaa lompo epuuk etempo.'<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />“Páawoo unaa epuuk Pútuun, uñaŋutaa káamiilool nii Pútuun pa pucukaacuk nii himuum heememanoolee niŋ sanoo, mañ niŋ ekina tom énankiin: waah ewwa an náamiiloole ti hikawoo naamemanool wo niŋ pasuuse sipeesoo. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Pútuun pa pifiyaafiyo mpitahut kunuu ti káameyaati enkuu. Pale fiye, puwufanaawufan hilim pakan paka púlooŋ pan óo pan kati káwunko umuuyen wa uteyii. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Kaatuko pisiiŋanaa-siiŋan hinoom eeha éfipihin kíiti púlunta pa <char style="w">pucoonool</char> ciit pínapii ti an a aŋa mpimamale ya. Mpíyisan eehuu picaaŋ cataŋ ti pakan paka púlooŋ, ta mpílitaniyoo ta ti eket ya.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Ta nkásiye ta pilito pa ti eket ya, pakakee paka nkápalahooloo nkalenkenoo, pale pakakee paka nkasok: “Aakati ñóhoonii hikee hinoom upunene úsiitani teeho.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Fiyuu Póol náafule ti oom káasiiŋuma. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Pale pakakee nkanapanoo nkáyinan. Ti poko, intaako áyiin caacawoo Denis, akee ti píhina kíiti ya pakati Aleyopak, niŋ akee aal caacawoo Tamalis niŋ pakakee lompo.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Póol ti saatee ya eti Kolint</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Púful toko, Póol náafulii ti saatee ya eti Aten apikaay ti saatee ya eti Kolint. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Po, naapaakool niŋ <char style="w">Asuwif</char> aŋa nkasok Akilas eepukee ti mah ma miti Pont. Ayíin a aŋuu féefiye náacolii niŋ aaloo Prisila, káfuliyooful ti mah ma miti Itali kamma amansa ya enfakat a Kulot naasoke nii Pusuwif pa púlooŋ káful ti saatee ya eti <char style="w">Room</char>. Póol naakaay pateyii; <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />páawoo páhinii poonool, pimemanoola púkuut, naawanan lateyii naayeno páhin neyii. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Lóokuŋ óo lóokuŋ, ti <char style="w">hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</char> hiti Pusuwif pa, Póol nákupat ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">éluumuma</char> ya eteyii naaŋes íhinu Pusuwif pa niŋ <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char> kápiyinan ti Yéesu.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Ta Silas niŋ Timote nkácolii ta páfulaliyii ti mah ma miti Masetoni, Póol naakatan waah óo waah apucoonool ti káatuunan ekooŋan ya éesuume ya, náayisan Pusuwif pa picaaŋ cataŋ nii Yéesu ayem <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Pale Pusuwif pa nkapookoo nkateñaloo. Fiye, naahank haafol ha ti wañ wa uteyoo naasokii: “Niŋ nilinciyaa, inci tom Pútuun pa efipuwatan pale aluu! Písik fíyooy, inci fayeso ti keeneetaat ka Pusuwif.”<verse eid="ACT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Póol náaful ti éluumuma ya naakaay pati áyiin aŋa nkasok Yustus, áyiin éetuule Pútuun. Ekumpaan ya eteyoo neekolool niŋ éluumuma ya. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Kilispus, áhampaatiin a ati éluumuma ya, náayinan ti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> akina niŋ miin ma miteyoo púlooŋ. Hícump pakati Kolint nkáyinan ta nkásiye ta Póol ti káakup, nkáhinee <char style="w">pátise</char>.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Hikee hánant, Ateeteyo náafulii ti Póol pucuk fiye nii éyawut, naasokoo: “Timpi fe, towo ti káakup tan óo tan, timpi fatan! <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Kaatuko inci oopa niŋ awe, an átayiniyi pilaako kati akallani, kamma hícump pakan ti saatee eyye nkayem pakatoom.”<verse eid="ACT 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Fiye, Póol naayeno Kolint fo etiil niŋ kiim isak niŋ hoonool kakalaŋanii <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Póol hátikin Kaliyoŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Ta Kaliyoŋ naayeniye ta ati hikaw ha hiti mah ma miti Akayi, <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkaconcool nkalaako Póol nkacoopoo pati éhinuma kíiti ya. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Nkasok Kaliyoŋ: “Ayíin a aŋe oopa ti hítunku pakan paka káputuul Pútuun ti páhinal empa ammeya nii pinapoolut niŋ <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char>.” <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Pale Póol ákupum, Kaliyoŋ naasok keenooke ka Póol: “Nísiitan, aluu Pusuwif pa, fo heecoonoolut náahine? Fo amuuyenaa-muuyen? Niŋ fo, inci antiyeno písiitan aluu. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Pale páawoo pílaacinool lamma inniyaake kiti kilim, ucaw niŋ hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha hitaaluu, eehuu hitaaluu! Láfiit piyeno áhina eehuu kíiti!” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Fiye, naayaanii ti éhinuma kíiti ya. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Poko púlooŋ nkacok Sosten, áhampaatiin a ati <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">éluumuma</char> ya, nkasapoo hátikin éhinuma kíiti ya, pale Kaliyoŋ apaaliitii háati poonool.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Puñoho pa piti Póol Antiyok eti Siriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Póol naakampan ti saatee ya eti Kolint, púful toko náakatinool niŋ kéeyinane ka naakaay ti saatee ya eti Kenkele. Prisila niŋ Akilas nkanapool neyoo. Po, naayiin hikawoo ápiyisan nii áhinaahin eeha naasintooliye ha Pútuun pa. Fiye, nkacoop piteen penfakat peeyeniye pikaayu ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Siriya</char>. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Nkacol ti saatee ya eti Efes, toko Póol naatahe Prisila niŋ Akilas. Akina po, naakaay ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">éluumuma</char> ya naayeno kákupat niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Payenkuu nkaluumoo: “Penan piyeno noonii!” Pale Póol acoonut. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Náakatinool neyii ti hisokuyii: “Niŋ súumaa ti Pútuun pa, inci fanene ñóhoonii petaaluu ti pikee.” Fiye, náaful Efes niŋ piteen penfakat. <figure style="fig" alt="Paul prend une grande pirogue pour aller en Syrie" file="GW 182.jpg" size="col" loc="18:18-22" copy="Wade NT" ref="18:21">Póol naacoop piteen penfakat kapikaay Siriya</figure><verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Póol naaciŋ ti saatee ya eti Sesaale. Náatikin asilo <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> kakican kéeyinane ka, apipa naakaay Antiyok eti Siriya. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Naakampan toko ti saatee ya púful toko naakaay. Naanap ti mah ma miti Kalati niŋ Filiki naapenan káyinan pinapana pa púlooŋ.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apolos ti saatee ya eti Efes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Fiye, intaako <char style="w">Asuwif</char> aŋa nkasok Apolos, eepukee ti saatee ya eti Alesantili náacolii Efes. Ayíin a aŋuu eeyina káakup náameyi lompo <char style="w" lemma="Hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa">pakiical pa piti Pútuun pa</char> pinap. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Ayísanoolee-yísanool pítin pa piti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char>. Niŋ hame enfakat naayeniye káatuunan niŋ kakalaŋan pitempo tak kiti Yéesu, pale <char style="w">pátise</char> ya eti <char style="w">Saŋ</char> lamma naameya. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Fiye, naayeno káakup niŋ híyiinate ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">éluumuma</char> ya. Ta Prisila niŋ Akilas nkásiyoo ta, nkacoopoo lateyii, nkapenan kakamanoo picaaŋ cataŋ pítin pa piti Pútuun pa. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Púful toko, Apolos náalafi pikaayu ti mah ma miti Akayi. Kéeyinane ka nkapampaŋanoo apikaay. Nkakiic leetal pinapana pa pakati Akayi, kapusokii kawanan Apolos pinap. Ta naacole ta po naayankanan meemak kéeyinane ka kamma kaasampan ka kiti Pútuun pa. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Kaatuko ta nálaacinool ta niŋ Pusuwif pa hátikin pakan paka, akina naheekii. Náayisanii ti pakiical pa piti Pútuun pa nii, Yéesu ayem <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Hicolu ha hiti Póol ti saatee ya eti Efes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Ta Apolos naayeniye ta ti saatee ya eti Kolint, Póol naanap ti pítin pa piti mítintiŋ ma, naacol Efes. Naatook toko pakakee pinapana <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />naacakanii: “Fo <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> kúwanooniyoo-wano taaluu ta ínniyenoonii ta kéeyinane?” Pale nkañahanoo: “Utaapala úsi nkákupe kiti Kunuu ka keenape ka!” <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Póol naacakanii: “Ooto eyyeyme <char style="w">pátise</char> ínnihinee?” Nkañahanoo: “Pátise ya eti <char style="w">Saŋ</char>.” <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Póol naasokii: “Saŋ ápatiseyaa-pátise kéelafiye ka púwunko umuuyen wa uteyii. Naasok kayoŋ ka kíyinan ti aŋa eeyem ya ti ékey pusonoo, akina ayem Yéesu.”<verse eid="ACT 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Ta pinapana pa nkásiye ta eehuu, nkáhinee pátise ti caacaw ca citi <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Yéesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Póol naalemp sipeesoo teyii, Kunuu ka keenape ka nkúwanoonii teyii. Fiye, nkayeno káakup ti pikee pikaŋ nkayaamakool kilim enka Pútuun pa mpuwufanii ka. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Pákayiin paka payenkuu púlooŋ nkayeno máamun pakan ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Fo kiim káhaaciil Póol nakaay ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">éluumuma</char> ya eti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa, ápinakup niŋ híyiinate náatuunan <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>, náakupat niŋ keeyeniyoo ka káasiitan, naaŋes íhinuyii kápiyinan. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Pale pakakee teyii kéeciita káakup nkapook káyinan nkákup heenaput kiti Pítin pa piti Yéesu hátikin pakan paka púlooŋ. Fiye, Póol naakatanii naacoopool pinapana pa, nákupat niŋ pakan paka hinak óo hinak lati ékalaŋanuma ya eti Tilanus. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Eehuu nihitaako fo sitiil súsupak, ancuk keekine ka púlooŋ ti mah ma miti Asii, Pusuwif pa niŋ <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char> nkási hilim ha hiti Ateeteyo.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sekewa epuukoo pikampaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Po ti saatee ya eti Efes, Pútuun pa mpíhin hícump weecukantee wenfakat úpunapii ti sipees Póol. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Fiye, nkacoop pati kéekuuñe ka ufonkoloŋ niŋ ufaal wéelike Póol. Kéekuuñe ka nkákuuñanee, <char style="w" lemma="Hísaalumant">kísaalumant</char> nkúful teyii.<verse eid="ACT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Intaako pakakee <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> payenka nkamuusool ti pisaatee pa hiyaanu kísaalumant ti payenka nkúwuuliye ka. Nkaŋes hicoopu caacaw ca citi <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Yéesu kapiyaan ko, kapinkasok: “Sok aluu, ti caacaw Yéesu aŋa Póol nátuunan ya, nífulii!” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Akee <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">awaaseena enfakat</char> Asuwif, caacawoo Sekewa, naataak pikampaani isak niŋ pákasupak payenka nkáhin eehuu. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Pale, hísaalumant nihisokii: “Yéesu inci méyiyoomeyi, Póol inci méyimeyi akina ayem ayme, pale aluu niyem pakayme?” <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Ayíin a aŋa hísaalumant ha níhiwuuliye ha naalaakiyii, naasapii meemak naaheekii poko púlooŋ fo nkáful ti ekumpaan ya niŋ katey ñáfalfali siniinii musontuwaay. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Keekine ka Efes púlooŋ, Pusuwif niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Keeneetaat ka Pusuwif">keeneetaat Pusuwif</char>, nkási eehuu. Poko púlooŋ nkameeŋ niŋ ewatate, nkámul caacaw ca citi Ateeteyo Yéesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Hícump ti kéeyinane ka nkákey hátikin pakan paka nkawatanoolo nkakaman heenaput ha eeha nkáhine ha. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Teyii intaak púpatuuta, hícump níhicoopii púpukoo pa piteyii nkácumpool po nkasowan po hátikin pakan paka púlooŋ. Ta nkafine ta púpukoo pa nkacuk nii, niŋ kanoomanaa po éfikayini káakuuman pakan síwuli áwii ésupak niŋ ŋaasuwan (50,000) hinoom púmpuluŋ. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Fiyuu hilim ha hiti Ateeteyo níhimeyiyee pihaŋhaŋ toko, níhiyisan sempe eteeho. <figure style="fig" alt="L’incinération des livres des magiciens" file="GW 184.jpg" size="col" loc="19:19-20" copy="Wade NT" ref="19:20">Kasowan púpukoo pa piti púpatuuta pa</figure><verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káyiyiŋan ka kiti saatee ya eti Efes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Pamuusal eehuu, Póol naacok pikaayu <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: “Kunuu ka keenape ka kútunke Póol apucok pikaayu pa Jerusalem.” </char></note> pale áfaayaañ apinap ti mah ma miti Masetoni niŋ Akayi. Naasok: “Niŋ inci fúlaa Jerusalem, ñaŋaa pikaayu lompo <char style="w">Room</char>.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Fiye, naapoñ Timote niŋ Elast, pákasupak ti payenka nkayankananoo ka, ti mah ma miti Masetoni. Akina, naatowo ti mah ma miti Asii fo kikee kunoom.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Ti oom caanak, saatee ya eti Efes neewen meemak kamma Pítin pa piti Yéesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Intaako áyiin aŋa nkasok Temetilus, asafa mukumpaan miti mañ meenakoole nii ekumpaan ya enfakat ya la nkakaay la kaluum pútuun pa piteyii peeyaale pa empa nkasok pa Altemis. Toko, akina niŋ píhina pa pakateyoo nkataak mañ meemeeŋe. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Hikee hinoom, naaconcoolanii niŋ pakakee payenka nkáhin ka páhin pa poonool puu, naasokii: “Pákawiyam, nímeyimeyi nii, ti páhin pa putuunaa nuutaakaa hícump mañ. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Pale nicukaacuk ínnisi heetaakiye ha: Póol aŋuu asok nii waah óo waah ewwa pakan paka nkamemanoole niŋ sipeesii uyinaat piyeno Pútuun, naacoopool ti eehuu hícump pakan. Neetaat Efes lamma náahine eehuu pale focaa Asii fiye púlooŋ. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Neetaat páhin pa putuunaa lamma piyina hitaaku caacaw ceeŋoota, pale ekumpaan ya eti Altemis, pútuun pa penfakat pa putuunaa, éfeeyiniyee lompo káawiiniyan, Altemis himuum eteyyo néeful ti hamake eteyyo. Apan pakati Asii púlooŋ niŋ keekine ka pan óo pan ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> nkátuul po!” <figure style="fig" alt="Temetilus regroupe ses amis/coéquippiers pour leur mettre en mal avec Paul" file="GW 185.jpg" size="col" loc="19:23-27" copy="Wade NT" ref="19:27">Temetilus naaconcoolan pákawiyoo apunoŋanii ti Póol</figure><verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Ta nkásiye ta eehuu, kiiñii nkili meemak nkácook kaaceeceekool: “Altemis ati Efes ámakimaki!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Fiyiit, saatee ya púlooŋ neenakanoolo pánipani. Kayoŋ ka nkucok Kayus niŋ Alistaak, pákasupak pakati Masetoni kéenapoolii niŋ Póol ti kaakaawool ka, nkahiliikan kápuhuunii fo ti híliŋ. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Ti oom enakanoolo, Póol náalafi pikaayu káakup niŋ kayoŋ ka, pale pinapana pa kakatanutoo ápihin ho. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Intaako fala ti pakati kikaw ka keeyem pákawiyoo, nkapoñ kapuluumoo timpi akaay pati híliŋ ha. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Fiye, kayoŋ ka nkiliiñaloolo: pakakee paka nkayeno hiceeku kapusok eehe, pakakee paka nkaceek kapusok hikee. Hícump ti poko kámiit fala heeconcoolanii ha. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" /><char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkátunk hátikin akee áyiin aŋa nkasok Aliksant nkasokoo akaman kayoŋ ka heetaakiye ha. Fiye, náaseepin epeesoo kati ákup niŋ kayoŋ ka. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Pale ta nkacuke ta nii Aliksant Asuwif, poko púlooŋ nkaceek ti coonool niŋ hilim ha hoonool huu fo sitalaŋ súsupak ti hisoku: “Altemis ati Efes ámakimaki!”<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Ti pikelan, ákoosumpeel a ati saatee ya náahin kayoŋ ka kipifatan, naasok ko: “Aluu pakati Efes, fo taakaataak an éemiit nii Efes eyem émankuma ya eti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Altemis aŋa eemaka ya? Ayme ámiit nii énankiin eteyyo eeñeeya ya éenowii ya épufulii patiila, Efes lompo neeyem? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />An ayinaat ho káalaacin. Fiye, niñaŋaa kaatempan timpi níhin waah péemiiloolut. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Nícoopiyoocoop le pákayiin paka payenke, apan káliput ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">púluumuma</char> pa, kateñalut lompo pútuun pa peeyaale pa putuunaa. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Niŋ Temetilus niŋ píhinayoo kataakaa héeciitiyii ti pakan, taakaataak kunoom kiti kíiti intaak lompo píhina kíiti. Kakaay kapunookii po! <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Niŋ nitaakaa eeha innikaakaay hisoku lompo, po efihipayee káakup picaaŋ cataŋ hátikin pakan paka niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Kaatuko pakati Room éfikayini unaa hinooku ti heetaakiye ha fíyooy ti hisoku nii úyiyiŋanaa-yíyiŋan saatee ya, apan étuuyiniyaa kakaman heewune nuuconcooliyaa.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Ta naapaye ta hisoku eehuu naahancalool kayoŋ ka.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Kaakaawool ka kiti Póol ti mah ma miti Masetoni niŋ Kiles</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Pakati Efes kapitempan, Póol naapoñ kápiyonkalii pinapana pa naasokii nii kacok piliit. Púful toko nkákatinool, naakaay ti mah ma miti Masetoni. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Naafiitanool pisaatee pa piti po, náakup niŋ kéeyinane ka fo kamp ti hisokuyii kacok piliit. Púful toko, naakaay ti mah ma miti Kiles <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />naataak po kiim káhaaciil. Kiim ka káhaaciil ka kupumuus, naakaay kati áyuuko ti piteen penfakat apikaay ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Siriya</char>, pale náasi nii <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa kacenkaacenk heenaput teyoo, naasok fiye apuñoho apinap ti mah ma miti Masetoni. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Akina ti puñoho pa, pakakee pakan nkátiŋanoo, poko kayem: Sopatel ati saatee ya eti Peloy (akina ayem Pilus añiinoo), Alistaak niŋ Sekuntus pakati Tesalonik, Kayus ati Teep, Tikik niŋ Tolofim pakati Asii, niŋ lompo Timote. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Payenkuu nkanow unii hátikin nkátuul unii ti saatee ya eti Tolowas. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Ta pahaaño pa piti kúmpuul ka keetaakut ka leweñoo mpumuuse ta, núuyuuko ti piteen penfakat ti saatee ya eti Filipoy. Kunoom isak kupumuus, nuutookii Tolowas, nuuyeno po fo lóokuŋ.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kalitanee ka kiti Atík ti eket ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7-8" />Sipiti ya nkániim, nuuconcoolo ti ékaap eeyem patiila ekumpaan kati úpaacinool hímpuul.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:7-8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kasalaasal hili nantoonool. Ti keemeya ka <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>, hícump níhimiilool nii, nkapayaa hili, nkafiitool kúmpuul nkápaacinool ko samat nii fa Yéesu náahine fa ti káciim ka kiteyoo kikelan ka enka naataake ka niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo le niŋ paketaloo (Luk 22:7-23).</char></note> Toko, intaak hícump pilampi peecaaŋanee. Póol naayeno káakup hátikin kéeyinane ka. Páawoo eti kacom eteyyo añaŋaa pikaayu, naatowo ti káakup fo pisit. <verse eid="ACT 20:7-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Akee akampaani caacawoo Atík, naayeno ti epalloolu. Fa Póol naatowiye fa ti káakup púlay, Atík naaŋot, hiŋotu ha nihihaŋoo sempe. Ti hiŋotu eehuu, náanowii ápufulii ti etaas ya éhaaciyenu ya. Ta nkáseepinoo ta nkacuk nii aketaaket. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Fiye, Póol naawano, naañeeho teyoo naafenfiyoo naasokii: “Timpi niliim, oopa kaloŋa!”<verse eid="ACT 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Púful toko, naañoho patiila náapaacinool hímpuul ha nkali. Nene ayeno káakup neyii fo cilap, naakaay. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Eehuu hipimuus, nkácoopii akampaani ya kaloŋayoo, pakan paka púlooŋ nkapuuñanoolee meemak.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Póol niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakati kéeyinane ka pakati Efes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Unii keeyeniye ka pinapool niŋ Póol, nuunow hátikin núuyuuko ti piteen penfakat nuukaay ti saatee ya eti Asos, pa nuuyeniye pa pikaayu hicoopuyoo. Asokaasok úhin eehuu kamma náalafiye kasapal. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Ta náatookii ta unii Asos, náayuuko ti piteen pa putoonii nuukaay ti saatee ya eti Mitilen. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Eti kacom eteyyo nuulohan econ ya eti Kiyo. Eti tanta eteyyo nuuciŋ ti econ ya eti Samos, eti tílapooli eteyyo nuucol ti saatee ya eti Milet. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Fiyuu nuumuuse úpulaaŋ saatee ya eti Efes niŋ piteen pa, kamma Póol náalafiit kaakampan ti mah ma miti Asii. Kaatuko oopa ahiliikane hicolu <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, niŋ áfaayini, le niŋ hinoom ha hiti Pentekos ya.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Ta nuucole ta Milet, Póol naapoñ kápiyonkalii ñíhampaatiin ña pakati kéeyinane ka pakati Efes. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Ta nkácolii ta naasokii: “Emma inci íncolii Asii fo fíyooy, nímeyimeyi fa inci iyyeniye fa niŋ aluu. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Inhín páhin pa piti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> péemakiyanooliit háati poonool, ínhin po niŋ mukun. Inkallo pale immukut ta <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkayeniye ta hicenku heenaput ti inci. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Nímeyimeyi nii yolut aluu waah weeyina aluu kayankanan: íntuunan inkalaŋan aluu ti kíliŋ ka niŋ ti pukumpaan pa pitaaluu. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Ŋiinaaŋiino Pusuwif pa niŋ <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char> kati káwunko umuuyen wa uteyii, nkátuul Pútuun pa, nkáyinan ti Ateeteyo atuunaa Yéesu.<verse eid="ACT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />“Fiye, Kunuu ka keenape ka unka ti hícoopiyam Jerusalem samat nii asoocaali fa nacenk an eekulee naacoopooloo. Inci míit heekaakaayam po pitaako. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Eeha inci immeya ha hiyem: ti saatee óo saatee <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkusokamsok nii fakulee inkallo. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Pale ti inci, eloŋam waah tom. Láfilafi lamma pikaayu fo ti pikelan, íllafi lompo hipayu páhin empa Ateeteyo Yéesu naawufanaam pa. Pikina piyem káatuunan ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eti panap pa piti Pútuun pa.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />“Fiye nísiitan, inci méyimeyi nii etinene nicukam, aluu púlooŋ payenka inci íntuunane ka <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Ekina ewune inci pusok ho aluu fíyooy: niŋ oonool taaluu alinciyaa, inci tom Pútuun pa efipuwatan. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Kaatuko inci kamanaakaman aluu eeha púlooŋ Pútuun pa mpílafiye ha nípimeyi, yolut aluu waah. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Nitah kunuu ti aluu himuum aluu, nitah kunuu lompo ti koolee eyya Kunuu ka keenape ka nkuñomane ka aluu kati nifaas. Nimankool kéeyinane ka pakati Pútuun pa, payenka mpunoome ka niŋ hísim añii etempo. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Méyimeyi nii emma inci inkaay ma, pakan keecuke nii piyen elampa empa peep mpucoke éfikanakoonii aluu etikataak paket hikaw ti koolee ya. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Háati pakakee ti aluu himuum aluu efinkasiiŋo nkacaam kati nkalincan pakakee pinapana kapinapanii. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Ooto nitah kunuu! Innínawuno nii, fo sitiil síhaaciil, hánant hanakan inci yékuniit kákupanan an óo an ti aluu fo inci inkooŋ.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />“Fiye, inci ñomanaa aluu ti Pútuun pa, iññoman aluu lompo ti hilim ha hiti panap etempo. Hikina hiyina aluu kapenan káyinan, innitoon hisaanumate ha eeha mpimanke ha pakan etempo <char style="w" lemma="Keesampanee ka pakati Pútuun pa">keesampanee ka</char>. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Ta inci iyyeniye ta naaluu, láfiit waah uti an: mañ tom, sanoo tom, wañ tom. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Aluu púlooŋ nicukaacuk niŋ ñíkin aluu nii inci híne niŋ sipeesam ense, intaak waah óo waah ewwa inci insoolahe niŋ pákawiyam. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Ti waah óo waah ewwa inci ínhine, yísanaayisan aluu nii, niŋ páhin penfakat efuuyankananaa keetaakut ka. Nínawuno hilim ha hiti Ateeteyo Yéesu faŋoo eeha naasoke ha: 'Haŋa pásuuma aapuwun pihaŋ hisayu.'”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Ta Póol naapaye ta hisoku eehuu náakilipo neyii fiye púlooŋ naaluum. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Púful toko, poko púlooŋ nkakooŋ meemak, nkaŋoonoo nkasumpooloo. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Heehaŋii ha púlooŋ páciite hiyem eeha naasoke ha nii, etinene kacukoo. Fiye, nkátiŋanoo fo pati piteen pa. <figure style="fig" alt="Paul et les chefs des croyants d’Efes s’agenouillaient pour prier" file="GW 186.jpg" size="col" loc="30:36-38" copy="Wade NT" ref="20:38">Póol niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakati kéeyinane ka keeyem ka Efes nkákilipo kaluum</figure><verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Pikaayu pa piti Póol ti saatee ya eti Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Ta núukatinoole ta neyii nuucoonool ciit niŋ piteen penfakat fo ti econ ya eti Kos. Eti kacom eteyyo nuucol ti econ ya eti Lot, núuful toko nuukaay ti saatee ya eti Patala. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Nuucuk piteen penfakat peeyeniye pikaayu ti mah ma miti Fenisi, núuyuuko tempo nuuñak. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Nuukaay fo uŋantan econ ya eti Siip, nuukat yo epees yaamay nuukaay ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Siriya</char>. Nuuciŋ ti saatee ya eti Til la piteen pa mpiñaŋe la káayuukin aŋa mpúyuuke ya. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Nuutook toko pinapana pa pakati saatee ya, nuuyeno neyii fo kunoom isak niŋ kúsupak. <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkútunkii kapusok Póol timpi akaay <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Pale ta nuuñaŋe ta hiñaku, nuukaay upuhankan pítin pa putoonii. Kéeyinane ka púlooŋ niŋ pakaalii niŋ epuukii nkátiŋan unii fo úful saatee ya. Púful toko, núukilipo ti kantant ka nuuluum. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Upupa kaluum, núukatinool neyii núuyuuko ti piteen pa, nkañoho pateyii.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Núuful Til niŋ piteen pa nuukaay ti saatee ya eti Patolemayis. Nuukican kéeyinane ka pakati toko, nuuyeno neyii hinoom hoonool. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Eti kacom eteyyo nuukaay ti saatee ya eti Sesaale. Upucol po nuunako ti ekumpaan ya eti <char style="w">Filip</char> átuunana ya ekooŋan ya éesuume ya, nuuwanan toko. Filip aŋuu akee ti isak ya niŋ pákasupak paka keemamalee ka Jerusalem kati kápaacinool paliyal pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:1-6">Páhin 6:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Naataak púmaacul pakapaakiil kéemiit áyiin payenka nkayaamakool kilim enka Pútuun pa mpuwufanii. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Ta nuutaake ta toko kunoom keemeeŋe, akee <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> aŋa nkasok Akapus náacolii ápufulii ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Judaay</char>. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Náakey la nuuyeniye la, naacoop peletoo ya eti Póol, naacenkoolo neyyo sipeesoo niŋ wootoo, naasok: “<char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> kusok: 'Ayíin a ati peletoo eyye, fiye <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa pakati Jerusalem efikacenkoo, nkawufanoo <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char>.'”<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Ta núusiye ta eehuu, unii niŋ kéeyinane ka pakati Sesaale, nuuŋiino Póol timpi akaay Jerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Pale naasok unii: “Weyme uwune ínniyemi ti pukooŋ nipiwasam kúnuul? Inci siiŋaasiiŋo neetaat kati kacenkam lamma pale focaa eket Jerusalem kamma caacaw ca citi <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Yéesu.” <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Ta nuucuke ta nii uyinaat waah teyoo, nuukatan piŋiino pa nuusokoo: “Alímaati eeha Ateeteyo náalafiye ha hitaako!”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Nuutaak toko kunoom, nuumemanoolo nuucok pítin pa piti Jerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Pakakee ti kéeyinane ka pakati Sesaale nkátiŋan unii. Nkacoop unii upuwanan lati akee áyiin aŋa nkasok Manason ati econ ya eti Siip, naafiyo naayeniye anapana.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Póol pati Saak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Ta nuucole ta <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, kéeyinane ka nkawanan unii niŋ pásuuma. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Eti kacom eteyyo, Póol naanapool niŋ unii nuukaay hiyoop <char style="w">Saak</char>. Ñíhampaatiin ña púlooŋ pakati kéeyinane ka nkayeno toko. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Póol naakicanii naakamanii picaaŋ cataŋ eeha Pútuun pa mpíhine ha púlooŋ ti mah ma miti <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char> pínapii ti páhin pa piteyoo. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Ta nkásiye ta eehuu, nkámul Pútuun pa, nkasok: “Awí unii Póol, aacukaacuk fa hícump púwuli <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> nkáyenoonii kéeyinane, apan poko púlooŋ keecoke piliit <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char>. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Kasokeesok nii, aayenaayeno kakalaŋan Pusuwif pa púlooŋ keekine ka ti mah ma miti keeneetaat ka Pusuwif ti hisokuyii nii kakatan hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha hiti Móyiis, insokii nii timpi <char style="w">kanakan</char> epuukii ti písiyool empa Pútuun pa mpiliile pa niŋ maamaa atuunaa <char style="w">Abraham</char>, timpi lompo kanapan cosaan ya etuunaa. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Híinihiini unii nii, éfikasi nii áacoliyoocol. Fiye, eeheyme nuuñaŋaa íhinu? <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Eehe núulafiye aakati hín: pákayiin pakapaakiil unka le keesintooliye ti Pútuun pa, <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />coopii pati ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa uwwaaseen Pútuun pa kaawaaseen ka kitii kiti ekuulanoolo ya ti coonool neyii. Niŋ fúlaa toko, incooy aŋa nkañaŋe ya cooy,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:13-18">Pafinal 6:13-18</ref></char></note> ancuk nkáyini kaahankan esintoolo ya eteyii nkayiin kikawii. Ti páhinal empuu an óo an áfaameyi nii enka nkasokii ka ti awe pánipani tom, awe himuumi ánhinhin eeha hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha nihisoke ha. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Pale keeneetaat ka Pusuwif kéeyinane ka, unii upoñiipoñ leetal upusokii eeha nuucokaa ha nii, timpi kali efoofa eewaaseenee ti énaati, timpi kali efoofa eetaake hísim, timpi kali efoofa eti élukuleen eetaaŋutee, timpi kayeno ñusupoolata.”<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hicokuyee ha hiti Póol ti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Eti kacom eteyyo, Póol naacoop pákayiin paka payenkuu nkáyaañ íhinu eeha nkañaŋe ha íhinu kati kakuulanoolo. Púful toko, naanako ti hank ha hiti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char> náatuunanii teyme ekuulanoolo ya neeñaŋe hipayu niŋ lompo teyme an óo an teyii naañaŋe kaawaaseen Pútuun pa.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Kunoom ka isak ya niŋ kúsupak ka kiti ekuulanoolo ya kupulohan hipayu, pakakee <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> kéefulii ti mah ma miti Asii nkacuk Póol ti hank ha hiti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya, nkanoŋan kayoŋ ka. Nkacok Póol, <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />nkayeno kaaceeceekool kapusok: “Aluu pakati <char style="w">Israyel</char>, níteyii! Ayíin a aŋe akaaye pan óo pan kakalaŋan an óo an kati apook unaa pakati Israyel, <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char> niŋ lompo ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eyye. Naanakan fala <char style="w" lemma="Keeneetaat ka Pusuwif">keeneetaat Pusuwif</char> ti hank ha hiti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya apilecatan le sampanee le.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />(Kasokaasok eehe kaatuko kacukaacuk Póol <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> ti pinapool niŋ Tolofim ati Efes, incukii nii Póol anakanoonakan ti hank ha hiti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya.)<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Saatee ya fiye púlooŋ neeliiñool, pakan paka nkáteyii kápufulii pan óo pan, nkacok Póol nkáhuunoo nkáfulanoo ti hank ha hiti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya. Tokotoko, kunkut ka nkipankee. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Nkayeno hiŋes himuku Póol. Ti oom páciite, áhampaatiin a ati pusoocaali pa pakati <char style="w">Room</char> keeyem ka <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> náasi nii Jerusalem púlooŋ yoopiya eliiñoole. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Naahiliikan apuconcoolan pusoocaali niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakateyii nkatey poko púlooŋ pati kayoŋ ka. Ta pakan paka nkacuke ta áhampaatiin a niŋ pusoocaali pa nkáyekuno hisapu Póol. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Fiye, áhampaatiin a ati pusoocaali pa naaloh Póol, naawufan hilim kapucokoo nkacenkoo niŋ ñiseel ñúsupak. Púful toko naacakanii: “Ayíin a aŋe ayem ayme? Weyme náahine?” <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Pakakee ti kayoŋ ka nkaceek kapusok eehe, pakakee paka lompo nkaceek kapusok hikee. Ahámpaatiin a ati pusoocaali pa ayinaat kameye heetaakiye ha fanfaŋ kamma pahampanane pa. Naawufan hilim kapucoop Póol pati ékinuma ya eti pusoocaali pa. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Ta Póol naalohane ta ésiluma ya eti ékinuma ya, pusoocaali pa nkáseepinoo kamma pakan paka nkahiñe. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Poko púlooŋ nkayeniyoo kanapan niŋ hiceeku: “Nimukoo! Nimukoo!”<figure style="fig" alt="tirer Paul a meme le sol en dehors de la grande maison.)" file="GW 187.jpg" size="col" loc="21:30-36" copy="Wade NT" ref="21:36">Ihúunuyee ha hiti Póol tíkitaaŋ ekumpaan ya enfakat ya</figure><verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakup ka kiti Póol hátikin Pusuwif pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Ta nkayeniye ta kanakan Póol ti ékinuma ya eti pusoocaali pa, naasok áhampaatiin a ateyii: “Yíniyuuyini hisoku waah?” Ahámpaatiin a naañahanoo: “Aásiyaasi kaŋ ya eti Kilek? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Ooto aaneetaat ati <char style="w">Esipt</char> a éeluuŋe ya ta infiyiit pilepel síwuli sipaakiil (4,000) toonii, naacoopii pati <char style="w">káahaaŋ ka tes</char>?” <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Póol naañahanoo: “Inci <char style="w">Asuwif</char> eepukee ti saatee ya eti Taas ti mah ma miti Silisi, inci an ati saatee eemaka. Katampo, inci luumuu, púkup niŋ kayoŋ ka!”<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Ahámpaatiin a naacoon. Póol naasiiŋo ti ésiluma ya, naaŋunt epeesoo, kayoŋ ka nkifatan. Fiye, náakup neyii ti kaŋ ya eteyii, Alam.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ti oom caanak, kaŋ ya eehaŋee ya káakup ti mah emmuu, ekina eyem “Alam”. </char></note><verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />Póol naasokii: “Aluu pakanam niŋ ñífaafam, nísiitan eeha inci inkaakaay ha aluu hisoku píyisan aluu nii inci muuyenut.” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Ta nkásiye ta Póol ti káakup ti kaŋ ya eteyii, Alam, nkahaŋ toko nkatempane. Póol nene asokii: <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Inci <char style="w">Asuwif</char> eepukee ti saatee ya eti Taas ti mah ma miti Silisi, pale nkúlee le <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, Kamaliyel ayeniye akalaŋana ya atoom. Naakalaŋanam fa inci iññaŋe kanapan fanfaŋ <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti símaama unaa. Incok piliit ti Pútuun pa, samat nii an óo an ti aluu fíyooy. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Kallanaakallan fo muk keeyeniye ka kanapan Pítin pa piti Yéesu. Incok teyii pákayiin niŋ pakaal, incenkii uwwantii ti ékuluma. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" /><char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">Awaaseena ya enfakat a ati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakati Pusuwif pa káyiniyini hisoku nii páni, poko kakiice pileetal inci kati ufan po pakan unaa Pusuwif pa pakati saatee ya eti Damas. Fiye, iyyeno pikaayu hicoku keeyeniye ka po, kati cóopiyii <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> kati kakallanee.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />“Ti pítin pa pulohan Damas, caanak ca ti hikaw, tokotoko ecaaŋ enfakat néefulii patiila néeyayii ti inci néekinkoolam. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Innow t’etaam ínsi hilim heesokaam: 'Sóol, Sóol, weyme uwune áyyemiyam ti kaakallan?' <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Incakan: 'Awe yem ayme, Ateeteyo?' Hilim ha nihiñahanam: 'Inci yem Yéesu ati Naasalet aŋa ayyem ya ti kaakallan.' <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Keeyeniye ka niŋ inci kacukaacuk ecaaŋ ya pale kásiit hilim eeyeniye ya káakup niŋ inci. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Fiye incakan: 'Ateeteyo, weyme inci iññaŋe íhinu?' Ateeteyo naañahanam: 'Lito kaay Damas, po aafakamanee eeha púlooŋ Pútuun pa mpílafiye ha aakati hín.' <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Páawoo ecaaŋ ya éekinkoolaam ya éfuumanaam-fúuman, fiye keeyeniye ka pinapool niŋ inci nkátintiŋanam pinako Damas.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />“Intaako toko áyiin aŋa nkasok Anañas, eefeye Pútuun pa naacok piliit hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char>. Pusuwif pa púlooŋ keekine ka Damas nkákup heenape teyoo. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Anañas náakey ti inci naasiiŋo pukolam naasokam: 'Sóol atoomuu ñoho ti hicuku!' Tokotoko incukoo picaaŋ cataŋ. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Naasokam lompo nii: 'Pútuun pa piti símaama unaa pimamaluu aakati méyi eeha mpílafiye ha, incuk lompo <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">Eecoonoole</char> ya, ínsi hilimoo. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Kaatuko aafayeno eetantake ya ateyoo, íntuunan hátikin pakan paka púlooŋ aŋa ancuke ya ínsi. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Fiye, weyme ayyem ti hítuulu? Lito, luum Yéesu; ti páhinal empuu, ínhinee <char style="w">pátise</char> inkuulanee imponketee umuuyen wa utii.'<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“Púful toko, iññoho Jerusalem iyyeno kaluum ti hank ha hiti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>, waah núufulii ti inci pucuk fiye nii éyawut. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Incuk Ateeteyo naasokam: 'Hiliikan fúl Jerusalem mpacas, kaatuko etikasayan eeha ayyem ha ti káatuunan ti inci.' <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Iññahanoo: 'Ateeteyo, poko himuumii kámeyimeyi nii ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">púluumuma</char> pa inci inkaay púcokalii kéeyinane ka ti awe kati wantii ti ékuluma insapii. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Ta nkayeniye ta himuku Stíifan, aŋa nákup a kitii, toko inci iyyeniye lompo. Insayan himukuyee ha hiteyoo, infaas kúsool ka kenfakat ka kiti keeyeniyoo ka himuku.' <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Pale Ateeteyo naasokam: 'Kaay, kaatuko inci fapoñi pállaaŋe, pati <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char>.'”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Póol ati Room</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Kayoŋ ka nkísiitan Póol fo ta naasoke ta nii Pútuun pa pupoñoo ti <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char>, nkiceeceekool: “Amukee! Añaŋut eloŋ!” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Nkayeno hiceeku niŋ uwiiluyii, nkawantal wañ wa uteyii, nkawantal lompo esiya patiila. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Fiye, áhampaatiin a ati pusoocaali pa pakati <char style="w">Room</char> keeyem ka <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> naawufan hilim eehe: “Ninakan Póol ti ékinuma ya eti pusoocaali pa, innisapoo niŋ kisawut innicakanooloo.” Asokaasok eehuu kati áyini kameye heewune kayoŋ ka nkiceek fiye kamma Póol. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Ta nkayeniyoo ta hicenku kati kasapoo, Póol naasok akee áhampaatiin asoocaali eeyeniye toko: “Nílafilafi hisapu an ati Room éehinutee kíiti! Fo niñaŋaañaŋ ho íhinu?” <verse eid="ACT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Asoocaali ya ápisi eehuu, naakaasok ho áhampaatiin a ati pusoocaali pa: “Weyme ayyem ti íhinu? Ayíin a aŋe ati Room!” <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Ahámpaatiin a náakey ti Póol naacakanoo: “Sokam, fo awe ati Room?” Póol naañahanoo: “Ee.” <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Ahámpaatiin a naasokoo: “Inci cooyaacooy mañ meemeeŋe píyini piyeno lompo ati Room.” Póol naasokoo: “Pale inci, fo impukee.” <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Keeñaŋoo ka kaacakanool nkañako mpacas. Ahámpaatiin a himuumoo, ta naameya ta nii Póol ati Room, ewatate neecokoo kaatuko apoñaapoñ kapicenkoo niŋ ñiseel.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Póol hátikin ñíhampaatiin píhina kíiti ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Ahámpaatiin a ati pusoocaali pa náalafi kameye picaaŋ cataŋ heewune <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkanook Póol. Fiye, eti kacom eteyyo naapoñ kápufulan ñiseel ña ti Póol. Púful toko, naawufan hilim <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ ñíhampaatiin píhina kíiti ya púlooŋ kati kaconcoolo, nkacoop Póol hátikinii.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Pusoocaali pa pakati <char style="w">Room</char> ta nkacoope ta Póol hátikin ñíhampaatiin píhina kíiti ya, naasincanii caw naasokii: “Aluu pakanam, eloŋ ya etoom, eloŋ <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">eecoonoole</char> hátikin Pútuun pa fo ti hinoom ha hiti fíyooy. Kunuuwam kitempanaa-tempan ti eehuu.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Ta Anañas <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">awaaseena ya enfakat a ati Pútuun pa</char> náasiye ta eehuu naasok keesiiŋiye ka pukol Póol kafantoo ti putum. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Fiye Póol naasokoo: “Pútuun pa efipifanti, awe nícuf! Awe hiniŋ héehiiniyanee!<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 13:10-15">Esekiyel 13:10-15</ref></char></note> Aayenaayeno le aakati hínam kíiti ti <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char>, pale awe faŋi íyyemi ho ti hípucu aapusok kafantam?” <verse eid="ACT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Keesiiŋiye ka pukol Póol nkasokoo: “Fo awe háañiye kateñal awaaseena ya enfakat a ati Pútuun pa?” <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Póol naañahanii: “Pakanam, inci pánnumut nii akina ayem awaaseena ya enfakat a. Niŋ inci méyimeyi etiteñaloo kaatuko kiiceekiic ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> nii: 'Aañaŋut káakup heenaput ti ati hikaw ha ati pakani.'<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:27">Efúlii 22:27</ref></char></note>”<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6-8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6-8" />Póol náameyi nii pakakee ti ñíhampaatiin píhina kíiti ya <char style="w" lemma="Asatusaay">Pusatusaay</char>, kéeyinane ka nii keekete ka étikalitoonii, <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">pumaleekoo</char> niŋ píciina pitaakiit, náameyi lompo nii pakakee paka <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> nkáyinan enkuu púlooŋ. Fiye, naasiiŋo hátikinii naaceek, naasok: “Pakanam, inci Afalisaay, paapaa atoom lompo Afalisaay. Kamma inci ínhine cíki nii keekete ka éfikalitoonii, ekina ewune kati hínee kíiti.” Emma Póol naapaye ma hisoku eehuu, poko ñíhampaatiin píhina kíiti ya nkápaacinoolo: Pufalisaay pa citeyii, Pusatusaay pa lompo citeyii. <verse eid="ACT 23:6-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Poko púlooŋ nkayeno kaaceeceekool. Pakakee ti <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char> pakati kayoŋ ka kiti Pufalisaay pa nkalito, niŋ hilim heeyanke nkálaacin nkasok: “Ucukut heenaput eeha áyiin a aŋe náahine. Pikee pa maleekoo niŋ ekina tom kunuu kúkupe neyoo!” <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Nkayeno pílaacinool pihaŋhaŋ toko. Ahámpaatiin a ati pusoocaali pa naafe timpi kataatulool Póol. Fiye, naawufan hilim eehe pusoocaali pa: “Niwano, ínnifulan Póol ti éhinuma kíiti ya inniñahanoo ti ékinuma ya etuunaa.”<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Hánant ha <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> náafulii ti Póol naasokoo: “Sík piliit! Samat nii fa ántuunane fa páni ya kutoom le <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, fo lompo áafatuunan páni ya kutoom Room.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hiyoop ha hiti hikuucuyee ha hiti Póol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Eti kacom eteyyo mpucom, pakakee <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> nkaconcoolo kapiteŋenool, nkasintoolo nii, etikali waah etikalaan taamanta kamukut Póol. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Keeconcooliye ka kapisintoolo kamuusaamuus pakan áwii ésupak (40). <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Ti oom káasiiŋuma, nkakaay ti <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">puwaaseena pa kenfakat ka pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña nkasokii: “Unii usintoolaa-sintoolo ti coonool nii, etuuli waah taamanta umukut Póol. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Fiye, aluu niŋ ñíhampaatiin píhina kíiti ya, nipoñ hilim pati áhampaatiin a ati pusoocaali pa nipiluumoo ápucoopii Póol petaaluu. Níhin fiye nii hitaaku hilim heehiina ínnilafiye teyoo. Unii éfuulopoo nuumukoo le niŋ áfaacolii.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Pale Póol ásanfunoo akampaani náasi eeha nkacenke ha. Fiye, naakaay pati ékinuma ya eti pusoocaali pa apusok ho Póol. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Ta Póol náasiye ta eehuu, naayonkal akee áhampaatiin asoocaali naasokoo: “Coop akampaani aŋe pati áhampaatiin a ataaluu, ataakaataak eeha naañaŋoo hisoku.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Asoocaali ya naacoopoo pati áhampaatiin a ati pusoocaali pa naasokoo: “Póol eekulee ya ayonkalaam, naasokam nii inci cóopii akampaani aŋe petaawe kaatuko ataakaataak eeha naañaŋuu hisoku.” <verse eid="ACT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Ahámpaatiin a ati pusoocaali pa naacokoo ti epees naanaaco neyoo naacakanoo: “Weyme antaake uti hisokuyam?” <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Akampaani ya naasokoo: “Pakakee Pusuwif kásiyoolaa-síyool kati kaluumi nii kacom íncoopii Póol hátikin ñíhampaatiin píhina kíiti ya. Efíkahin fiye nii hitaaku hilim heehiina nkálafiye teyoo. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Timpi síitanii, kaatuko taakaataak pákayiin keemuuse áwii ésupak keeyemoo ti cíllopa. Kasintoolaa-sintoolo nii etikali waah etikalaan taamanta kamukutoo. Kapayoolaa-payool neehuu; fiye, awe lamma nkayem ti hítuulu aakati hín eeha nkálafiye ha.” <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Ahámpaatiin a ati pusoocaali pa naasok akampaani ya: “Timpi sok an nii aakamanaam-kaman eehuu.” Púful toko naakatanoo apikaay.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hicoopuyee ha hiti Póol pati ati hikaw ha Felis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Ahámpaatiin a ati pusoocaali pa naayonkal pákasupak ti ñíhampaatiin pusoocaali pa naasokii: “Niconcenool pusoocaali sikeme súsupak (200) niŋ pakati pufalinc áwii éhaaciil niŋ ŋaasuwan (70) niŋ pakati pupaay sikeme súsupak (200). Kañaŋaa pikaayu ti saatee ya eti Sesaale papayal hili káciim. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Nimemanool lompo pufalinc peekaakaay híyuuku Póol, innicoopoo ti kásuumaay pati ati hikaw ha Felis.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Púful toko, áhampaatiin a ati pusoocaali pa naakiic leetal eyye:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />“Inci Kulot Lisiyas kicanuu, awe eñaap ya Felis ati hikaw ha. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" /><char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa kacoke áyiin a aŋa inci ímpoñiyuu ya, himukuyoo nkayeniye ékey. Fiye, ínsi nii ati <char style="w">Room</char>, ekina ewune inkaay niŋ pusoocaaliyam infakanoo. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Páawoo láfilafi kameye heewune nkanookoo, ekina ewune inci incoopoo ti ñíhampaatiin píhina kíiti ya pakateyii. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Incuk nii heewune nkanookoo, hiti <char style="w" lemma="Hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">hilim ha hiteyii heesiiŋanee ha</char>. Pale taakut heewune kati akulee niŋ ekina tom naamukee. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Púful toko, nkakamanam nii pakakee ti poko kacenke heenaput teyoo, ekina ewune inci ímpoñiyuuyoo picascas. Sokaasok keenookoo ka kákey kapikamani eeha nkanookoo ha.</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 23:30">Apalaka.” <figure style="fig" alt="La récupération de Paul a Sesaale – ils sont sur le point de l’amener a Sesaale" file="GW 190.jpg" size="col" loc="23:23-35" copy="Wade NT" ref="23:30">Póol ti ékey hicoopuyee Sesaale</figure><verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Pusoocaali pa nkáhin eeha áhampaatiin a ati pusoocaali pa naasoke ha. Nkacoop Póol niŋ hánant ha fo ti saatee ya eti Antipatilis. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Eti kacom eteyyo pusoocaali pa keesapale ka nkañoho pati ékinuma ya eteyii, pakati pufalinc pa nkahankan pítin pa niŋ Póol. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Nkacol Sesaale, nkawufan ati hikaw ha leetal ya nkawufanoo lompo Póol. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Ati hikaw ha naakalaŋ leetal ya naacakan Póol: “Awe ati emmeyme mah?” Póol naañahanoo: “Ati Silisi.” <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />Ati hikaw ha naasokoo: “Inci fáhin kíiti ya etii niŋ keenookuu ka kácoliyoo.” Naawufan hilim nii, Póol afaasee lati ekumpaan ya eyya amansa ya <char style="w">Helot</char> naalute ya.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Hinookuyee ha hiti Póol hátikin Felis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Kunoom isak kupumuus, Anañas <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">awaaseena ya enfakat a ati Pútuun pa</char> naawano ti saatee ya eti Sesaale, akina niŋ pakakee ñíhampaatiin niŋ akee áyiin aŋa nkasok Telitilus, asiiŋiya pakan ti kíiti. Nkanook Póol hátikin Felis ati hikaw ha. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Póol náayonkaliyee, Telitilus naanookoo ti hisoku: “Awe Felis eñaap ya, awe wune kásuumaay nkíyemi ti mah me, niŋ ecohato ya etii ayyesane mah me iyyankanan unii. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Pan óo pan niŋ tan óo tan, unii unka ti hisokuyi apalaka ti waah óo waah ewwa nuusa kamma awe. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Pale inci láfiit pifiyo ti káakup kati fiyani. Ekina ewune inci íyyemiyi ti kaluum ti panap pa pitii áapisiitan unii caahinkiŋ. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Ucukaacuk aŋe nii áyiin ati sisok, áyiyiŋanaa-yíyiŋan <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa púlooŋ lan óo lan ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> apan akina akee ti ñíhampaatiin ña pakati kayoŋ ka enka nkasok ka 'Pakati Naasalet', keeyem ti kanapan pítin peenaput. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Naaŋes lompo kalecatan <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>; fiye, nuucokoo. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Awe himuumi, naacakanooloo, aafacuk nii eeha nuunookoo ha, hiti pánipani.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Pusuwif pa nkánapiyan hilim ha hiteyoo ti hisoku nii pánipani.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakup ka kiti Póol hátikin Felis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Ati hikaw ha naawufan hilim ha Póol, Póol naasok: “Inci méyimeyi nii sitiil seemeeŋe awe yem áhina kíiti ya ti mah emme. Tempo wune ínsuumam kati siiŋoolo hátikini. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Naasincanaa eehe púsooni aafacuk nii, haŋut kunoom ŋaasuwan niŋ kúsupak inci inkaaye <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> kati nimpan Pútuun pa. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />An acukutam ti píñakalool niŋ an niŋ ekina tom káyiyiŋan pakan paka: ti hank ha hiti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char> tom, ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">púluumuma</char> pa tom, ti saatee ya tom. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Payenke kayinaat káyisan nii eeha nkayemam ha ti hinooku pánipani. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Pale coonaacoon eehe nii, ti Pítin pa piti Yéesu inci ínhin páhin pa piti Pútuun pa piti símaama unii. Keenookaam ka kasok nii pítin pa empa inci iyyem pa ti kanapan, piti pánipani tom, pale inci innapan púlooŋ heekiicee ha ti <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char> niŋ ti pakiical pa piti <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Inci hintaahinto ti Pútuun pa samat nii pákayiin paka payenke nii, <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">keecoonoole</char> ka niŋ keecoonoolut ka éfikalitoonii ti eket ya. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Ekina ewune inci ínhin kata tan óo tan, kunuuwam kati kitempan hátikin Pútuun pa niŋ pakan paka. <figure style="fig" alt="Paul devant le chef Felis pour se défendre" file="GW 191.jpg" size="col" loc="24:10-21" copy="Wade NT" ref="24:16">Póol hátikin ati hikaw ha Felis kati asiiŋoolo</figure><verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />“Páawoo sitiil seemeeŋe inci kaayut Jerusalem, iññoho po kati wun mañ pakanam <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa keeleke ka, uwwaaseen ti Pútuun pa. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Hikina inci iyyeniye íhinu ta nkacukaam ta ti hank ha hiti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa. Payaapa púlooŋ kaawaaseen ka kiti ekuulanoolo ya. Napoolut niŋ kayoŋ taakut lompo pahampanane. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Pale pakakee Pusuwif pakati Asii kayenaayeno toko, poko kañaŋe pisiiŋo le kati kanookam, niŋ kataakaataak heeseeñii ti inci. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Keeyem ka le, eeheyme heenaput nkacuke ti inci ta nkacoopaam ta hátikin ñíhampaatiin píhina kíiti ya? Kasoki ho! <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />Niŋ neetaat fa inci illitiye fa piceek ti káakup hátikinii insok eehe: 'Inci oopa ti íhinuyee fíyooy kíiti hátikin aluu kamma inci ínhine cíki nii keekete ka éfikalitoonii.'”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Pale Felis eemeya ya picaaŋ cataŋ Pítin pa piti Yéesu, naateeŋan hinoom ha hiti íhinu kíiti ya. Naasokii: “Niŋ Lisiyas áhampaatiin a ati pusoocaali pa ákeyyoo, inci fáhin kíiti ya etaaluu.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Fiye, naasok akee áhampaatiin asoocaali afaas Póol, pale akatanoo ápuwaayeen naakatan lompo pákawiyoo kápikeyyoo hiyoop kati kamankooloo.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Póol hátikin Felis niŋ Tulusil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Kunoom kupumuus, Felis ati hikaw ha hiti mah ma náakey niŋ aaloo Tulusil, <char style="w">Asuwif</char>. Naapoñ kápiyonkalii Póol nkásiitanoo ápukupii kiti káyinan ka ti Yéesu Krista. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Póol náakup kiti eloŋ ya <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">eecoonoole</char> ya, niŋ kiti ecocokanoolo ya, niŋ lompo kiti kíiti ya ekelan ya eti Pútuun pa. Felis niŋ pásiyaloo eehuu naafe, naasok Póol: “Fiye, fúl aapikaay, niŋ inci taakaniyaa faneneyonkali.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Háati ekina, naayeno káamiilool nii Póol afaawufanoo mañ. Ekina ewune tan óo tan náyonkalii Póol kati nákupat neyoo.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Sitiil súsupak sipimuus, Polosiyus Festus naatoon páhin pa piti Felis. Páawoo Felis hiŋes héesuume Pusuwif pa naayaake, naakat Póol ti ékuluma ya.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Póol hátikin ati hikaw ha Festus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Festus pácolaliyoo ti saatee ya eti Sesaale, pumuus kunoom káhaaciil, náaful toko naakaay <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Ta naacole ta, <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa keemaka ka nkakaay teyoo nkanook Póol nkaluumoo <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />ti hisoku nii, aponket ayankananii ápucoopii Póol Jerusalem. Caham kálafilafi íhinu eehuu, kaatuko kásiyoolaa-síyool kati kálopoo, nkamukoo ácolumii. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Pale Festus naasokii: “Póol oopa Sesaale ti ékuluma, inci himuumam focaa puñoho po féefiye. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Ñíhampaatiin ña pakataaluu kati kawano niŋ inci fo Sesaale. Niŋ áyiin aŋuu áhinaa heenaput, nimpi kacolaa po, éfikayini hisoku heenaput eeha nkanookoo ha teeho.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Festus naayeno po fo kunoom isak niŋ káhaaciil niŋ fotom ŋaasuwan. Púful toko, naañoho Sesaale. Eti kacom eteyyo, naayeno ti éhinuma kíiti ya eteyoo naapoñ kápucoopii Póol. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Ta Póol náacolii ta, Pusuwif pa kéefulii ka Jerusalem nkákiitoo nkanookoo ti hícump waah weenaput pale kayinaat káyisan nii ewwuu uti páni. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Póol naasiiŋoolo naasok: “Inci hínut heenaput ti <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Pusuwif pa, lecatanut <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>, laahut lompo <char style="w">Sesaal</char> amansa ya enfakat a ati <char style="w">Room</char>.” <verse eid="ACT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Festus naaŋes héesuume Pusuwif pa; fiye naasok Póol: “Aafacoon pisilo Jerusalem, aakati hínee po kíiti hátikinam ti eeha nkanookuu ha?” <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Póol naañahanoo: “Ti éhinuma kíiti ya eti amansa ya enfakat a ati Room inci insiiŋiye fiye, le inci iññaŋee íhinuyee kíiti. Hínut Pusuwif pa heenaput, awe faŋi méyimeyi picaaŋ cataŋ. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Iyyema aŋa Pusuwif pa payenke nkanookaam ya inci nowe, hisawut ha nihicakan eket, inci pookut eket. Pale iyyema eeha nkanookaam ha hiti páni tom an ayinaatam kawufanii. Sesaal inci íllafiye ápihinam kíiti.” <verse eid="ACT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Fiye, Festus naateŋenool niŋ puwunayoo kunuu, púful toko, naasok Póol: “Páawoo Sesaal állafiye ápihini kíiti, ti Sesaal lompo aafakaay.”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Póol hátikin amansa ya Helot Akilipa añii ya niŋ Pelenis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Kunoom kupumuus, amansa ya Akilipa niŋ ahoopoo Pelenis nkácolii ti saatee ya eti Sesaale kakican Festus. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Páawoo kakampanaa-kampan po, Festus naakaman amansa ya kiti Póol. Naasokoo: “Ayíin oopa le aŋa Felis naakate ti ékuluma. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Ta inci inkaaye ta <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">puwaaseena pa kenfakat ka pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ ñíhampaatiin <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkákeyyoo hinooku ti inci nkasokam ufanoo kaamuuyen insiiŋanoo ti pisiya. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Insokii nii, pakati <char style="w">Room</char> kacoopantoo an eenookee kapuwufanoo pakakee, akina peesiiŋiit hátikin punookayoo naakaman kati asiiŋoolo. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Fiye, ta nkácolii ta le, inci fiyanut lompo: eti kacom eteyyo, iyyeno ti éhinuma kíiti ya impoñ kápucoopii áyiin a. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Punookayoo nkasiiŋo le kanookutoo waah weenaput samat nii fa inci ínninkoole fa. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Pale pítaakool pa piteyii piti káyinanii niŋ piti lompo akee áyiin eekete aŋa nkasok Yéesu, Póol naasok nii oopa kaloŋa. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Inci ínnimam fa iññaŋe íhinu ti kúu eyyuu. Fiye, inci incakan Póol man afaacoon pikaayu Jerusalem kati áhinee kíiti po. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Pale Póol naaluum nii, <char style="w">Sesaal</char> amansa ya enfakat a ati Room náalafiye ápihinoo kíiti. Inci uwwufan hilim aputowo ti ékuluma fo ta inci fáyiniyoo hipoñu pati Sesaal.” <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Akilipa naasok Festus: “Inci himuumam láfilafi hísiyu áyiin a aŋuu.” Festus naasokoo: “Kacom áafasiyoo.” <figure style="fig" alt="Akilipa et Pelenis sont grandiosement accueillis" file="GW 192.jpg" size="col" loc="25:22-27" copy="Wade NT" ref="25:22">Akilipa niŋ Pelenis nkawananee pinap</figure><verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Eti kacom eteyyo, Akilipa niŋ Pelenis nkácolii niŋ kawananee kenfakat ta nkanakiye ta ti ékaap ya enfakat ya niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakati pusoocaali pa niŋ pákayiin paka keemaka ka pakati saatee ya. Festus naapoñ kápucoopii Póol. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Ta Póol náacolii ta, Festus naasok: “Amansa yuu Akilipa niŋ aluu keeyem ka le, nicukaacuk áyiin aŋe? Pusuwif pa púlooŋ kanookoonook ti inci Jerusalem niŋ le lompo Sesaale nkayeno kaaceeceekool kapusok nii añaŋut nene eloŋ. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Sincanaasincan ti eeha nkanookoo ha, pale cukut la náahine heenaput eeha efihiwun kati amukee. Páawoo aluumaaluum íhinuyee kíiti pati amansa ya enfakat a, fiye, incok kati poñoo Room. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Pale taakut fanfaŋ eeha inci inkaakaay hikiicu amansa ya enfakat a kiteyoo. Ekina ewune inci íncoopiyoo hátikin aluu picaahaŋ ti awe amansa ya Akilipa, ancuk nuucakanooloo intaak eeha inci inkaakaay hikiicu. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Kaatuko inci cukaacuk nii taakut hikaw kati poñ eekulee pati amansa ya enfakat a, peekamanut heecaaŋe ti eeha naanookee ha.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Káakup ka kiti Póol hátikin amansa ya Akilipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Ta Festus naapaye ta káakup, Akilipa naasok Póol: “Aáyiniyini káakup aakati siiŋoolo.” Fiye, Póol náaseepin epeesoo apikican ñíhampaatiin ña, naasok: <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Amansa yuu Akilipa, fíyooy súumaamsuum meemak fa inci insiiŋiye fa hátikini pikamani kati siiŋoolo ti eeha púlooŋ <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkanookaam ha. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Kaatuko áameyimeyi pinap cosaan ya púlooŋ eti Pusuwif pa niŋ enka núulaacinool ka tenko. Fiye, inci luumuu, ponket síitanam.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />“Pusuwif pa púlooŋ kámeyimeyi eloŋam kápiliŋ maañiiyaayam le <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> ti mah ma mutoom. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Nkámeyiyam ta infiyye, káyiniyini hisoku niŋ kálafiyaa nii páni, inci hínum <char style="w">Afalisaay</char>, himpaac ha heehaŋe ha hicoku piliit tiw pítin pa putuunaa. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Fiye, eheeyam ti íhinuyee kíiti kamma inci ínhine cíki nii Pútuun pa éfipihin eeha mpíyinanane ha símaama unaa. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Miin ma ŋaasuwan niŋ músupak ma miti pakan paka pakatuunaa ímmihin cíki lompo ti eehuu, ekina ewune nkaluum Po meemak hánant hanakan. Pale kamma inci lompo ínhine cíki ti eehuu, amansa yuu, ekina ewune pakanam Pusuwif pa nkanookam. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Aluu Pusuwif pa nipookaapook káyinan nii Pútuun pa mpilitanlitan keekete ka. Weyme uwune?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />“Inci himuumam míiloolaa-míilool hínum nii ñaŋaa íhinu waah wa púlooŋ kati hokan caacaw Yéesu ati Naasalet. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Hikina inci ínhine Jerusalem. Uwwant ti ékuluma hícump <char style="w">keesampanee ka pakati Pútuun pa</char>, samat nii fa <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> nkawufanaam fa sempe píhin ho. Niŋ kawufanii kaamuuyen kati kamukee, inci insayan himukuyee ha hiteyii. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Iyyeno kaamuusool ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">púluumuma</char> pa púlooŋ inkallan kéeyinane ka kati kateñal caacaw Yéesu. Intaak paseeña penfakat teyii fo innapanii ti pisaatee péelaaŋe.”<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakaman ka kiti Póol fa náayinane fa ti Ateeteyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />Póol nene asok Akilipa: “Amansa yuu, fiyuu inci iyyeniye pikaayu ti saatee ya eti Damas, <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> kapoñaam po, nkawufanam sempe siti hicoku keeyem ka ti pítin pa piti Yéesu. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Inci ti pítin pa caanak ca ti hikaw, incuk ecaaŋ éefulii patiila eehaŋe caanak ca pacaaŋ. Néekinkoolam niŋ pákawiyam keeyeniye ka pinapool niŋ inci. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Nuunow t’etaam unii púlooŋ, ínsi hilim heesokaam ti kaŋ ya eti Alam:<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ti oom caanak, kaŋ ya eehaŋee ya káakup ti mah emmuu, ekina eyem “Alam”.</char></note> 'Sóol Sóol weyme uwune áyyemiyam ti kaakallan? Aapa ti eyokanoolo kenseŋ samat nii fáli eepooke pikaayu háati ateeteyo naasap yo.' <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Incakan: 'Awe yem ayme, Ateeteyo?' <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> naañahanam: 'Inci yem Yéesu aŋa ayyem ya ti kaakallan. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Pale lito insiiŋo, kaatuko yísanoolaa-yísanoolo ti awe aakati yeno áhina ya atoom niŋ eetantake ya atoom. Aafasok pakan paka fa ancukaam fa fíyooy niŋ eeha inci inkaakaayi ha nene káyisan. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Inci fafakani ti pakani <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa niŋ lompo ti <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char>, pa inci inkaakaayi pa hipoñu. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Pupoñi aakati káapankin ñíkinii ancuk káfuliyoo ti énimaan kápiyesoonii ti ecaaŋ, nkáfulii lompo ti sempe sa siti <char style="w">Seetaani</char> kápiyesoonii ti Pútuun pa. Pupoñi lompo aakati káapankin ñíkinii ancuk umuuyen wa uteyii uponketee, nkataak káayenuma ti payenka Pútuun pa mpisampane ka kamma nkáyinane ti inci.'”<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakup ka kiti Póol kiti páhin pa piteyoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />Póol nene asok: “Amansa yuu, fiye, waah wa wéefulii wa ti inci patiila, ŋesut hipooku íhinu eeha nuusokaam ha. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Incóok káatuunan pakati Damas, pakati <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, pakati mah ma miti <char style="w">Judaay</char> púlooŋ niŋ <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char>. Insokii káwunko umuuyen wa uteyii kápiyesoonii ti Pútuun pa nkáhin páhin peenape peenapoole niŋ eloŋ eeyesane. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Eehuu hiwune <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkacokam ta inci iyyeniye ta ti hank ha hiti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>, nkaŋes himukuyam. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Pale Pútuun pa umpa ti hifaasuyam fo fíyooy, ekina ewune inci íyyemi eetantake ya atempo hátikin pakan paka púlooŋ, písik ti keemaka ka fo ti kéetinee ka. Sokut ukee waah fo ewwa <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa niŋ <char style="w">Móyiis</char> nkasoke wa nii efuutaako. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Kasok nii, <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa afaakallo, afaayeno lompo éeyaañee ya alitanee ti eket ya náatuunan pakanoo Pusuwif pa niŋ keeneetaat ka Pusuwif ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eti Pútuun pa eekaakaay ya kaacaaŋan pítinii.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piŋiino pa piti Póol Akilipa ápiyinan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Ta Póol naayeniye ta káakup kati asiiŋoolo, Festus náaceekii: “Aawuyaawuyo Póol! Aakalaŋaakalaŋ fo awwuyye!” <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Pale Póol naasokoo: “Eñaap yuu Festus, inci wuyiit. Kilim enka inci insoke ka kiti páni apan keetempiye tak. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Amansa ya Akilipa ásiyaasi ta infiyye enka inci iyyem ka ti hisoku, ekina ewune inci ínkup niŋ híyiinate hátikinoo. Híiniyaamhiini nii ámeyimeyi enkuu púlooŋ. Kaatuko kíhinutee ti piyolo.” <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Fiye, Póol naasok Akilipa: “Amansa yuu, fo áayinanaayinan ti enka <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa nkasoke ka? Méyimeyi nii áayinanaayinan!” <verse eid="ACT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Akilipa naasok Póol: “Fiye áalafiyaamlafi íhinu Akelecen toko fiye?” <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Póol naañahanoo: “Toko fiye niŋ ekina tom po hátikin, inci oopa ti kaluum Pútuun pa, sokut nii ti awe lamma pale keeyemaam ka púlooŋ ti káasiitan fíyooy, kati kacuk nii inci, fo ínfulaa ñiseel ña!” <figure style="fig" alt="Paul devant Festus, Akilipa et Pelenis pour se défendre" file="GW 193.jpg" size="col" loc="26:1-29" copy="Wade NT" ref="26:29">Póol hátikin Festus, Akilipa niŋ Pelenis kati asiiŋoolo </figure><verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Púful toko, amansa ya, ati hikaw ha, Pelenis niŋ keeyeniye ka pukolii nkalito. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Nkáfulii nkasokool: “Ayíin a aŋe, áhinut heenaput eeha efihiwun naakulee niŋ ekina tom naamukee.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Akilipa naasok Festus: “Niŋ asokut nii álafilafi <char style="w">Sesaal</char> ápihinoo kíiti, anti akatanee.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Hicoopuyee ha hiti Póol Room niŋ piteen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Ta nkacoke ta nii uñaŋaa pikaayu <char style="w">Room</char> ti mah ma miti Itali niŋ piteen, Póol niŋ pakakee keekulee nkañomanee akee áhampaatiin asoocaali ati Room aŋa nkasok Yuliyus, éefulii ti himpaac ha hiti pusoocaali pa keeyem ka ti páhin ti amansa ya enfakat a ati Room. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Núuyuuko neyii ti piteen penfakat péefulii ti saatee ya eti Atalamit peeyeniye pikaayu ti úsik wa uti mah ma miti Asii, púful toko nuuñak. Alistaak ati mah ma miti Masetoni eekine ya ti saatee ya eti Tesalonik naanapool niŋ unii. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Eti kacom eteyyo nuuciŋ ti saatee ya eti Siton. Yuliyus naanap ti Póol, naakatanoo apikaay hiyoop pákawiyoo kati kayankananoo ti waah óo waah ewwa naasoolahe. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Upúful toko nuuñak. Nuuyesan epees yaamay econ ya eti Siip épikinkan unii ti hiyam ha, kamma nihiyeniye ésapii toonii. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Nuufiitan kaatii ka keeyem ka púcoonool mah ma miti Silisi niŋ Panfili nuucol ti saatee ya eti Mila ti mah ma miti Lisi. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Ta núuyuukinoyii ta, áhampaatiin a asoocaali ya naacuk piteen penfakat péefulii ti saatee ya eti Alesantili peeñaŋe pikaayu Itali, náayuuk unii.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Fo kunoom, piteen pa mpiyeno pikaayu caahinkiŋ caahinkiŋ, nuutaak páciite penfakat le niŋ efuulohan saatee ya eti Kanit. Páawoo hiyam ha hikitaakit unii kaacoonool, nuumuus éñuut ya eti Salmone nuuyesan epees yáali econ ya eti Kilet épikinkan unii ti hiyam ha. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Nuuyeno pinaaco niŋ econ ya niŋ páciite penfakat. Nuucol lakeenaay la nkasok Usík Weewalla, pukol saatee ya eti Lase.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Fo le, pítin pa piti kaakaawool ka kutoonii mpifiyo meemak fo fala suŋ ya eti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa neemuuse: etiil ya néelohanii ta kaatii ka nkíciiti ta kaafiitan. Kaatii ka nkihaŋ toko nkíliiñoole, fiye piteen pa piyinaat himuusu ti kásuumaay. Tempo wune Póol náakupananii: <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Pákawiyam, cukaamcuk nii kaakaawool ka kutuunaa éfikiciiti, nkitaak púpuco niŋ hípuulu. Sokut lamma nii piteen pa putuunaa niŋ aŋa mpúyuuke ya éfikapucaloolo, pale núuwasumutaa lompo efuuketaa.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Háati eeha Póol naasoke ha, áhampaatiin a asoocaali ya naahaŋ naacoke kilim ka kiti ateteyana ya niŋ ati piteen pa. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Páawoo kásik enkuu taapala kinap ti etiil, ekina ewune keecoone ka upuhankan pítin pa nkahaŋ pameeŋ. Nkálafi hiciŋu niŋ éfikayini ti kikee kásik kiti Kilet enka nkasok Fenis keecoonoole pa caanak ca incinow pa. Usík úsupak utaakiye toko, kikee ka ti epees yaamay, kikee ka ti epees yáali. Nkálafi pikaayu kati cakayeno toko fo ti hasa.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kúsuh ka keehiñe ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Eyam neesap épufulii epees yaamay, incukii nii éfikayini hicolu pa nkayem pa ti pikaayu, nkáñakii lankaloo ya nkanaaco econ ya eti Kilet. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Fiyiit hítaapanu eyam eyya nkasok “Elakilon” néefulii épuwanoonii ti pítintiŋ pa piti econ ya. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Hiyam ha nihicoop piteen pa putoonii, piyinaat pikaayu, fiye nuukatanoolo neeho. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Nuucol ti cicon enca nkasok Kota, nuuyesan co epees yáali cípikinkan unii caahinkiŋ ti hiyam ha, niŋ páciite penfakat núuhin kata fo úfulanii citeen ca citi kafakan ka ti man ma núuyuuk co. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Upupa, keeyem ka ti páhin ti piteen pa nkacoop ñikopu nkapoonanool piteen pa kapipenan po sempe. Nkawanan lankaloo ya eyya nelent ya épikaasin katey ka kiti piteen pa, kamma nkafeye timpi pilaay ti pufaah pa peeyem pa pukol mah ma miti Libiya. Fiye, nkakatan hiyam ha hipicoop unii. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Eti kacom eteyyo, hítaapanu eyam ya neeloŋ ti hisapu meemak ti piteen pa fo nkawantal ti kaatii ka aŋa mpúyuuke ya. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Eti tanta eteyyo, poko himuumii, nkawantal wañ ewwa nkásikool wa newwo. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Kunoom keemeeŋe ucukut caanak ca niŋ picaaŋaŋ pa, hiyam ha nihiloŋ ti hisapu. Ti pikelan, núuwusen nii etuufak. <figure style="fig" alt="un violent vent souffle sur la pirogue" file="GW 194.jpg" size="col" loc="27:18-20" copy="Wade NT" ref="27:20">Hítaapanu eyam éesapii ti piteen pa</figure><verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />An aliit fo ta infiyye, fiye Póol naasiiŋo hátikinii naasokii: “Pákawiyam, niñaŋaam-ñaŋ hínum káasiitan ta inci insoke ta aluu timpi ukatanaa Kilet. Anti nifakanee ti púpuco empe niŋ ti hípuulu eehe. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Pale fiye, inci pusok aluu, timpi níwusen, an taaluu átapuul ti eloŋ ya eteyoo, piteen pa lamma éfipupucaloolo. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Kaatuko hánant ha heemuuse ha <char style="w">maleekoo</char> néefulii ti inci, éefulii pati Pútuun pa empa inci iyyem pa tempo, íntuul po. <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />Neesokam: 'Timpi fe Póol kaatuko aafasiiŋo hátikin <char style="w">Sesaal</char>, amansa ya enfakat a ati Room. Síitan, Pútuun pa ti panap etempo ti awe, pifakanaafakan an óo an aŋa inniyem ti piteen pa.' <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Ooto pákawiyam, timpi níwusen, kaatuko inci taakaataak káyinan ti Pútuun pa nii efihitaako samat nii fa mpusokaam fa. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Pale piteen pa efipilaay ti ekee econ.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Hánant ha heewase ha ŋaasuwan niŋ kipaakiil, hiyam ha nihiloŋ unii ti hicoopu ti kaatii ka kiti Mediterane.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta Luk naakiice ta eehe, “kaatii ka kiti Atiliyatik” naakiice. Kaatii ka kiti Atiliyatik ti kaatii kiti Mediterane nkiyem.</char></note> Mpisit, keeyem ka ti páhin ti piteen pa incukii nii ulohanaalohan kantant. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Nkacenk ekumpa niŋ nikopu nkawant yo ti man ma kapiniik pásune pa. Nkacuk nii pásune pa máamun simeetal áwii ésupak (40). Nuuteeŋo hátikin, nene kawant nikopu na nkacuk nii pásune pa máamun simeetal áwii niŋ ŋaasuwan (30). <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Ti pikaayu empuu, nkafe pucukii nii efikalooŋ énankiin, fiye nkawant silankaloo sipaakiil puson piteen pa nkaluum cipilap.<verse eid="ACT 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Fiye, keeyem ka ti páhin ti piteen pa nkálafi hikatu toko piteen pa kapifakanoolo, nkawanan citeen ca citi kafakan ka kápihin fiye nii pikaayu kapenan pilankaloo hátikin piteen pa. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Pale Póol naasok áhampaatiin a asoocaali ya: “Niŋ payenkuu kakaayaa, aluu étiniyiniyee kafakanee!” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Fiye, pusoocaali pa nkafiital ñikopu ña ñiti citeen ca citi kafakan ka, nkakatan co cipikaay.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Ulap wa, Póol naaluum an óo an apili, naasokii: “Niyenaayeno hítuulu niŋ ewatate, fo sílookuŋ súsupak niliit waah. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Káluma nili, nisoolahaa-soolah hili kati niloŋ. Háati oonool ti aluu átapuul kaahanoo koonool kiti hikawoo.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Ta naapaye ta hisoku eehuu, naacoop hímpuul naasok Pútuun pa apalaka hátikinii púlooŋ naafiit ho náayaañ ali. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Ti oom káasiiŋuma, an óo an púsusoo mpulum naali lompo. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Unii keeyeniye ka ti piteen pa uyema sikeme súsupak niŋ áwii éhaaciil niŋ kaat niŋ oonool (276). <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Ta nkaliye ta kapisiit, nkákaasin panape piteen pa ti kaawantal paliyal pa ti kaatii ka.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Píhipo pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Cipilap, keeyem ka ti páhin ti piteen pa kakiiwut la nuuyeniye la pale nkaŋantan poloŋ éefuke ti kantant, nkálafi niŋ éfikayini kaataasan toko piteen pa. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Fiye, nkákopin pilankaloo pa, nkakatan po ti kaatii ka. Nkákopin lompo ékusu ya éŋaapooluma ya. Fiye, nkasiiŋan kaafaal eyam hátikin piteen pa, hiyam ha kati hicoop unii. Nuuhiiŋ pati kantant ka. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Pale nuucol ti efaah enfakat, piteen pa mpilaay, hikaw etempo nihiloco, piyinaat piteeŋo. Kúsuh ka nkihiñ nkúpucalool puson etempo.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Pusoocaali pa nkálafi himuku keekulee ka ancuk an teyii timpi awac apifakii. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Pale áhampaatiin a asoocaali ya náalafi kafakan Póol, akatanutii kápihin eeha nkálafiye ha. Fiye, naawufan hilim nii keeyina ka kaawac káyaañ kanuut ti man ma kapifiitan. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Pakakee paka nkacok ti pupapaloo niŋ ekina tom ti upenc wa uti piteen pa nkanapanii. An óo an teyii, fiye naafake ti kásuumaay.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Póol ti econ ya eti Malta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Ta nuufake ta upuciŋ, nkasok unii nii econ ya nesokee Malta. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Keekine ka toko nkawanan unii pawananal peenape empa núuninkoolut nempo. Nkacokan seemak senfakat nkayonkal unii písimo kamma neeyeniye hinup immon. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Póol naayesal miyaac kati awant mo ti seemak sa. Fiye, kaafepa nkúfulii temmo kamma pasowe pa, nkulumoo ti epees nkínintoolo teyyo. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Ta pakati econ ya nkacuke ta fa kaafepa ka nkínintooliye fa ti epeesoo, nkasokool: “Híinihiini unaa nii áyiin aŋe amukala pakan. Háati áfakiyoofak ti kaatii ka, pale pútuun pa putuunaa peeyaale pa empa nkasok pa 'Ahína Kíiti <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">Eecoonoole</char>' etipucoonoo eloŋ.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Pale Póol naayoŋ epeesoo, kaafepa ka nkunow ti seemak sa apan waah úhinutoo. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Pakati econ ya nkayeno káamiilool manti anaay, niŋ ekina tom naanow naaket tokotoko. Pale nkakampan ti hítuulu kacukut waah núuhinoo, nkayesan pámiiloolalii ti hisoku nii áyiin a aŋe, akee ti ñútuun ña ñiteyii.<figure style="fig" alt="Paul a remué son bras pour se séparer du serpent qui l’a mordu dans le feu" file="GW 196.jpg" size="col" loc="28:3-6" copy="Wade NT" ref="28:6">Póol naayoŋ ti seemak sa kaafepa ka keelumoo ka</figure><verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Pukol toko, intaak etaam eti áhampaatiin a ati econ ya, caacawoo Pupuliyus. Naawanan unii pinapnap, nuuyeno la teyoo fo kunoom káhaaciil. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Eehe nihitook paapaa ateyoo kahint kamma káakuuñu kiti pasowe-enii, munowoo lompo katey meemak. Póol naakaay pateyoo naalemp sipeesoo teyoo naaluum náakuuñanoo. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Ta eehuu nihitaakiye ta, kéekuuñe ka púlooŋ keekine ka ti econ ya nkákey ti Póol, naalompo ákuuñanii. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Nkámakiyan unii meemak. Ta nuuñaŋe ta hiñaku, nkawufan unii aŋa nuusoolahe ya púlooŋ ti kaakaawool ka.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hicolu ha hiti Póol Room</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Nuutaak kiim káhaaciil ti econ ya eti Malta, ti pikelan núuyuuko ti piteen penfakat empa ammeya nii, etiil ya toko neepaye po. Piteen empuu péefulii ti saatee ya eti Alesantili, hátikin etempo mpitaak énaati eyya nkasok “Máasupak ma miti Sás.” <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Núuful Malta, nuuciŋ ti saatee ya eti Silakus, nuuyeno toko kunoom káhaaciil. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Púful toko, nuunaaco kantant ka niŋ piteen pa nuucol ti saatee ya eti Lekiyo. Eti kacom eteyyo, eyam néeyaañ ésapii épufulii puson unii; eti tanta eteyyo, nuucol ti saatee ya eyya nkasok ya Pocol. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Nuutook toko pakakee kéeyinane, nkasok unii uyeno neyii fo lóokuŋ. Fiyuu nuukaaye <char style="w">Room</char>. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Kéeyinane ka keeyem ka po kápisi kutoonii, pakakee nkákey kapaakoolan unii la nkasok la “Malse ya eti Apiyus”, pakakee paka la nkasok la “Sikumpaan Síwananuma <char style="w" lemma="Akaawoola">Ekaawoola</char> Síhaaciil”. Ta Póol naacukii ta, naasok Pútuun pa apalaka, púsusoo mpulum.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Ta nuucole ta Room, nkakatan Póol apiyeno ti ekumpaan lamayoo niŋ asoocaali aŋa afaafaasoo.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakup ka kiti Póol Room</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Kunoom káhaaciil kupumuus, Póol náayonkalii ñíhampaatiin <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa pakati <char style="w">Room</char>. Ta nkáconcoolii ta naasokii: “Pakanam, laahut pakan unaa, hínut héeciita ti cosaan ya eti símaama unaa. Pale nkacokam <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> nkawufanam pakati Room. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Payenkuu nkacakanoolam nkálafiyam kakatan kaatuko kacukut heewune kati mukee. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Pale Pusuwif pa kacoonut; fiye, inci míit fa inci fáhin, insokii nii láfilafi <char style="w">Sesaal</char>, amansa ya enfakat a ati Room, ápihinam kíiti. Pale neetaat hisoku kati nook pakan unaa. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Eehuu hiwune inci iŋŋes hicuku niŋ káakup niŋ aluu. Nímeyimeyi ayme pakati <char style="w">Israyel</char> nkáhine ya cíki kati afakanii? Ee! Ekina ewune nkacenkam niŋ ñiseel eññe kamma inci lompo ínhine cíki teyoo.” <verse eid="ACT 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Ñíhampaatiin Pusuwif pa nkañahanoo: “Usayut háati leetal éefulii ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Judaay</char> éekupe kitii. An unaa áfuliyoot po naakaman niŋ ekina tom naasok unii héeciita ti awe. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Pale úlafilafi aapikaman unii eeha ámmiiloole. Kaatuko úmeyimeyi nii pan óo pan, pakan paka kapookaapook pítin pa empa ayyem pa tempo.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Fiye, nkasiiŋan hinoom eeha efikacukool niŋ Póol. Ta hinoom ha níhicolii ta, hícump pakan nkákey ti ekumpaan ya la Póol naayeniye la. Písik mpucom fo nkániim naayeniyii kakaman niŋ káatuunan kiti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>. Naacok ti <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char> niŋ ti pakiical pa piti <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa, apiŋes íhinuyii kápiyinan ti Yéesu. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Pakakee teyii nkáyinan kamma kilim enka naasoke ka pale pakakee paka káyinanut. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Páawoo kásiyoolut poko faŋii, ta nkayeniye ta pikaayu, Póol nene apenanii hisoku eehe: “<char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> kusokaasok pánipani ya, ta nkúkupe ta niŋ símaama aluu pínapii ti ayaamakoola ya <char style="w">Esayi</char>:<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />
    <char style="qt">'Kaay ti síi eyye insokii:</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">
    <char style="qt">"Efínisiitan pitempo tak</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">
    <char style="qt">pale étinisi;</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">
    <char style="qt">efinisincan pitempo tak,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">
    <char style="qt">pale etinicuk."</char>
    <verse eid="ACT 28:26" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />
    <char style="qt">Kaatuko pakan paka payenke,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">
    <char style="qt">kapankaapank kunuuwii,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">
    <char style="qt">nkacot unuuwii,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">
    <char style="qt">nkámif ñíkinii.</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">
    <char style="qt">Káhinaahin eehuu ancuk</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">
    <char style="qt">timpi kacuk niŋ ñíkinii,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">
    <char style="qt">timpi kási niŋ unuuwii,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">
    <char style="qt">timpi kámeyi lompo niŋ kunuuwii,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">
    <char style="qt">étikayesoonii lipe ti inci Pútuun pa,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">
    <char style="qt">inci kati kúuñanii.'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Esayi 6:9-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>”<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Póol naahankan ti hisoku: “Ooto, niñaŋaa kameye nii, Pútuun pa pupoñaapoñ ekooŋan etempo eti kafakan ka ti <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char>. Poko éfikasiitan.”<verse eid="ACT 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Póol sitiil súsupak naayeniye lati ekumpaan eyya naayeniye ya teyyo lúwaas, nawanan payenka púlooŋ nkákeyyoo ka hiyoop. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Náatuunan cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa, naakalaŋan kiti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Yéesu Krista niŋ híyiinate, an akitutoo.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>